、`HEAD`、`OPTIONS` 以外）和 WebSocket，如果带 `Origin`，它必须是页面自己的来源或列在 `server.allowed_origins` 中，否则返回 403 `bad_origin`；没有 `Origin` 但 `Sec-Fetch-Site` 表明是跨站请求时同样拒绝。curl、Python 等非浏览器客户端不带这些头，不受影响。`server.allowed_origins` 非空时服务器还会为这些来源开启 CORS。","locale":"zh-CN"},"177":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-175","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"**访问令牌。** 设置了 `server.access_token` 时，`/api/`、`/ws/`、`/v1/`、`/openapi.json` 和 `/docs` 下的每个请求都要带上令牌，否则返回 401 `auth_required`。唯一的例外是 `GET /api/v1/app/health`。令牌可以用以下任一方式提供：","locale":"zh-CN"},"178":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-176","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"179":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-177","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"180":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-178","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"Bearer 头","locale":"zh-CN"},"181":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-179","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"`Authorization: Bearer <令牌>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"182":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-180","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"Cookie","locale":"zh-CN"},"183":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-181","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"`mizuoto_token=<令牌>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"184":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-182","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"查询参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"185":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-183","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"`?token=<令牌>`（浏览器里的 WebSocket 无法加请求头时使用）","locale":"zh-CN"},"186":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-184","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags"