url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"识别、导入服务器上的模型文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"197":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-195","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"`POST /voices/{id}/weights`","locale":"zh-CN"},"198":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-196","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"从服务器路径添加音色的微调权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"199":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-197","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"`POST /datasets/{id}/import`","locale":"zh-CN"},"200":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-198","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"把服务器上的一个文件夹导入数据集","locale":"zh-CN"},"201":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-199","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"`POST /outputs/{id}/reveal`","locale":"zh-CN"},"202":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-200","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"在文件管理器中显示结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"203":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-201","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"`POST /engines/{id}/ops/{op}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"204":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-202","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"引擎专属操作（参数可能指向服务器文件）","locale":"zh-CN"},"205":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-203","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"其中浏览和登记的路径还必须位于 `paths.browse_roots` 之内（留空时为主文件夹、数据文件夹和所有驱动器/卷）。远程客户端请改用上传：`PUT /audio/files`，或按角色上传权重 `PUT /voices/{id}/weights/{engine}/{role}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"206":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-204","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"耗时的操作（合成、下载、训练、项目生成……）返回一个任务（Job），而不是等它完成：","locale":"zh-CN"},"207":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-205","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"`state` 依次经过 `queued`、`waiting`（等待 GPU、引擎或其他资源，`waiting_for` 说明在等什么）、`running`，最后是 `completed`、`failed`、`cancelled` 或 `interrupted`（服务器在任务运行中退出）。完成后 `result` 中有结果，失败时 `error` 有 `code`、`message`、`detail`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"208":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-206","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"209":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-207","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"210":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-208","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"查询","locale":"zh-CN"},"211":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-209","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"`GET /api/v1/jobs/{id}`；列表 `GET /api/v1/jobs?state=active`","locale":"zh-CN"},"212":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-210","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"213":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-211","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"`GET /api/v1/jobs/{id}/log?offset=0`（返回 `lines` 和 `next_offset`，下次从这里继续读）","locale":"zh-CN"},"214":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-212","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"取消","locale":"zh-CN"},"215":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-213","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"`POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/cancel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"216":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-214","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#任务","content":"重试","locale":"zh-CN"},"217":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-215","page_id":"