advanced-api#合成并下载","content":"`voice`、`voice_spec` 都不给时使用模型自带的音色（模型需支持）。只想检查请求而不运行，用 `POST /api/v1/tts/plan`，它返回分段、生效的参数和警告。请求中没有的顶层字段会被忽略（这样发送新版本字段的客户端仍能工作），并在警告中列出（“Ignored fields the request does not have: …”）：引擎选项应放在 `engine_options` 中，写成 `options` 会被忽略。音色转换和语音编辑会把这类字段记入日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"249":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-247","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#上传一段音频并克隆","content":"`PUT /api/v1/audio/files` 的请求体就是文件本身（不是 multipart），`name` 查询参数给出文件名。返回的 `id` 作为参考音频的 `audio_id`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"250":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-248","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#上传一段音频并克隆","content":"不给 `transcript` 时，若开启了 `tts.auto_transcribe` 且已下载语音识别模型，会自动识别；否则模型要支持无文本克隆。想长期使用这个音色，把它加进音色库（`POST /api/v1/voices`），之后用 `\"voice\": \"<id>\"` 引用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"251":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-249","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#事件","content":"服务器通过 socket.io 推送事件，挂在 `/ws`（socket.io 路径 `/ws/socket.io`）。推送只有服务器到客户端一个方向；所有操作仍走 REST，REST 的结果是准的，事件只用来及时刷新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"252":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-250","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#事件","content":"事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"253":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-251","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#事件","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"254":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-252","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#事件","content":"`job_updated`","locale":"zh-CN"},"255":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-253","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#事件","content":"`job`：任务的最新状态、进度、下载速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"256":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-254","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#事件","content":"`job_log`","locale":"zh-CN"},"257":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-255","page_id":"/docs/advanced-ap