d 或短名）；或模型的预置说话人；或 OpenAI 的音色名（`alloy`、`ash`、`ballad`、`cedar`、`coral`、`echo`、`fable`、`marin`、`nova`、`onyx`、`sage`、`shimmer`、`verse`），这些名字会落到模型自带的音色，模型没有自带音色时用它的第一个预置说话人。其他名字返回 404","locale":"zh-CN"},"307":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-305","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#兼容-openai-的接口","content":"`instructions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"308":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-306","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#兼容-openai-的接口","content":"只在模型支持 **指令** 时使用，否则忽略","locale":"zh-CN"},"309":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-307","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#兼容-openai-的接口","content":"`speed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"310":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-308","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#兼容-openai-的接口","content":"0.25–4；模型不接受语速时丢弃","locale":"zh-CN"},"311":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-309","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#兼容-openai-的接口","content":"`response_format`","locale":"zh-CN"},"312":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-310","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#兼容-openai-的接口","content":"`mp3`（默认）、`opus`（生成 ogg）、`aac`（生成 m4a）、`flac`、`wav`、`pcm`（24 kHz 单声道 16 位小端，无文件头）","locale":"zh-CN"},"313":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-311","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#兼容-openai-的接口","content":"`stream_format`","locale":"zh-CN"},"314":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-312","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#兼容-openai-的接口","content":"`audio` 且格式为 `wav` 或 `pcm` 时边生成边发送；`sse` 不支持","locale":"zh-CN"},"315":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-313","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#兼容-openai-的接口","content":"这个接口按宽松模式处理参数：模型不接受的参数被丢弃，而不是报错。错误采用 OpenAI 的格式 `{\"error\": {\"message\", \"type\", \"param\", \"code\"}}`，其中 `code` 是 Mizuoto 