ocs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"24 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"930":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-205","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"同 v2，另有 **发音控制**，没有 **长文本**","locale":"zh-CN"},"931":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-206","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**语言**：zh、en、ja、ko、yue；v3 为 zh、en、ja、ko、de、es、fr、it、ru、yue。","locale":"zh-CN"},"932":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-207","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**预置说话人**（v1 SFT / Instruct）：中文女、中文男、日语男、粤语女、英文女、英文男、韩语女。","locale":"zh-CN"},"933":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-208","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**行内标签**：v1 为 `[laughter]`、`[breath]`、`<strong></strong>`；v2 另有 `<laughter></laughter>`；v3 为 `[breath]`、`[laughter]`、`[cough]`、`[sigh]` 等 11 个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"934":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-209","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**参考音频**：1–30 秒，至少 16 kHz。","locale":"zh-CN"},"935":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-210","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**流式**：v2/v3 逐 token 流式输出；流式文本输入需要参考音频的文本（零样本克隆或 instruct2）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"936":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-211","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**训练**（GPU 或 CPU）：**Fine-tune the language model**（`llm`）和 **Fine-tune the LLM and the flow**（`llm_flow`），起点为 v1_base、v2、v3，按上游 LibriTTS 流程，至少 60 秒数据，导出为新模型。只训 LLM 时韵律与发音跟随数据集；连 flow 一起训时音色也跟随数据集。","locale":"zh-CN"},"937":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-212","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**共享文件**：`cosyvoice/wetext`（13 MB，把数字、日期和单位写成文字的文本规范化语法），随第一个模型一起下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"938":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-213","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**加载选项**：`fp16`（GPU 上用半精度：更快，结果略有不同）；`fused_projections`（CosyVoice 2 和 3，默认关闭）：快速模式，语言模型的 q/k/v 与 gate/up 投影各合并为一次乘法，在 GPU 上快 1–5%，此时音频可能不再与原始实现逐位一致（输出会列出 `fused_projections`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"939":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-214","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"流匹配语音合成，从一段短音频和它的文本克隆音色。适合：精确控制生成时长，以及只替换录音中的几处词句（语音编辑）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"940":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-215","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"941":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-216","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"942":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-217","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"大小","locale":"zh-CN"},"943":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-218","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"944":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-219","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"推荐","locale":"zh-CN"},"945":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-220","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"`f5tts/v1-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"946":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-221","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"F5-TTS v1 Base","locale":"zh-CN"},"947":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-222","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-en