:"/docs/cli#检查引擎下载模型合成","content":"检查引擎、下载模型、合成","locale":"zh-CN"},"2609":{"id":"/docs/cli-9","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#克隆与设计音色","content":"克隆与设计音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"2610":{"id":"/docs/cli-10","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#边生成边播放","content":"边生成边播放","locale":"zh-CN"},"2611":{"id":"/docs/cli-11","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#批量与参数","content":"批量与参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2612":{"id":"/docs/cli-12","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#转写转换与编辑","content":"转写、转换与编辑","locale":"zh-CN"},"2613":{"id":"/docs/cli-13","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"2614":{"id":"/docs/cli-14","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#项目","content":"项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"2615":{"id":"/docs/cli-15","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#shell-补全","content":"Shell 补全","locale":"zh-CN"},"2616":{"id":"/docs/cli-16","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#下一步","content":"下一步","locale":"zh-CN"},"2617":{"id":"/docs/cli-17","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"`mizuoto` 命令行能做网页界面能做的事：合成、克隆与设计音色、转换与编辑录音、语音识别、检查 torch 与引擎、管理模型、预设、项目、数据集与训练、远程主机、任务和设置。命令行只是一层很薄的外壳：每条命令解析参数，调用核心里对应的那**一个**方法，再把结果打印出来。网页界面背后的 HTTP 接口调用的也是同一批方法，所以两边的行为一致，`--json` 打印的记录与接口返回的 JSON 结构相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2618":{"id":"/docs/cli-18","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"本页介绍共同约定和常用流程；每条命令的选项见 命令参考，设置项与环境变量见 配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2619":{"id":"/docs/cli-19","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令一览","content":"任何一级都可以加 `--help`；只输入组名（如 `mizuoto model`）也会显示该组的帮助。每一级都接受 `--debug`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2620":{"id":"/docs/cli-20","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与网页界面的区别","content":"**任务在前台运行。** `speak`、`design`、`model download`、`train run`、`project render` 等会创建一个任务，并在当前终端里执行到结束；进度条显示在 stderr 上（只在 stderr 是终端时显示，`--json` 时关闭），下载会显示已下载量、速度和剩余时间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2621":{"id":"/docs/cli-21","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与网页界面的区别","content":"**Ctrl+C 取消任务。** 任务被标记为 **已取消**，引擎在下一次检查时停下（下一个 token 或下一步），训练阶段的进程被结束，命令以退出码 130 结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2622":{"id":"/docs/cli-22","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与网页界面的区别","content":"**不需要启动服务器。** 每条命令自己打开数据文件夹（设置、数据库、模型），执行完就关闭；引擎运行在命令自己的进程里，加载的模型随命令一起释放，所以每条 `speak` 都要重新加载一次模型。需要连续合成很多句时，用服务器（网页界面或 HTTP 接口）更快，那里模型会保留在内存中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2623":{"id":"/docs/cli-23","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#与网页界面的区别","content":"**命令行可以使用任何路径。** 网页界面只能读取 **浏览器可以打开的文件夹**（`paths.browse_roots`）里的服务器文件，而 `--ref`、`model import`、`dataset import` 等可以直接给出本机任意路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2624":{"id":"/docs/cli-24","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"列表和查询类命令默认打印表格；加 `--json` 打印 JSON，结构与对应接口返回的记录相同，适合脚本处理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2625":{"id":"/docs/cli-25","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"几处说明：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2626":{"id":"/docs/cli-26","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"`speak` 结束后逐行打印结果文件的路径、时长和采样率；结果总是保存在结果文件夹（并出现在 **历史** 中），`-o` 再复制一份到指定位置，扩展名决定格式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2627":{"id":"/docs/cli-27","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"`speak --json` 打印 `{\"job\": …, \"outputs\": […]}`：完成的任务和它生成的结果记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2628":{"id":"/docs/cli-28","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"`speak --plan` 只检查请求并打印将要执行的计划（模型、设备、音色模式、分段、参数），不运行任何东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2629":{"id":"/docs/cli-29","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"警告（例如被丢弃的模型不接受的参数）以 `warning:` 开头打印在 stderr 上，不会混入 stdout。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2630":{"id":"/docs/cli-30","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"命令出错时，先打印错误信息，如果错误带有修复建议，第二行打印建议的命令；退出码表示错误类别。错误码定义在 `mizuoto/core/codes.py`，每个错误类的退出码定义在 `mizuoto/core/errors.py`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2631":{"id":"/docs/cli-31","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"2632":{"id":"/docs/cli-32","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"错误码","locale":"zh-CN"},"2633":{"id":"/docs/cli-33","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"典型情况","locale":"zh-CN"},"2634":{"id":"/docs/cli-34","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"0","locale":"zh-CN"},"2635":{"id":"/docs/cli-35","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"成功","locale":"zh-CN"},"2636":{"id":"/docs/cli-36","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2637":{"id":"/docs/cli-37","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`internal_error`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2638":{"id":"/docs/cli-38","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"未分类的内部错误；确认提示时回答了\"否\"","locale":"zh-CN"},"2639":{"id":"/docs/cli-39","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"2","locale":"zh-CN"},"2640":{"id":"/docs/cli-40","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`not_found`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2641":{"id":"/docs/cli-41","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"模型、音色、任务、结果或引擎不存在。命令行参数写错（未知选项、取值超出范围）时 Click 也以 2 退出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2642":{"id":"/docs/cli-42","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"3","locale":"zh-CN"},"2643":{"id":"/docs/cli-43","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`conflict`、`busy`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2644":{"id":"/docs/cli-44","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"名称已存在；阶段正在运行；`webui` 找不到可用端口","locale":"zh-CN"},"2645":{"id":"/docs/cli-45","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"4","locale":"zh-CN"},"2646":{"id":"/docs/cli-46","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`invalid_input`、`invalid_path`、`capability_not_supported`、`parameter_not_supported`、`parameter_out_of_range`、`reference_invalid`、`language_not_supported`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2647":{"id":"/docs/cli-47","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"请求不合法：模型不支持这种音色模式或参数，参考音频太短或太长，语言不支持；`webui` 的证书文件不存在","locale":"zh-CN"},"2648":{"id":"/docs/cli-48","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"5","locale":"zh-CN"},"2649":{"id":"/docs/cli-49","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`licence_not_accepted`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2650":{"id":"/docs/cli-50","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"需要接受许可的引擎（Fish Speech、IndexTTS）还没有接受许可","locale":"zh-CN"},"2651":{"id":"/docs/cli-51","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"7","locale":"zh-CN"},"2652":{"id":"/docs/cli-52","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`model_missing`、`engine_not_installed`、`asset_missing`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2653":{"id":"/docs/cli-53","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"模型没有下载；引擎需要的包没有安装（torch，或许可受限引擎的 `mizuoto-fishspeech` / `mizuoto-indextts`）；共享文件缺失","locale":"zh-CN"},"2654":{"id":"/docs/cli-54","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"8","locale":"zh-CN"},"2655":{"id":"/docs/cli-55","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`device_unavailable`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2656":{"id":"/docs/cli-56","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"设备不存在或不可用，例如设备写成了不存在的远程主机名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2657":{"id":"/docs/cli-57","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"9","locale":"zh-CN"},"2658":{"id":"/docs/cli-58","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`compute_unavailable`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2659":{"id":"/docs/cli-59","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"没有可用设备，或 GPU 显存不足（`detail.reason` 为 `out_of_memory` 或 `no_device`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2660":{"id":"/docs/cli-60","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"10","locale":"zh-CN"},"2661":{"id":"/docs/cli-61","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`worker_failed`、`engine_error`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2662":{"id":"/docs/cli-62","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"训练阶段的进程或远程代理退出或不再响应；引擎内部抛出异常","locale":"zh-CN"},"2663":{"id":"/docs/cli-63","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"11","locale":"zh-CN"},"2664":{"id":"/docs/cli-64","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`timeout`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2665":{"id":"/docs/cli-65","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"操作超时","locale":"zh-CN"},"2666":{"id":"/docs/cli-66","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"12","locale":"zh-CN"},"2667":{"id":"/docs/cli-67","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`download_failed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2668":{"id":"/docs/cli-68","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"一个文件从所有下载来源都没能下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"2669":{"id":"/docs/cli-69","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"14","locale":"zh-CN"},"2670":{"id":"/docs/cli-70","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`remote_unavailable`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2671":{"id":"/docs/cli-71","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"远程主机连不上、拒绝了令牌或协议版本不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"2672":{"id":"/docs/cli-72","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"130","locale":"zh-CN"},"2673":{"id":"/docs/cli-73","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`cancelled`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2674":{"id":"/docs/cli-74","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"Ctrl+C 中断，或任务被取消","locale":"zh-CN"},"2675":{"id":"/docs/cli-75","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"缺少依赖包时的输出类似：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2676":{"id":"/docs/cli-76","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#调试与日志","content":"也可以用环境变量 `MIZUOTO_LOG_LEVEL` 设置日志级别（`DEBUG`、`INFO`、`WARNING`、`ERROR`，默认 `INFO`）。每个任务的完整日志保存在数据文件夹的 `jobs/<任务 id>.log`，用 `mizuoto job log <任务 id>` 查看；训练阶段的输出也写进其任务的日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2677":{"id":"/docs/cli-77","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"命令行和服务器可以同时打开同一个数据文件夹。它们是两个独立的进程，共享设置文件、数据库和各个文件夹：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2678":{"id":"/docs/cli-78","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"**设置**：`mizuoto config set` 写入 `settings.toml`，正在运行的服务器在约 1 秒内读到改动，网页界面随之刷新。服务器地址和端口要在下次启动服务器时生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2679":{"id":"/docs/cli-79","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"**任务**：命令行的任务也写进数据库，所以 `mizuoto job list` 能看到服务器的任务，网页界面的 **任务** 面板也能看到命令行跑过的任务。任务记录着运行它的进程；一个进程打开数据文件夹时，只把**已经退出的**进程留下的未完成任务标为 **已中断**，不会动另一个仍在运行的进程的任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2680":{"id":"/docs/cli-80","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"**GPU 不排队**：命令行的任务立即在自己的进程里运行，不进入服务器的 GPU 队列，并加载自己的一份模型。如果服务器已经把同一个模型加载在同一块 GPU 上，显存里会有两份；显存不够时任务以 `compute_unavailable`（退出码 9）失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2681":{"id":"/docs/cli-81","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"**已加载的模型**：`mizuoto runtime` 列出正在运行的服务器持有的模型（通过数据文件夹中的 `server.json` 找到服务器），`mizuoto runtime --unload [MODEL]` 在服务器上卸载它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2682":{"id":"/docs/cli-82","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"**取消**：`mizuoto job cancel` 只能取消本进程里的任务，对服务器正在运行的任务会报告 `Job … is not running`。要取消服务器的任务，在网页界面的 **任务** 面板里点 **取消**，或调用 `POST /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}/cancel`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2683":{"id":"/docs/cli-83","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#在服务器运行时使用","content":"`mizuoto job retry` 在前台重新运行一个失败、已取消或已中断的任务（它保存的请求会重新规划）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2684":{"id":"/docs/cli-84","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#检查引擎下载模型合成","content":"不带 `-m` 时使用设置 `tts.default_model`。`mizuoto model spec <模型>` 列出模型接受的音色模式、语言、通用参数和引擎选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2685":{"id":"/docs/cli-85","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#克隆与设计音色","content":"`-v` 接受音色的 id 或 slug（`mizuoto voice list` 的第一列）；名称里的中文会保留在 slug 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2686":{"id":"/docs/cli-86","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#边生成边播放","content":"`--stream` 把 WAV 写到 stdout，模型生成多少就写多少，适合接播放器：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2687":{"id":"/docs/cli-87","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#边生成边播放","content":"stdout 是终端时 `--stream` 会拒绝运行；结果仍然完整保存，路径打印在 stderr 上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2688":{"id":"/docs/cli-88","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#批量与参数","content":"`-p` 设置通用参数（`temperature`、`top_p`、`top_k`、`repetition_penalty`、`max_new_tokens`、`num_steps`、`guidance_scale`、`speed`、`duration`、`seed`、`text_normalization`、`segment_silence_ms`），`-O` 设置引擎自己的选项；值按 JSON 解析。模型不接受某个参数时默认丢弃并给出警告，加 `--strict` 则报错（退出码 4）；默认值来自 `tts.strict_params`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2689":{"id":"/docs/cli-89","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#训练","content":"所有训练都在 Mizuoto 自己的环境中运行；每个阶段是同一个 Python 的子进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2690":{"id":"/docs/cli-90","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-补全","content":"安装后重新打开终端即可补全命令、子命令和选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2691":{"id":"/docs/cli-91","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#下一步","content":"命令参考：每条命令的参数和选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2692":{"id":"/docs/cli-92","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#下一步","content":"配置与环境变量：设置项、环境变量和数据文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2693":{"id":"/docs/cli-93","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#下一步","content":"常见问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"2694":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","type":"page","content":"加速","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-acceleration","locale":"zh-CN"},"2695":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-0","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration","content":"不改变结果的提速：注意力分发（调用点、参照计算、策略、后端、结构化掩码、探测），compute.fast，compute.compile，解码步骤的 CUDA Graph，无同步采样，以及 CPU 的内存分配与线程绑定；哪些需主动开启的功能结果不逐位一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2696":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-1","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"哪些会改变结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2697":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-2","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-acceleration#注意力","content":"注意力","locale":"zh-CN"},"2698":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-3","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"调用点与参照计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"2699":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-4","page_id":"/doc