ion-166","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"固定的 SDPA 内核通过各自的 aten 算子调用，接手调用前先用 torch 自己的资格检查（`can_use_*_attention`）。可选包的内核直接调用：flash-attn 和 xFormers 自己注册算子和 autograd；SageAttention 没有反向传播，从不在 autograd 下使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2862":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-167","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"**后端链。** 指定的后端排在最前，然后是 `fast` 针对该调用的后端链，最后是调用点的参照计算：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2863":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-168","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2864":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-169","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"`fast` 的后端链","locale":"zh-CN"},"2865":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-170","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"CUDA，fp16/bf16，键有填充（`mask_info` 的 `keys` 只在一侧填充：预分配的缓存、填充的批）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2866":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-171","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"`flash`、`sdpa`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2867":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-172","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"CUDA，fp16/bf16，其他","locale":"zh-CN"},"2868":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-173","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"`sdpa`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2869":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-174","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"ROCm，fp16/bf16","locale":"zh-CN"},"2870":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-175","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"`flash`、`xformers`、`sdpa`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2871":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-176","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"fp32，或 XPU、MPS、CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"2872":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-177","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"`sdpa`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2873":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-178","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"**选择。** 每次调用用一个 `Call` 描述（设备类型、计算能力、精度、头维度、GQA、单个还是多个查询、长度是否相等、查询是否超过 1024 个、掩码类型、`mask_info` 的结构、自定义缩放、因果、dropout、是否需要梯度、是否正在捕获 CUDA 图），它可哈希，所以一个解码循环对每个 `(site, Call)` 只选择一次。后端在以下情况被跳过：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2874":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-179","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"探测表明它不能在该设备上运行（未安装、版本不对、没有内核、自检失败）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2875":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-180","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"调用需要它缺少的反向传播或 dropout；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2876":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-181","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"调用点拒绝量化的注意力（`approx_ok=False`：所有自回归模型的调用点，即 Qwen 解码器、IndexTTS 的 GPT、VoxCPM 的 MiniCPM、GPT-SoVITS 的 T2S、Fish Speech 的三个、Whisper 的），而该后端是近似的（SageAttention 2 和 3）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2877":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-182","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"它的约束拒绝该调用（设备、计算能力、精度、头维度、掩码、长度不等时的因果、缩放）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2878":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-183","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"正在捕获 CUDA 图而后端不是 `graph_safe`。捕获的内容包含注意力（VoxCPM 的局部扩散步、Fish Speech 的快速 Transformer、Qwen3-TTS 的码本预测器）；只有在捕获后用新输入回放、结果与对这些输入的即时调用相同时（RTX 3060，torch 2.8）才设 `graph_safe`：`sdpa`、`math`、`sdpa_flash`、`sdpa_efficient`、`sdpa_cudnn`、`flash` 2.8.3 和 `xformers` 0.0.32。SageAttention 1.0.6 也能捕获，但同一个后端也运行未检查过的 2.x，`sage3` 没有试过。在捕获中抛出异常的后端不会被标记为损坏：捕获失败，这一步改为即时运行，并在那里再试这个后端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2879":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-184","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"**训练中的确定性。** 后端的反向传播要么逐位重复（`deterministic`），要么在 torch 的确定性算法打开时重复（`deterministic_on_request`：FlashAttention，此时以 `deterministic=True` 调用；前向传播两种情况下相同；在 RTX 3060 上，不打开时 5 次运行的梯度每次都不同，打开时都相同），要么不重复（`sdpa` 的融合内核、xFormers、`sdpa_cudnn`）。阶段的注意力报告统计由不可重复的后端计算的、需要梯度的调用（`nondeterministic`），`train_perf.py --deterministic` 按阶段记录它们。在 `training.deterministic` 下，`training.attention = auto` 时阶段用 `math` 计算注意力，它可以重复。指定了后端时，在加速器上需要梯度的调用（`Call.deterministic`：模式是调用的一部分，所以开启前后的选择结果不会混用）会跳过所有反向传播不可重复的后端（`repeats`：不可重复时跳过指定的后端，然后是 `sdpa`），并由 `math` 在调用点的参考实现（通常就是 SDPA）之前结束后端链。不需要梯度的调用（tokens 阶段、冻结的部分）保留原来的链，CPU 也是如此，因为它的内核可以重复。此前 OmniVoice 在 `flash` 下的 float32 训练注意力交给 `sdpa`，两次运行得到的权重不同；现在交给 `math`，在两块 RTX 3060 上运行得到相同的权重（与指定 `sdpa` 时相同；与 `auto` 不同，因为 `auto` 的 tokens 阶段也用 `math` 计算）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2880":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-185","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"内核抛出异常（显存不足和取消除外）时，该后端对这种调用被标为损坏，由下一个后端接手。显存不足会向上传递给精确重试。每种回退按（调用点，后端，原因）只记录一次日志。请求的 `Run` 统计用了什么，有回退时输出会记录下来并带一条警告：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2881":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-186","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#结构化掩码","content":"融合内核以结构而不是稠密张量的形式接受掩码（flash：`cache_seqlens`、`cache_leftpad`、`window_size`；xFormers：右下对齐的因果掩码和局部掩码）。根据某种结构构造掩码的调用点，在稠密掩码之外再传 `mask_info=MaskInfo(keys, causal, window, padding)`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2882":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-187","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#结构化掩码","content":"`keys`：形状 `(batch, k_length)` 的布尔值，表示真实的键；`padding`：每行是一段连续的真实键时为 `right` 或 `left`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2883":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-188","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#结构化掩码","content":"`causal`：右下对齐（查询 *i* 能看到键 *j* 当 `j ≤ i + n_k − n_q`）；`window`：`j > i' − window`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2884":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-189","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#结构化掩码","content":"参照计算忽略它，使用稠密掩码，所以 `auto` 不受影响。Qwen 的 `mask_for` 返回 `Masked(dense, info)`；VoxCPM 的解码步骤、Seed-VC、GPT-SoVITS v4/v5 和 Fish Speech 的编解码器也提供各自的 `mask_info`。打开 `dispatch.DEBUG` 时（小型引擎的测试），每次调用都检查 `mask_info` 是否描述了它的稠密掩码；`MIZUOTO_TEST_ACCEL=count` 检查每个小型引擎和训练器的每个调用点都经过分发器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2885":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-190","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#探测与-doctor","content":"每个可选后端在策略第一次要在某个设备上用它时才导入它的包，然后检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2886":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-191","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#探测与-doctor","content":"版本：flash-attn ≥ 2.6；xFormers 不在 0.0.21–0.0.26 之间（大批次时出错），并且带有 C++ 内核（`_has_cpp_library`：为别的 torch 构建的 wheel 能导入但没有内核）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2887":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-192","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#探测与-doctor","content":"设备与计算能力；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2888":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-193","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#探测与-doctor","content":"**自检**：一个 1 × 2 × 64 × D 的 fp16 注意力，与 fp32 下 SDPA 的 math 内核比较，要求结果有限且误差不超过 2e-3（SageAttention 为 2e-2），这能发现为别的 torch 或 GPU 构建的 wheel。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2889":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-194","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#探测与-doctor","content":"结果按进程和设备缓存。`mizuoto doctor` 有一项 `acceleration` 检查结果：相关设置、每个包（从元数据读取，不导入它）、它能否在每块 GPU 上运行（有 GPU 时在子进程中运行 `python -m mizuoto.runtime.accel`），以及保留现有 torch 的安装命令（`--no-deps`；xFormers 固定为针对已安装 torch 构建的版本）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2890":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-195","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#探测与-doctor","content":"注册表、策略、回退、严格模式和绑定都在 CPU 上测试过：真实模型经过每个调用点（`auto` 下音频、指标和权重完全相同），可选后端的衔接代码则用计算相同数学的假包测试。在 NVIDIA 上（RTX 3090，torch 2.8，flash-attn 2.8.3，xFormers 0.0.32.post2，SageAttention 1.0.6），每个后端都在每个调用点记录下来的调用上、在每个引擎和每个训练器中检查过：结果及其决定。SageAttention 3（Blackwell）未检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2891":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-196","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"参照 ComfyUI `--fast` 的进程级 GPU 开关，由主机在运行时启动时设置一次，训练阶段在加载训练器之前设置（`features.apply`）；输出会列出它们（`params.fast`）。每一项都会改变结果；修改在下次启动时生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2892":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-197","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"功能","locale":"zh-CN"},"2893":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-198","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2894":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-199","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"`tf32`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2895":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-200","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"TensorFloat-32 矩阵乘法和 cuDNN 卷积（NVIDIA，Ampere 及以后）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2896":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-201","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"`fp16_accumulation`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2897":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-202","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"fp16 乘法以 fp16 累加（torch ≥ 2.7）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2898":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-203","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"`cudnn_benchmark`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2899":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-204","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"cuDNN 针对每种形状尝试内核","locale":"zh-CN"},"2900":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-205","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"`sdpa_reduced_precision`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2901":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-206","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"SDPA 的 math 内核以 fp16/bf16 自身精度求和（torch ≥ 2.5）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2902":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-207","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"`mizuoto.runtime.compile.Compiled` 把一个热点模块包进 `torch.compile(dynamic=True)`：不按形状分桶，新的长度不会触发重新编译。引擎调用 `compiled or module`，所以设置关闭时走的就是即时执行路径。该设置在每次加载时读取（`RuntimeOptions.compile`），对修改之后加载的模型生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2903":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-208","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"2904":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-209","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"编译的模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"2905":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-210","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"2906":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-211","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"DiT，或 E2 的 UNetT","locale":"zh-CN"},"2907":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-212","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"CosyVoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"2908":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-213","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"flow 估计器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2909":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-214","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"GPT-SoVITS v4、v5 Turbo","locale":"zh-CN"},"2910":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-215","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"CFM 估计器（每个加载的 SoVITS 模型，包括音色自己的）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2911":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-216","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"IndexTTS 2、2.5","locale":"zh-CN"},"2912":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-217","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"s2mel DiT 和 BigVGAN（加载选项 `use_torch_compile` 也会开启）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2913":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-218","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"VoxCPM","locale":"zh-CN"},"2914":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-219","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"局部 DiT","locale":"zh-CN"},"2915":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-220","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"Fish Speech S2 Pro","locale":"zh-CN"},"2916":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-221","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"解码步骤里的小运算，在它的 CUDA 图之内（见下）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2917":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-222","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"`Compiled` 是普通属性而不是子模块：状态字典和句柄都不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2918":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-223","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"编译或运行编译代码时的任何错误（没有 C++ 编译器、不支持的算子）都只记一次警告，此后改为即时执行；显存不足仍会抛出。在 MPS 上（`EAGER_DEVICES`）以及位于流式单元之上时，它按即时执行运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2919":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-224","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"它以其策略的 `trace_run` 追踪（编译出的图无法读取上下文变量）；策略不是 `auto` 时，同一时间只运行一个编译调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2920":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-225","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"wenet 的 `add_optional_chunk_mask` 在 `torch.compiler.is_compiling()` 下改用无分支的写法：它的 `.item()` 曾打断 CosyVoice 的图。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2921":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-226","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"Inductor 把生成的代码缓存在 `/tmp/torchinductor_<user>`。Docker 镜像中没有 C 编译器，所以在那里按即时执行运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2922":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-227","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"**结果不精确。** 在 CPU 上以 fp32 与即时执行相比，音频最大差异为：F5-TTS 9e-5，IndexTTS 6e-5，GPT-SoVITS 3e-5。CosyVoice 的梅尔谱差异在 5.7e-6 之内，但 HiFT 由 F0 驱动的声源把它放大到音频中约 1e-2（即时执行换一个线程数也是如此）。VoxCPM 的浮点差异可能改变语音结束的位置。模型加载后的第一个请求要付出编译时间（CPU 上 30 到 160 秒）；收益见性能记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2923":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-228","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"**Fish Speech S2 Pro** 编译的是解码步骤的几个部分，而不是一个模块（`mizuoto_fishspeech/fused.py`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2924":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-229","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"**编译的部分：**","locale":"zh-CN"},"2925":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-230","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"每层注意力前后的两半，慢速 transformer 的 36 层每一半共用一个编译图，快速 transformer 的 4 层共用另一个；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2926":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-231","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"缓存上的注意力；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2927":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-232","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"这一步的嵌入和输出头；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2928":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-233","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"采样的概率。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2929":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-234","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"**与图一起：** CUDA 图捕获编译后的内核，每帧约 1,950 个内核，而不是 5,900 个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2930":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-235","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"**随机性：** 采样不变（同一个生成器按同样顺序给出同样的均匀数）；只有与之比较的概率不同，所以生成的帧很快就会走向别处。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2931":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-236","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"**慢速注意力：** 键的长度每步增长，所以只把这一维标为动态。使用 `dynamic=True` 时头的维度也成了符号量，inductor 逐个元素以 float64 计算注意力的缩放：在 RTX 3060 上注意力比即时执行慢一倍；只把长度标为动态时快一倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2932":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-237","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"**何时使用：** 只在模型完整位于其设备上时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2933":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-238","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"**输出：** `applied[\"compile\"] = \"decoder\"`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2934":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-239","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"**实测：** 在 RTX 3060 上每帧快 1.15 倍（性能记录）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2935":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-240","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"GPU 上的自回归模型每一步要启动几千个小内核（Qwen3-TTS：每 80 毫秒一帧约 6 000 个），每次等待设备都会清空队列，于是 CPU 的启动时间和 GPU 的计算时间相加而不是重叠。现在每个解码器每帧（或每个 token）只等待设备一次；开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（默认开；仅 NVIDIA，ROCm 的 HIP Graph 未经验证）时，一步的内核捕获一次，之后一次性重放。图重放的正是即时执行代码启动的那些内核，参数相同，所以结果与即时执行逐位相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2936":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-241","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/graphs.py`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2937":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-242","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"**`Graphs`**：一个模型在一个设备上的图，带有自己的流和生成器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2938":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-243","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"`capture(fn, state, pool)` 先运行一次 `fn`（惰性初始化），恢复它改动的张量（`state`）和生成器，然后捕获。它自己调用 `capture_begin`/`capture_end`：`torch.cuda.graph` 的 `gc.collect()` 和 `empty_cache()` 每次捕获要花几十毫秒，而一个 24 层的步骤要捕获 25 次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2939":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-244","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"只有在 torch 2.14 之前，graphs 自己的生成器才在每次捕获时注册（`register_generator_state`）。从 2.14 起，捕获会自行注册它取随机数的每个生成器，这个调用成了已弃用的空操作，每次捕获都会给出警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2940":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-245","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"捕获之后，当前流等待捕获流：开始捕获时会在捕获流上重置生成器的 seed 和 offset 张量，第一次重放若抢在这些内核之前，就会从 offset 0 抽取随机数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2941":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-246","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"捕获失败时换上一个状态相同的新生成器（中止的捕获会让旧生成器无法再用），调用方改为即时执行；只记录一次日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2942":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-247","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"捕获失败后，即使捕获已经结束，它的错误也可能还挂在 CUDA 运行时里（torch 2.15、CUDA 13.2），由该线程下一次核函数启动后的检查报告一次（分配、复制、读回和同步都不会，`zero_()` 也没有）：`take_pending_error` 先做一点即时执行的工作（分配、从主机复制、核函数、读回），直到成功为止，并丢弃这次报告，让即时执行的回退干净地开始（`scripts/graph_failure_probe.py` 可检查某个 torch 版本需要哪种清理）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2943":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-248","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每次捕获还会注册设备的默认生成器并把它标为正在捕获；捕获失败时，结束捕获不会取消这个标记，此后在捕获之外从它取随机数都会报错（\"Offset increment outside graph capture encountered unexpectedly\"：不带生成器的 `torch.randn`、dropout、inductor 的基准测试），所有引擎都受影响，直到进程结束。`release_default_generator` 捕获一个不取随机数的核函数，让它的捕获重新开始并结束：种子和偏移都不变（`tests/runtime/test_graphs.py`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2944":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-249","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"`drawing(generator)` 把请求的生成器状态装进图自己的生成器，结束后写回，所以带种子的请求抽到的随机数与即时执行相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2945":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-250","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"**`LayerSteps`**：把一个层栈的单 token 步骤按两次注意力调用之间的每一段捕获为一个图，由每层的 `before`、`attend`、`after` 给出。注意力在图之间即时执行，作用于每步变长的键上，所以缓存和注意力内核都与即时执行相同；归一化、投影、旋转位置编码和 MLP 被重放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2946":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-251","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"**`DecoderSteps`**：用于 `QwenDecoder` 的 `LayerSteps`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2947":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-252","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"**`signature(modules)`**：权重所在的地址。图持有这些地址，所以用于整个放在设备上的模型，权重移动后丢弃。例外是流式单元留在锁页内存中的 `sequence` 句柄（`ModelHandle.graphable`）：图每步自己复制这些权重（见显存）。只有 Qwen3-TTS 用到它；其他解码器在限额下流式加载时已经受复制限制（约 12.4 GB/s），没有加速，VoxCPM 1.5 反而慢 2.2 倍，所以它们流式加载时以 eager 方式解码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2948":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-253","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"2949":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-254","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每步等待次数（之前 → 之后）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2950":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-255","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"捕获的内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2951":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-256","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"Qwen3-TTS（`qwen3tts/decode.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2952":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-257","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每帧约 35 → 1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2953":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-258","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"采样和 code predictor 的 15 步各一个图；talker 的步骤按注意力调用之间的每一段（`DecoderSteps`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2954":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-259","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"Fish Speech（`mizuoto_fishspeech/generate.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2955":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-260","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每帧约 22 → 1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2956":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-261","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"慢速步骤围绕其注意力（`LayerSteps`）；抽样和快速 transformer 为一个图；随已加载模型保留","locale":"zh-CN"},"2957":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-262","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"Fish Speech Drama 3（`mizuoto_fishspeech/drama3/steps.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2958":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-263","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每帧 1（即时执行时已是）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2959":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-264","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"码本塔围绕其 13 层的注意力，然后主干围绕其 10 个 softmax 注意力层（`Stretches`）；采样设置改变时重新捕获码本塔的图；专家流式加载时不用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2960":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-265","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"CosyVoice 2/3（`cosyvoice/llm.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2961":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-266","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每个 token 50–80 → 1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2962":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-267","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"单 token 步骤（`DecoderSteps`）和抽样，每种 EOS 掩码一个图；上游的 nucleus 循环在设备上重放（`nucleus_device`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2963":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-268","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"VoxCPM（`voxcpm/model.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2964":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-269","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每个 patch 3 → 1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2965":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-270","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每个注意力跨度和设置下整个 patch 一个图（`PatchDecoder`）；静态缓存随模型保留","locale":"zh-CN"},"2966":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-271","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"GPT-SoVITS（`gptsovits/t2s.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2967":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-272","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每步 2 → 1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2968":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-273","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"T2S 的单 token 步骤围绕每层的注意力，每种行数一组；采样即时执行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2969":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-274","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"IndexTTS（`mizuoto_indextts/gpt.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2970":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-275","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每个 beam 步约 10 → 1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2971":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-276","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"GPT-2 的单 token 步骤围绕每层的注意力；缓存、beam 重排和采样即时执行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2972":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-277","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"这些等待是用上游写法的精确等价形式去掉的（掩码赋值、列表下标、写入张量的 Python 标量、`.item()` 检查），停止标志每步只读一次。流正在捕获时跳过 `dispatch.DEBUG` 的掩码检查（它需要读回数据；预热时已检查过）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2973":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-278","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#无同步采样","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/sampling.py` 按 transformers 的顺序重现它的 logits 处理器（重复惩罚、最少新 token、屏蔽、温度、top-k、top-p），其中没有任何需要等待设备的操作：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2974":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-279","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#无同步采样","content":"**`multinomial1(probs, generator)`** 就是 `torch.multinomial` 自己的单样本算法 `argmax(p / Exp(1))`，只是去掉了它的两次合法性检查（每次都要等待设备）。在 CPU 和 CUDA 上得到同样的 id 和生成器状态；其他设备上调用 `torch.multinomial`。含 NaN 的概率记在一个张量里（`invalid`），调用方在那唯一一次等待时读取，届时抛出 `torch.multinomial` 的错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2975":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-280","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#无同步采样","content":"**`multinomial_draws(probs, n, generator)`**：不放回地抽取多个，`topk(p / Exp(1), n)`（IndexTTS 的 beam）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2976":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-281","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#无同步采样","content":"屏蔽掩码和 EOS 掩码每个设备只构造一次；`repetition_penalty_seen` 在已抽取 id 的掩码上施加惩罚，形状不再增长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2977":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-282","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#无同步采样","content":"共用的 Qwen 解码器在不需要 autograd 时，在 CPU 上把 q 和 k 一起归一化、一起旋转（在 GPU 上与 transformers 一样分开进行，除非投影已融合：CUDA 按张量大小安排归约，拼接后的归一化偶尔在最后一位不同），并在设备上的自检表明与 float32 上转的归一化逐位相同时使用 `F.rms_norm`（`_fused_norm_exact`：在较新 torch 的 CUDA 上以 bf16/fp16 计算时，一个内核代替八个）。调用方知道没有填充时，`mask_for(padded=…)` 跳过它的设备检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2978":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-283","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#无同步采样","content":"**合并投影**（`engines.qwen3tts.load_options.fused_projections`，关）在加载时把每层的 q/k/v 以及 gate/up 权重分别堆叠成一个线性层（`QwenDecoder.fuse`；是真正的 `ops.Linear`，仍可流式加载）。仅用于推理。cuBLAS 对更宽的矩阵会选用别的内核，所以在 CUDA 上结果不逐位相同；输出会列出 `fused_projections`。CosyVoice 2 和 3 为它们的 Qwen2 语言模型提供同样的选项（`engines.cosyvoice.load_options.fused_projections`）：在 RTX 3060 上用 fp32 时每秒音频快 1%，音频保持一致；用 `fp16` 时快 2–5%，音频会改变。OmniVoice 的解码器也试过合并，没有任何收益（它每一步都在整个序列上运行：大的乘法，合并不能加速），所以不提供（性能）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2979":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-284","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"`mizuoto/core/compute/cpu.py`（只用标准库）由主机在导入 torch 之前应用（建立运行时时调用 `cpu.apply`），并传给它启动的进程（`child_env`：训练阶段、任务进程）。两者都不改变结果。环境中已设置的变量优先；非 glibc 或非 Linux 系统上不起作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2980":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-285","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2981":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-286","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"Linux 上 `auto` 即","locale":"zh-CN"},"2982":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-287","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2983":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-288","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"`compute.cpu_allocator`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2984":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-289","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"`tuned`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2985":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-290","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"把 glibc 的 `mmap` 阈值固定为 32 MB，并保留最多 512 MB 空闲堆内存供复用（本进程用 `mallopt`，子进程用 `GLIBC_TUNABLES`）；torch 的大张量放在透明大页上（`THP_MEM_ALLOC_ENABLE`），但 `training.memory = lowest` 的训练阶段除外：AdamW 在内存中更新，每一步都要分配几 GB，每个大页都会卡在内核的内存整理上（慢 2.2 倍）。一次前向在每层都要分配和释放几到几十 MB 的张量，按 glibc 默认设置每次都重新映射，并由内核清零页面。`system` 保持默认","locale":"zh-CN"},"2986":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-291","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"`compute.cpu_threads`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2987":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-292","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"`cores`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2988":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-293","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"把 OpenMP 线程绑定到不同的物理核心（`OMP_PLACES=cores`、`OMP_PROC_BIND=close`）。交给调度器时，偶尔有两个线程共用一个核心，那个进程在整个生命周期里都慢三分之一。`off` 交给调度器（有其他繁忙程序共用这些核心时更好）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2989":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-294","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"**内存紧张时的大页**（2026-11-05 测得；Qwen3-TTS 1.7B，fp32，音频和权重每次都相同）：在一台服务器的 i9-9900K 上（8 核、31 GB、`defrag=madvise`，每次运行前填满页缓存，空闲不到 400 MB），开着大页时长用例慢 6–8%（预热后 143.5–149.7 秒，关闭时 135.6–138.0 秒），加载慢 2–5 秒，每轮有 188,000–297,000 次直接整理停顿，关闭时没有；在 125 GB 内存（其中 98 GB 是页缓存）的 Ryzen 9 5900X 上，CPU 微调开着大页时每步快 8%（7.4–7.5 秒对 8.0–8.2 秒），第一步（AdamW 的状态，13.6 GB 的零）最多慢 2 秒。以前测到的这部分状态的 12.6 秒就是同样的内存整理，而不是填零。`auto` 保留大页；用户文档说明了何时关闭它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2990":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-295","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#给引擎作者","content":"所有注意力都经 `accel.attention`，每个调用点一个 `Site`；上游手写的注意力作为调用点的 `reference`；掩码由结构构造时传 `mask_info`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2991":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-296","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#给引擎作者","content":"用 `multinomial1` / `multinomial_draws` 抽样，解码步骤中除每步一次之外不等待设备（不用 `.item()`、`tolist()`、写入张量的 Python 标量、掩码赋值）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2992":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-297","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#给引擎作者","content":"CUDA Graph：在固定张量上运行一步，仅当 `graphs.usable(device, runtime.options.cuda_graphs)` 且模型整个在设备上（`handle.loaded`；`handle.graphable()` 也接受流式加载的 `sequence` 句柄，实测只对 Qwen3-TTS 更快）时用 `Graphs` / `LayerSteps` 捕获，图随已加载模型保留，`signature` 变化时丢弃；在 `drawing(ctx.generator_for(device))` 中抽样。捕获和重放都要在 `torch.cuda.device(graphs.device)` 下进行：重放在当前设备的流上运行，所以模型在 `cuda:1` 上而当前设备是 `cuda:0` 时重放会因非法内存访问而出错（CosyVoice 在 2026-10-18 之前就是如此）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2993":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-298","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#给引擎作者","content":"对耗时且反复调用的模块用 `compile_module(module, runtime.options.compile, name)` 包装，调用 `compiled or module`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2994":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-299","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#给引擎作者","content":"验证：小型引擎在 CUDA 上开关图、故意让捕获失败、以及 `MIZUOTO_TEST_ACCEL=count` 下的音频都完全相同。见接入引擎和测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2995":{"id":"/docs/development-api","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"page","content":"HTTP API 与命令行","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api","locale":"zh-CN"},"2996":{"id":"/docs/development-api-0","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api","content":"FastAPI 应用怎样组装、安全中间件和错误怎样映射、事件怎样进入 OpenAPI 并生成 Web UI 的类型，以及怎样新增一个路由和一条命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2997":{"id":"/docs/development-api-1","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"应用：`create_app()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2998":{"id":"/docs/development-api-2","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#依赖depspy","content":"依赖：`deps.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2999":{"id":"/docs/development-api-3","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#安全中间件securitypy","content":"安全中间件：`security.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3000":{"id":"/docs/development-api-4","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#错误--httperrorspy","content":"错误 → HTTP：`errors.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3001":{"id":"/docs/development-api-5","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#路由的写法","content":"路由的写法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3002":{"id":"/docs/development-ap