evelopment-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"估算从不拒绝加载：放不下时部分加载、流式加载，最低限度也会尝试；只有真正分配失败才算错误，之后卸载所有 GPU 上的空闲模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3695":{"id":"/docs/development-design-159","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"与 ComfyUI 相同；估算来自文件大小，拒绝会挡住本来能运行的请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"3696":{"id":"/docs/development-design-160","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"流式加载用单元和层上的 forward 钩子临时替换 `param.data`，不改 `ops` 层的代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3697":{"id":"/docs/development-design-161","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"覆盖所有调用路径（`layer.forward_step`、`vae.decode`、自定义层），模型整体在设备上时没有任何开销","locale":"zh-CN"},"3698":{"id":"/docs/development-design-162","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"只有线性层和卷积层的权重流式加载，嵌入从不","locale":"zh-CN"},"3699":{"id":"/docs/development-design-163","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"码本嵌入常通过 `.weight` 直接读取（余弦搜索、`F.embedding`）；ComfyUI 同样只流式加载它的 ops 层","locale":"zh-CN"},"3700":{"id":"/docs/development-design-164","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"GPT-SoVITS 的 T2S 整体常驻设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"3701":{"id":"/docs/development-design-165","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"它的块经 `prompt` / `step` 直接读取融合的投影权重；模型只有 150 MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"3702":{"id":"/docs/development-design-166","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"只为部分解码器提供分块回退（ASR、GPT-SoVITS、F5-TTS 的 Vocos、Fish Speech 的编解码器、IndexTTS 2 的 BigVGAN、OmniVoice 的音频分词器、VoxCPM 的 VAE）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3703":{"id":"/docs/development-design-167","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"Qwen3-TTS 的编解码器本来就分块解码；CosyVoice 的 HiFT 带有贯穿全句的相位，分块会破坏它；其余都很短","locale":"zh-CN"},"3704":{"id":"/docs/development-design-168","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"训练前估算显存超出时只在日志里警告并给出能放下的预设，不拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"3705":{"id":"/docs/development-design-169","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"估算按方法和预设在一块 GPU（RTX 3090）上以配方默认批量校准；数据和其他 GPU 会使它偏离","locale":"zh-CN"},"3706":{"id":"/docs/development-design-170","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"训练显存工具只提供保持结果的手段和少数轻微改变结果的手段；不提供 Adafactor 或内存不足时拆分 micro-batch","locale":"zh-CN"},"3707":{"id":"/docs/development-design-171","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"后者改变训练配方，超出预设的承诺","locale":"zh-CN"},"3708":{"id":"/docs/development-design-172","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"`compute.max_resident_models` 全局限制常驻模型数（默认 3），最久未用的空闲模型先卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3709":{"id":"/docs/development-design-173","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"所有引擎的模型共用一个进程和它的内存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3710":{"id":"/docs/development-design-174","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"主机探测设备时不导入 torch：先问 nvidia-smi、rocm-smi / amd-smi 和平台信息，只在 torch 的构建可能看到工具漏掉的 GPU 时才用子进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"3711":{"id":"/docs/development-design-175","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"列出设备、提供界面不应付出导入 torch 的一两秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"3712":{"id":"/docs/development-design-176","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"CUDA 图默认开启；`torch.compile` 默认关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"3713":{"id":"/docs/development-design-177","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"CUDA 图重放同样的内核，结果相同；编译会改变浮点结果且首次请求要付出编译时间","locale":"zh-CN"},"3714":{"id":"/docs/development-design-178","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"注意力的 `causal` 采用 SDPA 的 `is_causal`（左上对齐），右下对齐经 `MaskInfo` 表达；dropout 用 torch 的默认生成器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3715":{"id":"/docs/development-design-179","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"每个调用点按上游原样传 `is_causal`，CosyVoice 的流式文本步骤依赖左上对齐；唯一带 dropout 的调用点（GPT-SoVITS T2S 训练）调用的是 SDPA 自己","locale":"zh-CN"},"3716":{"id":"/docs/development-design-180","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"推理时注意力策略按请求的每一步绑定；训练阶段在整个进程里绑定","locale":"zh-CN"},"3717":{"id":"/docs/development-design-181","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"autograd 在自己的线程上运行反向传播和检查点的重算","locale":"zh-CN"},"3718":{"id":"/docs/development-design-182","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"外部注意力内核直接调用，不包装成 Mizuoto 自己的 `torch.library` 自定义算子","locale":"zh-CN"},"3719":{"id":"/docs/development-design-183","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#运行时与内存","content":"flash-attn 和 xFormers 自己注册算子和反向；SageAttention 没有反向，从不在 autograd 下使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3720":{"id":"/docs/development-design-184","page_id":"/docs/development-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-design#任务接口与数据","content":"决策","loc