engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"`describe()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3849":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-90","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"3850":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-91","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"返回 `Description`：采样率、能力、说话人、语言、显存、`ignored_params`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3851":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-92","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"`synthesize(task, ctx)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3852":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-93","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"3853":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-94","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"生成器：每准备好一段就 `yield AudioChunk(samples, sample_rate, segment, final)`，每一步都调用 `ctx.check_cancel()`；把实际使用的值记进 `ctx.applied`，警告用 `ctx.warn()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3854":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-95","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"`prepare_voice(voice, cache_dir, ctx)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3855":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-96","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"把派生的音色状态（提示码、嵌入）写进 `cache_dir`，以 `VoiceCache(files, meta)` 返回；之后的请求在 `VoiceSpec.cache` 里拿到这些文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3856":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-97","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"`convert(task, ctx)`、`edit(task, ctx)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3857":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-98","page_