-300","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"**慢速层的 eager 注意力，在 300 个位置时每帧约 6 毫秒**，随上下文变长而增加。600 个键时，一次调用在 22 个内核里占 330 微秒设备时间：增长缓存的 `cat`、从 8 头到 32 头的 `repeat_interleave`、数学内核对键的缩放副本、两次乘法以及把掩码转成加性掩码。在 3060 上检查了三种精确改写，在长度 150 到 1,280 上与当前调用逐位比较：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4439":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-301","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"不传掩码（这一步的掩码全为真）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4440":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-302","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"原地写入缓存；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4441":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-303","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"让缓存保持展开为 32 头。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4442":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-304","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"前两种节省约 5 % 的注意力时间（不到一帧的 1 %）。第三种节省约 20 %（300 个位置时约为一帧的 2 %，1,200 个位置时 7 %），但在设备上要多存四倍的键和值。三种都没有采用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4443":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-305","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"`compute.compile`（可选，不精确；加速）在同样的 CUDA 图里把这些小内核融合起来。显卡和条件相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4444":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-306","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"用例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4445":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-307","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"默认","locale":"zh-CN"},"4446":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-308","page_id":"/docs/development