performance-645","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"4.1 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4784":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-646","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"4.7 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4785":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-647","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"15.2 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4786":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-648","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"其余八个用例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4787":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-649","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"2.5–5.4 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4788":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-650","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"最多多 1 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4789":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-651","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"（新进程中的第一个请求，包括加载）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4790":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-652","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**最小显存**：每个模型都能在 4 GB 的卡上运行，包括 Fish Speech S2 Pro（方案的目标是 8 GB）。在两块 GPU 都忙时，0.2.5 的代码有一次在 6 GB 下运行 Fish Speech 时显存不足；之后又运行两次都没有再出现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4791":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-653","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**有主机副本时卸载**用时 0.05–0.12 秒，没有传输。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4792":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-654","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**重新加载**达到 5.7–8.3 GB/s，即锁页带宽的 43–62 %，未达到方案的 80 %：主机副本是可分页内存（`pinned_bytes` 为 0），逐个张量拷贝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4793":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-655","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**GPU 运行时的设置。** `compute.cpu_allocator` 和 `compute.cpu_threads` 对预热时间和加载时间的影响都在波动范围之内（交错两轮，四个引擎）。CUDA 分配器中，`expandable` 给出相同的音频和权重，保留的显存略少；`async` 使每个使用 CUDA Graph 的引擎崩溃（捕获后非法内存访问）：现在在它之下不捕获 CUDA Graph（`graphs.usable`），可以运行且结果相同，但没有了 CUDA Graph 的速度（Fish Speech 3.1 → 7.3 秒，Qwen3-TTS 1.3 → 2.0 秒）。训练阶段现在无论主机是否已加载模型，都会在环境中得到分配器设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4794":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-656","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**长文本的工作内存**（约 30 秒语音，整体加载；之后已校准：显存估算）：每个语言模型都远在估计值之内（2–64 %），但解码器超出估计，且文本越长超出越多：VoxCPM 1.5 的 VAE 用 810 MB，估计 290 MB；VoxCPM 2 的用 440 MB，估计 302 MB；Fish Speech 的编解码器用 806 MB，估计 486 MB；IndexTTS 1.5 的 BigVGAN 用 596 MB，估计 369 MB；IndexTTS 2 的用 421 MB，估计 358 MB。阶段实测超出后，校准会调高估计值，第一次则由显存不足重试兜底；这些估计值需要调高。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4795":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-657","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**训练显存预设**在 GPU 上，估计值（`MethodInfo.memory_mb`）对比实测峰值，单位 MB：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4796":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-658","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"微调","locale":"zh-CN"},"4797":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-659","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"`standard`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4798":{"id":"/do