ment-performance-688","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"GPT-SoVITS v2Pro speaker","locale":"zh-CN"},"4827":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-689","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"921 / 3,881","locale":"zh-CN"},"4828":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-690","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"921 / 3,881","locale":"zh-CN"},"4829":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-691","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"921 / 3,881","locale":"zh-CN"},"4830":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-692","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"在 GPU 上不能重复","locale":"zh-CN"},"4831":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-693","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA","locale":"zh-CN"},"4832":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-694","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"14,105 / 9,978","locale":"zh-CN"},"4833":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-695","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"14,105 / 9,978","locale":"zh-CN"},"4834":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-696","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"14,105 / 9,978","locale":"zh-CN"},"4835":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-697","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"其导出不能重复","locale":"zh-CN"},"4836":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-698","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"（之后已校准：显存估算。）大多数估计值低于峰值，有的低很多（GPT-SoVITS 低 4 倍），所以运行前的警告在该提醒时没有提醒：需要校准。`lowest` 使 Qwen3-TTS 的峰值减半，但其主机端优化器使运行慢 15 倍（第一步之前 152 秒，每步 6.2 秒，原为 0.2 秒）；其中大部分来自透明大页，现在这类阶段不再使用（见下文 G2）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4837":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-699","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"在空闲 GPU 上测量（2026-10-18），对比 G1 之后代码（`aeeba79`，冻结）的精确路径，G0 用例集每个用例运行三次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4838":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-700","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**已完成，结果不变。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4839":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-701","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**只在有用的地方预取**（显存）：`sequence` 组件（自回归模型；GPT-SoVITS 的 T2S 现在也是）既不预取，也不为传输中的副本留空间。部分加载（G1 的上限）时，在空闲 GPU 上交错运行：Qwen3-TTS base-clone-en 24.6 → 16.2 秒，VoxCPM v2-clone-en 29.0 → 13.6 秒，CosyVoice v2-clone-en 10.1 → 7.4 秒，都与没有副流时相同；F5-TTS 和 OmniVoice 保留预取。音频与整体加载时相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4840":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-702","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**`compute.compile` 下 CosyVoice 的 flow U-Net** 每个请求都重新编译（每一层的注意力掩码以掩码对象的身份为键缓存，而 torch.compile 会对此设置守卫）：预热请求要 12.8 秒而不是 1.0 秒。现在以 U-Net 的层级为键；编译后 0.97 秒；即时执行的音频与之前相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4841":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-703","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**IndexTTS 的束缓存放在一个缓冲区中**（在这一轮之后完成，对比 `fc4b6b3`，交错运行两轮）：所有层的键和值位于一个缓冲区，所以每一步的束重排是每束一次复制（没有束移动时只复制一次），每层在原处写入新的键和值，而不是每个张量各做一次 `index_select` 和一次 `torch.cat`，每次都复制整个张量。两个留有增长空间的缓冲区轮流使用。GPU 和 CPU 上结果都相同。预热：v15-clone-en 0.58 → 0.54 秒，v2-clone-en 2.02 → 1.93 秒，v25-clone-zh 1.73 → 1.67 秒；约 30 秒语音 ×1.11–1.12（1.5 4.79 → 4.29 秒，2 17.57 → 15.81 秒）；CPU 上 ×1.02–1.05。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4842":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-704","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**OmniVoice 的合并引导**（主动开启，请求选项 `packed_guidance`，在这一轮之后完成，对比 `a552038`）：每一项的有条件序列和无条件序列放在同一行，使用块对角掩码，而不是两行都补齐到有条件序列的长度。精确路径不变（结果相同，速度相同）。合并后，在 3090 上交错运行两轮：clone-en 0.77 → 0.61 秒，finetuned-en 0.76 → 0.60 秒（×1.26–1.27），clone-en-long 3.37 → 3.01 秒（×1.12），design-en 和 auto-zh 不变（0.54 秒：没有参考音频，补齐很少）；音频是另一次生成（舍入不同使决定翻转）。CPU 上 clone-en 24.0 → 18.3 秒（×1.31），design-en ×1.02，两者都与精确路径相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4843":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-705","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**`lowest` 下的训练**（在这一轮之后完成，对比 `a1350b3`，在 3090 上微调 Qwen3-TTS 1.7B）：这个阶段的大部分时间花在内核里，为 AdamW 每一步临时张量占用的透明大页整理内存（采样的调用栈：每一步的 `addcdiv_`），而页缓存占满了内存。`lowest` 阶段不再使用大页（`compute.cpu_allocator` 对其他阶段保留大页，没有大页时它们的微调慢 5–15 %），主机端优化器的副本各放在一个缓冲区中，按 dtype 经过锁页缓冲区传输：201 秒 → 82.8 秒（第一步 59.5 → 13.3 秒，每步 12.8 → 5.5 秒），GPU 峰值 9.1 → 7.3 GB，权重和损失相同；`lowest` 下的 F5-TTS 和 OmniVoice 不变且相同。每一步其余的时间是 CPU 上 AdamW 的运算。每个训练器标准微调的剖析没有显示数据加载的开销；它们在主机上的时间花在写检查点（F5-TTS 9 秒的阶段中占 4 秒）和模块初始化的随机抽取上，训练器按上游的做法重放这些抽取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4844":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-706","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**`compute.compile`**（主动开启，inductor 默认模式），预热请求和首次请求的代价，对比即时执行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4845":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-707","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"4846":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-708","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"预热","locale":"zh-CN"},"4847":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-709","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"编译代价","locale":"zh-CN"},"4848":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-710","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"4849":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-711","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"4850":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-712","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"×1.34","locale":"zh-CN"},"4851":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-713","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"+63 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4852":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-714","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"SNR 11 dB","locale":"zh-CN"},"4853":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-715","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"GPT-SoVITS v4","locale":"zh-CN"},"4854":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-716","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"×1.14","locale":"zh-CN"},"4855":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-717","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"+69 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4856":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-718","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"20 dB","locale":"zh-CN"},"4857":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-719","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"IndexTTS 1.5 / 2、CosyVoice 2 / 3","locale":"zh-CN"},"4858":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-720","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"×1.03–1.06","locale":"zh-CN"},"4859":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-721","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"+55–134 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4860":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-722","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"38–53 dB","locale":"zh-CN"},"4861":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-723","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"VoxCPM","locale":"zh-CN"},"4862":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-724","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"×0.41–0.64","locale":"zh-CN"},"4863":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-725","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"+20–47 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4864":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-726","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"编译时其 CUDA Graph 关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"4865":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-727","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"Qwen3-TTS、Fish Speech、GPT-SoVITS v2、OmniVoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"4866":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-728","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"4867":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-729","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"4868":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-730","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"没有编译任何模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"4869":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-731","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**`compute.fast`**（主动开启），对比精确路径：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4870":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-732","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"开关","locale":"zh-CN"},"4871":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-733","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"收益","locale":"zh-CN"},"4872":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-734","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"损失","locale":"zh-CN"},"4873":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-735","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"`sdpa_reduced_precision`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4874":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-736","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"VoxCPM ×1.20–1.28（其整个缓存上的注意力）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4875":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-737","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"无；其他引擎都完全相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"4876":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-738","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"`fp16_accumulation`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4877":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-739","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"F5-TTS ×1.11，IndexTTS 1.5 ×1.21","locale":"zh-CN"},"4878":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-740","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"GPT-SoVITS ×0.6","locale":"zh-CN"},"4879":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-741","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"`tf32`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4880":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-742","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"Qwen3-TTS base ×1.13","locale":"zh-CN"},"4881":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-743","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"GPT-SoVITS ×0.67–0.75（音频相同）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4882":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-744","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"`cudnn_benchmark`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4883":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-745","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"测不出","locale":"zh-CN"},"4884":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-746","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"改变声码器的结果位","locale":"zh-CN"},"4885":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-747","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"四个一起","locale":"zh-CN"},"4886":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-748","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"VoxCPM、F5-TTS、IndexTTS 1.5、Fish Speech、CosyVoice 3、GPT-SoVITS v4 ×1.1–1.3","locale":"zh-CN"},"4887":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-749","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**同时处理多个请求**（同时提交 8 段不同文本，不带种子）：微批处理（`tts.micro_batch`）使 Qwen3-TTS 快 2.6 倍（6.34 → 2.42 秒，中位延迟 3.97 → 2.39 秒）；对 OmniVoice 只快 10 %，中位延迟翻倍；对 GPT-SoVITS 快 27 %，而不批处理、两个任务同时运行更好（5.32 → 4.00 秒：文本前端与另一个任务的合成重叠）。单独设置 `compute.gpu_jobs = 2` 对单个引擎没有收益：一个引擎在一个设备上一次只运行一次调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4888":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-750","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**尝试过但没有保留。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4889":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-751","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**训练中融合的 AdamW**：每步优化快 1.5 倍（0.7 B 个 float32 参数：69 → 47 毫秒），但全量微调的每步时间几乎不变（CosyVoice 2 `llm` 0.121 → 0.112 秒，VoxCPM `full` 0.311 → 0.296 秒，Qwen3-TTS `speaker` 没有变化），且结果会改变：不提供。在 CUDA 上每个训练器默认已经使用 torch 的多张量（`foreach`）Adam，与上游一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4890":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-752","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**把 OmniVoice 每步的前向捕获为 CUDA Graph**：结果相同，快 2 %。不开 profiler 时它的语言模型使 GPU 约 90 % 忙碌，可节省的内核发出时间很少。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4891":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-753","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**直接加载到设备**：页缓存已热时一次加载用时 1.6–4.8 秒，其中 0.5–1.7 秒是在主机上复制张量，进程中的第一个模型还要付出约 2 秒的导入时间（torch、inflect）；直接加载到设备会失去使卸载零开销的主机副本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4892":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-754","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**无分类器引导合成一批**：F5-TTS、CosyVoice、IndexTTS 的 s2mel、OmniVoice 和 VoxCPM 本来就是这样（与上游一样）；GPT-SoVITS v3–v5 的 CFM 调用两次估计器，合成一批会改变结果位。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4893":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-755","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**训练的 `low` 预设**（梯度检查点）对比方案的每步 +35 %：F5-TTS +6 %，VoxCPM +51 %，Qwen3-TTS +80 %，OmniVoice +104 %（G0 的运行）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4894":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-756","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"**原生实现对比 0.1**（引擎工作进程版本，运行上游的代码；标签 `v1-engine-workers`），在空闲的 `cuda:0` 上测量（2026-10-18），双方都用各自的 GPU 默认设置：G0 用例集去掉 Fish Speech（0.1 的克隆在 GPU 上失败，Fish Speech）和 VoxCPM（0.1 没有），每一方一个进程，每个用例运行三次。预热取第 2–3 次中最快的一次；首次请求包含加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4895":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-757","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"用例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4896":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-758","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"预热，0.1 → 原生","locale":"zh-CN"},"4897":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-759","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"提升","locale":"zh-CN"},"4898":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-760","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","