velopment-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"OmniVoice clone-en","locale":"zh-CN"},"4936":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-798","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"0.79 → 0.78 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4937":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-799","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"×1.01","locale":"zh-CN"},"4938":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-800","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"7.7 → 3.6 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4939":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-801","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"每个用例中原生实现都至少一样快，预热请求和首次请求都是；每个原生用例三次运行的音频都相同。第一次测量与下面限制显存的契约测试同时运行（主机有 10 GB 被换出），OmniVoice 慢了 12 %，两个原生加载超过 100 秒：这类对比要在空闲的机器上测量。首段音频时间和峰值内存：见下面的 G8。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4940":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-802","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"**GPU 上的契约测试**（测试），所有已安装的模型，包括需要接受许可的引擎：整块 `cuda:0` 上 **144 个通过**（126 个用时 52 分钟，另有 VoxCPM 自己数据文件夹中的 18 个），`cuda:1` 限制为 4 GB 时 **144 个通过**（`MIZUOTO_TEST_SETTINGS='{\"compute\": {\"vram_limit_mb\": 4096}}'`，小于大模型（Fish Speech S2 Pro、IndexTTS 2、Qwen3-TTS 1.7B）所需，所以它们在整个栈中流式加载、部分加载；2 小时 6 分钟）。限制显存时最慢的测试是一个很长的 Qwen3-TTS 请求（旁白微调模型的种子测试：单独运行 2,778 秒，整体加载时 322 秒）：流式加载的自回归模型每生成一个 token 都要复制一次它的流式层。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4941":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-803","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"2026-10-19，一张 RTX 3090（`cuda:0`），机器空闲，G0 用例以流式运行（实验工作区的 `perf/g8/`：`run.sh`、`single.sh`、`monitor.py`，每 0.2 秒采样显卡已用显存和进程树的内存；0.1 的引擎