xt","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"（拒绝：布尔掩码）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5256":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1118","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"1.05 另一次生成","locale":"zh-CN"},"5257":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1119","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"IndexTTS 1.5 / 2","locale":"zh-CN"},"5258":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1120","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"1.06 / 1.01","locale":"zh-CN"},"5259":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1121","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"0.82 / 1.00","locale":"zh-CN"},"5260":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1122","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"0.97 / 0.97","locale":"zh-CN"},"5261":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1123","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"无休止：6 倍 / 1.00","locale":"zh-CN"},"5262":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1124","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"1.01 / 1.00","locale":"zh-CN"},"5263":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1125","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"VoxCPM 1.5 / 2","locale":"zh-CN"},"5264":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1126","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"1.00 相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"5265":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1127","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"**1.39 / 1.65** 另一次生成","locale":"zh-CN"},"5266":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1128","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"0.76 / 0.98","locale":"zh-CN"},"5267":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1129","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"无休止：3–4 倍的音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"5268":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1130","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"**1.41 / 1.57** 另一次生成","locale":"zh-CN"},"5269":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1131","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"**训练**（每个训练器的测试夹具，`training.attention`）：在调用点的参照就是普通 SDPA 的地方（F5-TTS、Qwen3-TTS、VoxCPM），`sdpa` 给出与 `auto` 相同的损失和权重；FlashAttention 和 xFormers 的损失相差不超过 1e-3，Qwen3-TTS 第一步相差 0.25 %，之后它的 bf16 训练轨迹逐渐偏离（任何舍入变化都会如此）；峰值显存和每步时间变化不到 7 %。**回退**在真实内核上（布尔掩码交给 flash、head dim 80 或需要梯度的调用交给 SageAttention、fp32 交给任一个、无法导入的 xFormers）都带着原因回退，给出参照的结果；严格模式拒绝它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5270":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1132","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"**发现并修复：** 直接调用 SDPA 的 math 内核时，它把布尔掩码当作数值相加（`math` 后端和 Fish Speech 的解码步骤；见 Fish Speech）；SageAttention 在当前设备以外的 GPU 上出错；Qwen 的注意力在策略下把带掩码的分组头交给 SDPA 的 math 内核（任何策略下 OmniVoice 慢到 0.71 倍且数值不同），现在按参照的做法先重复头。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5271":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1133","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"**决定：** NVIDIA 上的 `fast` 对键有填充的 fp16/bf16 调用使用 FlashAttention，其余使用 SDPA（`PADDED_CHAIN`）；SageAttention 和 xFormers 移出它的链，仍可按名称选用；自回归调用点拒绝量化后端（`approx_ok=False`）；`auto` 仍是默认值（D-A6：参照为普通 SDPA 的地方 `sdpa` 给出相同音频，并不更快）。doctor 给出的 flash-attn 安装命令会说明 torch 2.8 下它与 xFormers 互斥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5272":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1134","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#部分加载的模型","content":"在 RTX 3090 上测量（2026-10-18），每个模型都设了限额（`compute.vram_limit_mb`），使其解码器流式加载；比较的是预热后的请求与之前的代码，每个用例三次运行，并对比音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5273":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1135","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#部分加载的模型","content":"**重新加载**一个已卸载到内存的组件，复制速度原为 7–9.8 GB/s，是这块卡从锁页内存读取速度（13.45 GB/s）的 52–73 %：保留的主机副本是可分页内存，每次复制都要等上一次完成。现在它们在组件加载时就地锁页（`runtime/pinning.py`，见显存）；卸载、首次加载和峰值显存都不变：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5274":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1136","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#部分加载的模型","content":"重新加载（整块 GPU）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5275":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1137","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#部分加载的模型","content":"MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"5276":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1138","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#部分加载的模型","content":"可分页","locale":"zh-CN"},"5277":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1139","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#部分加载的模型","content":"就地锁页","locale":"zh-CN"},"5278":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1140","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#部分加载的模型","content":"CosyVoice 2","locale":"zh-CN"},"5279":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1141","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/