g-120","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T3 端到端（带种子）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5998":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-121","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"完整请求走完 Mizuoto 的链路：原生与参照，同一种子、同一 torch 版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"5999":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-122","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"CPU fp32","locale":"zh-CN"},"6000":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-123","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**token 完全相同；音频完全相同或最大绝对误差 ≤ 1e-4**；例外逐个引擎列出并说明原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"6001":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-124","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T4 统计**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6002":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-125","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"每个引擎在其生产精度和设备上的语料运行，原生与参照；种子不对齐（GPU 内核不同）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6003":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-126","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"GPU（bf16/fp16）、CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"6004":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-127","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"每种音色模式和模型至少 20 段文本 × 3 个音色 × 每个音色 3 个种子：平均 CER/WER（Whisper large-v3-turbo）≤ 参照 + 0.5 个百分点，且没有用例比参照最差的再差 5 个百分点以上；说话人相似度（CAM++ 与参考片段的余弦）均值 ≥ 参照 − 0.01；时长比在 ±5% 之内；UTMOS 均值 ≥ 参照 − 0.05；响度和 F0 中位数（按音色）在参照的四分位距之内。失败的片段（错误率高于 50 %）单独比较（Fisher 精确检验），不计入其他指标；超出阈值只有在配对差异显著时（Wilcoxon，p \\< 0.05）才算不通过","locale":"zh-CN"},"6005":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-128","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**为什么 T3 只在 CPU 上以 fp32 判断。** 任何一点 logits 差异都会翻转一次多项式抽样（或一个束），之后的一切随之分叉。在 GPU 上降精度运行时，连上游自己都不能与自己逐比特一致（例如批量和单条的贪心解码），所以 GPU 上的一致性由 T1 的模块级误差加 T4 的统计指标判断。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6006":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-129","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**音频之外的行为**也是对照的一部分，在两种实现上都经过契约套件检查：实际生效的参数和警告、音色模式的判定（`fit`）、流式的粒度与块数、取消的行为、对无效输入的错误码（参考音频太长、不支持的语言、缺少转写）、输出采样率、分段的拼接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6007":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-130","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"加速与提速遵守同样的层级：会改变比特的加速（例如编译）至少保持在该引擎的 T1/T3 容差之内，并记录实测误差；默认路径上的提速必须逐比特不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6008":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-131","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T0 的 DSP 夹具只在生成它们的那类机器上完全相同**：带 AVX2、不带 AVX-512 的 x86-64 Linux，且 torch 版本相同。在别处，内核的舍入不同（numpy 的 AVX-512 `exp` 和 `log`、Windows CRT 的 libm、Arm 上 torch 的 FFT 和 soxr 的 SIMD、另一个 torch 版本），所以 `tests/runtime/test_dsp.py` 在那里检查输出在这种舍入之内一致：float32 最大绝对误差 ≤ 1e-4 × max(1, ‖ref‖∞)，float64 ≤ 1e-12 × max(1, ‖ref‖∞)。CI 的 macOS、Windows 和 AVX-512 机器上实测最大为 4e-5。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6009":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-132","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"`scripts/parity/quality.py` 运行这一层（命令见 `scripts/parity/README.md`）。语料（`scripts/parity/corpus/t4.json`）共 17 组，每组是一个模型和一种音色模式：三个音色（克隆用语料中的两段英文片段和一段中文片段；三个预置说话人；三个设计音色）朗读 20 段文本（10 段英文、10 段中文，不含数字），种子为 1–3，每组每侧 180 个片段。原生实现用本仓库运行；参照实现对 0.1 已有的引擎用 0.1，对 VoxCPM 用上游的包，各自在自己的一块 RTX 3090 上以生产精度运行。评判工具：通过 Mizuoto 的 ASR 运行的 Whisper large-v3-turbo（英文按词、中文按字计算，繁体字用 OpenCC 的表转为简体）、CAM++（CosyVoice 的）、UTMOS22 strong（SpeechMOS）、BS.1770 响度和 YIN F0。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6010":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-133","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"第一次完整运行后做了三处改进，上面的层级规则已经包含它们：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6011":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-134","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"**失败计数，而不是平均。** 失控的片段（采样模型停不下来，或一直生成静音）错误率没有上限：Qwen3-TTS 的一个 965 % 的片段把均值从 1.3 % 拉到 6.7 %。错误率高于 50 % 的片段在每侧单独计数，用 Fisher 精确检验比较；其他指标只用没有失败的片段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6012":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-135","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"**超出阈值还需要差异显著。** 在 180 个采样片段上，最差片段和 0.05 的 UTMOS 余量都会随机波动：只有配对检验（按音色和文本，种子取平均）给出 p \\< 0.05 时，该组才不通过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6013":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-136","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"**用定向重跑判断个别离群值。** 语料中发现的两个失控片段（Qwen3-TTS 的英文说话人读中文，以及 IndexTTS 1.5 读到一半变成静音）都在两侧用该音色和语言、10 个种子重跑：参照实现失败得一样多（各 100 个中 3 和 3；2 和 3）。两者都是上游自身的行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6014":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-137","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"测量于 2026-10-18（参照 → 原生；失败片段数为参照 / 原生）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6015":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-138","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"组","locale":"zh-CN"},"6016":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-139","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"错误率 %","locale":"zh-CN"},"6017":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-140","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"6018":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-141","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"说话人相似度","lo