ting-358","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu、Python 3.11、bun、Playwright 的 Chromium（`playwright install --with-deps chromium`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6236":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-359","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`dev.py web-install`、`dev.py web`（构建）、`dev.py test-e2e`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6237":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-360","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`site`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6238":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-361","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu、bun","locale":"zh-CN"},"6239":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-362","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"在 `site/` 里 `bun install --frozen-lockfile`、`bun run check`、`bun run test`、`bun run build`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6240":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-363","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`passed`（\"CI passed\"）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6241":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-364","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu","locale":"zh-CN"},"6242":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-365","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"上面有作业失败或被取消时失败，都通过或因改动无关而跳过时通过：分支保护只需要求这一项","locale":"zh-CN"},"6243":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-366","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"同一分支较新的运行会取消较旧的运行。推送到 `main` 且改动了某个版本文件时会启动发布工作流，它把 `ci.yml` 作为自己的检查，检查这次推送改动的内容；CI 自己对这次推送的运行会跳过所有作业（`scope` 看到了版本文件），所以检查只跑一次。标签只启动发布工作流，它的检查是全部。把文档站推送到 GitHub Pages 由 `site.yml` 负责，不在 CI 里（见发布）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6244":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-367","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`python scripts/dev.py check` 在本地运行全部内容（只在你的平台和 Python 上，装上需要接受许可的包，基于你检出的 Mizuoto）。契约套件和对照工具需要模型（对照还需要参照实现的环境），权重有几十 GB，所以不进 CI；发布工作流有自己的 wheel 冒烟测试（见发布）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6245":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-368","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"CI 只有 CPU 版 torch。GPU 上的路径（CUDA 图、可选的注意力后端、显存流式加载的异步预取）在 CPU 上测的是逻辑；它们在 GPU 上的表现要在有 GPU 的机器上用契约套件和对照工具检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6246":{"id":"/docs/development-training","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"page","content":"训练器","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training","locale":"zh-CN"},"6247":{"id":"/docs/development-training-0","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training","content":"训练方法怎样在清单里声明，数据集怎样添加、准备和检查，各阶段怎样作为 Mizuoto 自身解释器的子进程依次运行，指纹怎样决定哪些阶段过期，训练器怎样编写，以及导出会登记什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6248":{"id":"/docs/development-training-1","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"清单里的训练方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"6249":{"id":"/docs/development-training-2","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#数据集","content":"数据集","locale":"zh-CN"},"6250":{"id":"/docs/development-training-3","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"实验、指纹与过期阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"6251":{"id":"/docs/development-training-4","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"训练任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"6252":{"id":"/docs/development-training-5","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"为什么用子进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"6253":{"id":"/docs/development-training-6","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"Trainer 与 StageContext","locale":"zh-CN"},"6254":{"id":"/docs/development-training-7","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#显存","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"6255":{"id":"/docs/development-training-8","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#导出","content":"导出","locale":"zh-CN"},"6256":{"id":"/docs/development-training-9","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"以 OmniVoice 的训练器为例","locale":"zh-CN"},"6257":{"id":"/docs/development-training-10","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#添加一个训练器","content":"添加一个训练器","locale":"zh-CN"},"6258":{"id":"/docs/development-training-11","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training","content":"每个可训练的引擎都以原生方式训练，在 Mizuoto 自己的环境里，用的就是它推理时的那些模块。每个训练器都复现了上游的训练方案：在 CPU 上用同一个种子，它的损失、学习率和保存的权重与上游脚本（Mizuoto 0.1 运行它们的方式；VoxCPM 则是上游自己的脚本）逐字节相同。不需要单独的训练环境或训练用的附加依赖：训练器只用推理也用的模块和依赖，不依赖 transformers、accelerate、peft、Lightning、Hydra、datasets 或 webdataset。主机一侧是 `mizuoto/core/training/service.py`（`TrainingService`）；引擎一侧是 `mizuoto/training/`（`Trainer`、`StageContext`、`stage.py`）加上各引擎的训练器模块。训练界面的用法见训练。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6259":{"id":"/docs/development-training-12","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"训练方法是引擎清单里的 `[training.<id>]`（`TrainingMethod`）。OmniVoice 的 LoRA：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6260":{"id":"/docs/development-training-13","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","ur