142","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**导出本章**：只导出当前章节；文件名为“项目名 — 章节标题”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7714":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**全部导出**：整个项目导出为一个文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7715":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"导出是一个 **导出项目** 任务。完成后文件出现在下方的 **已导出的文件** 中，每个文件可以播放、**下载**，以及下载 **字幕（SRT）**：每句一条字幕，时间与音频对齐。导出的文件也会出现在历史中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7716":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#删除","content":"页面底部的 **删除** 把项目及其全部版本移到回收站。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7717":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#命令行","content":"命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"7718":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#命令行","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"7719":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#命令行","content":"`mizuoto project new <名称> [-m 模型] [--voice 音色 \\| --preset 说话人] [-l 语言] [--script 文件] [--split line\\|sentence]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7720":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#命令行","content":"新建项目，带一个旁白和可选的脚本","locale":"zh-CN"},"7721":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#命令行","content":"`mizuoto project import <项目> <脚本> [--split …] [--replace] [--chapter 章节id]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"7722":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#命令行","content":"导入脚本（追加、替换或加到某章）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7723":{"id":"/doc