id":"/docs/guide-train-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#能训练什么","content":"训练不需要 Mizuoto 和 torch 之外的任何东西：所有训练方式都在 Mizuoto 自己的 Python 中运行，每个阶段一个单独的进程。有的方式需要只在训练时用到的共享文件，例如 GPT-SoVITS 的预训练判别器（`mizuoto asset download gptsovits/s2d-v2pro`）。缺少什么时，新建实验对话框会把这种方式标为 **不可用**，并写明要运行的命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8048":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#能训练什么","content":"训练始终在本机运行，不会使用远程主机；引擎设为远程设备时，它的训练方式不可用。微调运行时会独占所用的设备。训练用哪个设备在 **设置 › 训练 › 训练设备** 中选择，默认使用 **引擎所用设备**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8049":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建数据集","content":"在 **数据集** 标签页点 **新建数据集**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8050":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建数据集","content":"填写 **数据集名称**、选择 **语言**，可选填写 **描述**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8051":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建数据集","content":"点 **创建**，打开数据集页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8052":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建数据集","content":"数据集保存在数据文件夹的 `datasets/<名称>/` 中：`dataset.json`、每行一个片段的 `manifest.jsonl`，以及 `audio/` 中的 FLAC 片段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8053":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"数据集页的 **添加片段** 部分提供几种来源：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8054":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**音频文件或录音**：拖放、选择文件、**录音**，或 **服务器文件**。可以在 **说话人** 中写明这些片段是谁说的（可选），然后点 **添加（N）**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8055":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**某个音色的片段**：选择音色库中的一个音色，点 **添加**，加入它的参考音频及文本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8056":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**之前的结果**：从合成结果中挑选。结果会带着它的许可标记加入；许可不允许用来训练其他引擎的结果（例如 Fish Speech 的结果），训练时会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8057":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**添加服务器文件夹**（只在服务器本机的浏览器中出现）：先选择 **文件夹格式**，再选择文件夹：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8058":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"文件夹格式","locale":"zh-CN"},"8059":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"8060":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**自动识别**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8061":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"按文件夹内容判断","locale":"zh-CN"},"8062":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**音频文件（旁边可有同名 .lab 或 .txt）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8063":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"普通的音频文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"8064":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**GPT-SoVITS .list**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8065":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"GPT-SoVITS 的标注文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"8066":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**LJSpeech（metadata.csv）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8067":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"LJSpeech 格式","locale":"zh-CN"},"8068":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"**CSV（audio_file\\|text）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8069":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#添加片段","content":"每行一个音频文件名和文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"8070":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"**在停顿处切分长录音，用语音识别补全缺失的文本，并统一音量。添加片段后运行。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8071":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"8072":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"默认","locale":"zh-CN"},"8073":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"8074":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"**切分长片段**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8075":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"8076":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"在静音处切分，同 GPT-SoVITS 的切分工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"8077":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"**转写**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8078":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"8079":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"用语音识别为没有文本的片段生成文本（需要已安装语音识别）","locale":"zh-CN"},"8080":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"**统一音量**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8081":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"8082":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"每个片段的峰值调到 -1 dBFS","locale":"zh-CN"},"8083":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"**最长片段（秒）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8084":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"12","locale":"zh-CN"},"8085":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"比它长的片段才会被切分","locale":"zh-CN"},"8086":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"**保留的最短片段（秒）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8087":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"1","locale":"zh-CN"},"8088":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"更短的片段被丢弃","locale":"zh-CN"},"8089":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"**静音阈值（dB）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8090":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"-34","locale":"zh-CN"},"8091":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"低于它算作静音","locale":"zh-CN"},"8092":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"**所说语言**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8093":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"8094":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"转写时使用的语言","locale":"zh-CN"},"8095":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#预处理","content":"点 **开始预处理**，它作为一个任务运行，进度显示在下方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8096":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#检查报告","content":"预处理后（或有片段时）显示 **检查报告**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8097":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#检查报告","content":"**可用片段：可用数/总数 · 时长**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"8098":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#检查报告","content":"**片段时长** 的直方图；","locale":"zh-CN"},"8099":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#检查报告","content":"问题列表：**过短**、**过长**、**缺少文本**、**削波**，每一项旁的 **查看** 会只列出这些片段；","locale":"zh-CN"},"8100":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#检查报告","content":"其他提示，以及 **片段的许可证**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8101":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"**片段** 列表每页 50 条，可以搜索文本或按问题筛选。每条片段：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8102":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"播放按钮和时长；","locale":"zh-CN"},"8103":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"文本框（标签为说话人名，没有文本时提示 **没有文本：请转写或手动输入**），改完点保存按钮或按回车；","locale":"zh-CN"},"8104":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"**用于训练** / **不用于训练**：排除的片段保留在数据集中但不参与训练；","locale":"zh-CN"},"8105":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"删除按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8106":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"**详情** 中可以修改名称、语言和描述。页面底部有 **删除**（移到回收站；用它建立的实验将无法再运行）和 **用它训练**（以这个数据集新建实验）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8107":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"在 **实验** 标签页点 **新建实验**（或在数据集页点 **用它训练**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8108":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**起始模型**：只列出可以训练的已安装模型。没有时提示安装可训练的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8109":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**训练方式**：这个模型可用的方式；不可用的带有 **（不可用）** 并写明原因（缺少共享文件、引擎不可用或在远程主机上等）。下方显示这种方式的说明、阶段、结果类型（**生成音色专属权重** 或 **生成新模型**）和所需的最少语音时长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8110":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**数据集**；数据集中可用的语音时长不足时，创建会失败，并说明现有与所需的时长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8111":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**实验名称**：默认是“数据集-模型”，只能用字母、数字、`-`、`_` 和 `.`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8112":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"结果是音色权重时，还有 **权重所属音色**：选音色库中的一个音色，或 **新建音色**（用数据集中三段 3 到 10 秒的片段新建一个）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8113":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"主要设置（轮数、学习率等）可以在这里修改，**更多设置（包括高级设置）在实验页面中。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8114":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"点 **创建**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8115":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"实验保存在 `experiments/<引擎>/<名称>/` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8116":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"实验页上方显示起始模型、数据集、结果类型和语言。**阶段** 部分是一排步骤，每个阶段的状态为 **未运行**、**运行中**、**已完成**、**已过期** 或 **失败**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8117":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"按钮","locale":"zh-CN"},"8118":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"8119":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"**运行**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8120":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"从第一个未完成（或已过期）的阶段运行到最后；全部完成后显示 **已完成**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8121":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"**运行此阶段**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8122":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"只运行选中的阶段；它之前的阶段必须已完成","locale":"zh-CN"},"8123":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"**从头开始**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8124":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"确认后从第一个阶段起重新运行所有阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"8125":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"点一个阶段查看它的说明、完成时间和结果；失败时显示错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8126":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"一次运行是一个 **训练** 任务，它的步骤就是各个阶段，任务卡片显示在阶段下方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8127":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"**已过期**：每个完成的阶段都记录了它读取的内容——数据集、起始模型的版本和它用到的设置，以及之前阶段的结果。这些内容变化后，这个阶段及其后的阶段都标为 **已过期**（**此阶段运行后，它读取的内容（数据集、模型或它用到的设置）已改变：请重新运行。**）。重新运行某个阶段时，它之后已完成的阶段也会过期，因为它们读的是这个阶段的旧文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8128":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#损失曲线","content":"**损失** 部分在训练阶段运行时实时显示曲线；有多个训练阶段时可以切换，有多条曲线时可以用标签逐条开关。还没有数据时显示 **训练阶段运行时，损失曲线显示在这里**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8129":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#设置","content":"**设置** 中是这种训练方式的超参数（数字输入框），**高级** 中是其余的。**修改设置会使用到它的阶段及其后的阶段过期。** 改完点 **保存**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8130":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#试听与导出","content":"**试听**：导出阶段会用训练结果朗读一段（**设置 › 训练 › 训练后合成试听** 打开时），结果列在这里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8131":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#试听与导出","content":"**已导出**：导出的 **音色**（可以 **打开** 或 **在合成中使用**）或 **模型**（点 **模型** 跳到模型页）。导出的权重会加到所选音色上；导出的新模型以 `引擎/名称` 出现在模型列表中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8132":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#试听与导出","content":"页面底部的 **删除** 把实验及其工作文件移到回收站，已导出的内容保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8133":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"微调实际上需要 GPU。按 **内存** 设置，各微调在其配方默认批大小下能运行的最小显卡