[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"6 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8158":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-164","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"OmniVoice LoRA","locale":"zh-CN"},"8159":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-165","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"12 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8160":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-166","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"4 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8161":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-167","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"4 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8162":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-168","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"Qwen3-TTS 1.7B `speaker`","locale":"zh-CN"},"8163":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-169","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"24 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8164":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-170","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"24 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8165":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-171","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"12 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8166":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-172","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"VoxCPM 0.5B `full`","locale":"zh-CN"},"8167":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-173","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"24 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8168":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-174","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"16 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8169":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"16 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8170":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"VoxCPM 0.5B / 1.5 / 2 LoRA （批大小 16）","locale":"zh-CN"},"8171":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-177","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"12 GB / 12 GB / 24 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8172":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-178","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"4 GB / 6 GB / 12 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8173":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-179","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"4 GB / 6 GB / 12 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"8174":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-180","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"所有引擎也都能在 CPU 上训练，适合用很少的数据和步数确认流程能走通。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8175":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-181","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"**设置 › 训练** 中还有 **训练精度**、**每次运行保留的检查点数** 和 **内存**：*标准* 按各配方训练；*低* 加上梯度检查点（反向传播时重新运行模型的每个块，而不保留其激活值），并把用不到的部分移出 GPU，结果相同，每步慢几个百分点到一倍（在 RTX 3090 上测得：F5-TTS +6 %、VoxCPM +51 %、Qwen3-TTS +80 %、OmniVoice +104 %）；*最低* 还把优化器状态放在内存中，并从内存流式加载 LoRA 的冻结权重，结果略有不同。方法自己的 **gradient_checkpointing** 超参数优先。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8176":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-182","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"**在 GPU 上精确复现微调**（`training.deterministic`，默认关闭）：在 GPU 上，同一个实验运行两次得到的权重略有不同，因为用原子操作求和的内核（许多反向传播中都有，还有 SDPA 融合注意力的反向传播）每次相加的顺序不同。GPT-SoVITS 的损失在几步之后就会分开；Fish Speech 的 LoRA 在最后几位上不同。开启后，每个阶段都使用 torch 的确定性内核和 math 注意力内核：两次运行完全相同（两者都在 RTX 3090 上验证过）。当 **注意力** 指定了某个后端时，它仍然计算它能够复现的部分（FlashAttention 会使用其确定性的反向传播），其余交给 math 内核，所以这样的运行也能复现（OmniVoice 使用 FlashAttention，在两块 GPU 上：权重相同）。代价是一些时间（测试用的微调，预热后：GPT-SoVITS 30.6 → 34.7 s，Fish Speech 41.1 → 43.0 s），以及长序列上 math 内核所需的显存。在 CPU 上，微调总能复现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8177":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-183","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"为新实验选择方法时，对话框会显示每种内存设置下一次运行大约需要多少显存；实验页面的 **显存** 一节显示它将使用的 GPU 的空闲显存和每种设置的估计，标出放不下的设置；当前设置放不下时，用一个按钮给出能放下的改动（**改用“最低”**，没有设置能解决时 **把批大小设为 3**）；估计超过 GPU 空闲显存的运行还会在日志中说明，并给出放得下的设置；没有设置能解决时，给出更小的 `batch_size`（Fish Speech 的 LoRA 在默认批量 4、*标准* 设置下需要超过 24 GB 显存；*最低* 设置下可以放下）。在 GPU 上，每个记录的步骤还会报告 **memory/peak_mb**，即实际用量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8178":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"page","content":"音色","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices","locale":"zh-CN"},"8179":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"音色库：从音频创建、设计、添加预置说话人，管理参考音频、文本和微调权重，查看各模型能否使用，导出与导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8180":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#音色列表","content":"音色列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"8181":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"新建音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"8182":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#音色页","content":"音色页","locale":"zh-CN"},"8183":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#参考音频","content":"参考音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"8184":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#微调权重","content":"微调权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"8185":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#哪些模型可以使用","content":"哪些模型可以使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"8186":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#试听","content":"试听","locale":"zh-CN"},"8187":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#详情","content":"详情","locale":"zh-CN"},"8188":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#页面底部","content":"页面底部","locale":"zh-CN"},"8189":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#导入","content":"导入","locale":"zh-CN"},"8190":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#命令行","content":"命令行","locale":"zh-CN"},"8191":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"**音色** 页是音色库。一个音色可以在 **合成**、**项目**、**工具** 中反复使用，换模型时 Mizuoto 会自动判断它在新模型上怎么用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8192":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"音色有四类：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8193":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"类别","locale":"zh-CN"},"8194":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"8195":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"**来自音频**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8196":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"一段或几段参考音频及其文本，用来克隆","locale":"zh-CN"},"8197":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"**设计**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8198":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"设计模型按文字描述生成的声音；生成的那段音频成为它的主音频，因此也能被其他模型克隆","locale":"zh-CN"},"8199":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"**预置**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8200":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"某个模型的预置说话人，只能用于这个模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"8201":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"**训练**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8202":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"训练得到的音色，带有专属的微调权重（见训练）","locale":"zh-CN"},"8203":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"每个音色是数据文件夹下 `voices/<名称>/` 中的一个文件夹（`voice.json` 和 `references/` 中的 FLAC 音频）。列表就是对这些文件夹的扫描，直接复制进去的音色文件夹也会出现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8204":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#音色列表","content":"顶部有 **搜索音色**、按类别筛选的标签、**导入音色** 和 **新建音色**。每张卡片显示名称、类别、描述、语言、**N 段音频** 和总时长；有主音频的可以直接 **播放其音频**，**在合成中使用** 会带着这个音色跳到合成页。点卡片打开音色页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8205":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"点 **新建音色**，在对话框中先填 **名称**，再选一种方式：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8206":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"添加一段或几段参考音频：拖放或选择文件、**录音**（3 到 30 秒的清晰语音为佳）、**服务器文件** 或 **之前的结果**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8207":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"每段音频下方有 **音频中说的内容**。可以留空：**缺少的文本会在安装语音识别后自动填写。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8208":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"选择 **语言**（或 **任意语言**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8209":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"点 **创建**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8210":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"需要一个能设计音色的已安装模型，例如 Qwen3-TTS 1.7B VoiceDesign；没有时提示 **没有安装可设计音色的模型。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8211":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"选择 **设计模型**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8212":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"在 **描述音色** 中写下想要的声音，例如“温暖低沉的男声，平静，略带沙哑”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8213":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"**音色样例要说的话** 是试听用的句子，可以修改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8214":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"点 **生成**。每次生成一个候选，出现在 **候选** 中（保留最近 4 个），逐个试听。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8215":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"在满意的候选旁点 **保留这个**，它就成为一个 **设计** 类音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8216":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"选择 **模型**（只列出带预置说话人的已安装模型）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8217":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"选择 **说话人**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8218":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"点 **创建**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8219":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"还可以在合成结果的菜单中点 **保存为音色**，把任意一条结果存为音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8220":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#音色页","content":"音色页顶部显示名称和类别；设计出的音色还显示 **由 模型 设计** 和当时的描述，预置音色显示 **模型 的说话人 名称**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8221":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#参考音频","content":"（预置音色没有这一部分。）每段音频一行：播放按钮、波形（点击或拖动跳转播放位置）、时长与采样率，以及：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8222":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#参考音频","content":"**主音频** 标记，或 **设为主音频** 按钮。克隆时主音频排在最前；音色列表中播放的也是它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8223":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#参考音频","content":"删除按钮（至少保留一段）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8224":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#参考音频","content":"下面的文本框是这段音频的文本，改完点 **保存**（或按回车）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8225":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#参考音频","content":"**重新识别** 用语音识别重新转写所有音频；**添加音频** 再加一段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8226":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#微调权重","content":"（来自音频和训练类的音色才有。）一个音色可以带有某个引擎的专属微调权重，目前是 GPT-SoVITS：一个 GPT 的 `.ckpt` 和一个 SoVITS 的 `.pth`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8227":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#微调权重","content":"选择 **引擎**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8228":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#微调权重","content":"按提示 **选择 gpt 文件（.ckpt）** 和 **选择 sovits 文件（.pth）**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8229":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#微调权重","content":"点 **添加权重**，上传完成后显示 **已添加 GPT-SoVITS 的权重**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8230":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#微调权重","content":"权重的版本从文件中识别。同版本的 GPT-SoVITS 模型使用这个音色时会换上这套权重（在 **哪些模型可以使用** 中带有 **自有权重** 标记）；版本不同的模型给出提示并照常克隆。**音色仍保留其参考音频：引擎使用权重时也需要参考音频。** 训练实验导出的权重会自动加到音色上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8231":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#哪些模型可以使用","content":"列出每个已安装的模型能否使用这个音色、以何种方式：**克隆**、**克隆（无文本）**、**预置说话人**、**设计** 或 **训练**，以及 **自有权重**、**先识别文本**、**裁剪以适配** 等标记；不能使用的写明原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8232":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#哪些模型可以使用","content":"克隆方式的行有 **准备** 按钮：提前为这个模型计算并缓存音色（参考音频的特征等），之后第一次合成会更快。不准备的话，第一次合成时也会自动做一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8233":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#试听","content":"选择一个可用的 **模型**，修改 **文本**，点 **合成**。结果列在下方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8234":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#详情","content":"**名称**、**语言**、**标签**（逗号分隔）和 **描述**，改完点 **保存**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8235":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#页面底部","content":"**删除**：把音色移到数据文件夹的回收站（`trash/`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8236":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#页面底部","content":"**导出**：下载一个 zip，包含音色信息、参考音频和微调权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8237":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#页面底部","content":"**在合成中使用**：带着这个音色打开合成页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8238":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#导入","content":"在音色列表点 **导入音色**，选择一个导出的 zip。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8239":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#命令行","content":"其余命令（`add-ref`、`set-transcript`、`retranscribe`、`edit`、`remove`…）见 `mizuoto voice --help` 和命令参考。`voice add`、`voice from-output` 和 `voice edit` 接受 `--consent`：一条关于这是谁的声音的可选说明，随音色保存（`voice info` 会显示），但不是必需的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8240":{"id":"/docs/guide","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"page","content":"界面总览","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide","locale":"zh-CN"},"8241":{"id":"/docs/guide-0","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"网页界面的整体布局：导航、任务面板、内存中的模型、主题，以及各页面的教程入口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8242":{"id":"/docs/guide-1","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"导航","locale":"zh-CN"},"8243":{"id":"/docs/guide-2","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"顶栏","locale":"zh-CN"},"8244":{"id":"/docs/guide-3","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide#页面底部","content":"页面底部","locale":"zh-CN"},"8245":{"id":"/docs/guide-4","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"各页面的教程","locale":"zh-CN"},"8246":{"id":"/docs/guide-5","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide","content":"本节逐个页面讲解 Mizuoto 的网页界面。还没有安装或启动 Mizuoto 的话，先看快速开始。界面中的每个操作都有对应的 `mizuoto` 命令，见命令行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8247":{"id":"/docs/guide-6","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"左侧是导航栏。窗口较窄时（手机上）它移到底部，只显示前四个页面和 **更多**；**更多** 打开其余页面（**训练**、**模型**、**历史**、**设置**）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8248":{"id":"/docs/guide-7","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"8249":{"id":"/docs/guide-8","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"用来做什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"8250":{"id":"/docs/guide-9","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**合成**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8251":{"id":"/docs/guide-10","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"选模型和音色，把文本合成为语音","locale":"zh-CN"},"8252":{"id":"/docs/guide-11","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**项目**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8253":{"id":"/docs/guide-12","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"由一组角色逐句朗读一本书、一份剧本或一段对话","locale":"zh-CN"},"8254":{"id":"/docs/guide-13","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**工具**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8255":{"id":"/docs/guide-14","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**音色转换** 与 **语音编辑**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8256":{"id":"/docs/guide-15","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**音色**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8257":{"id":"/docs/guide-16","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"音色库：新建、设计、导入导出音色，查看各模型能否使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"8258":{"id":"/docs/guide-17","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**训练**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8259":{"id":"/docs/guide-18","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"数据集与实验：用自己的录音微调模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"8260":{"id":"/docs/guide-19","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8261":{"id":"/docs/guide-20","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"模型下载、引擎、共享文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"8262":{"id":"/docs/guide-21","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**历史**","locale":"zh-CN"},"8263":{"id":"/docs/guide-22","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"所有合成结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"8264":{"id":"/docs/guide-23","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"**设置**（最下方）","locale":"zh-CN"},"8265":{"id":"/docs/guide-24","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"语言、服务器、计算设备、下载来源、存储、外观等","locale":"zh-CN"},"8266":{"id":"/docs/guide-25","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#导航","content":"打开界面时回到你上次所在的页面。每个页面在切换后都保持原来的状态（包括滚动位置）；音色、数据集、实验和项目的详情页各自独立保持。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8267":{"id":"/docs/guide-26","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"右上角有四个按钮：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8268":{"id":"/docs/guide-27","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"**任务**：有任务在运行时显示转圈的图标和数量（**N 个运行中**）。点开是任务面板，列出最近的 30 个任务；每个任务卡片显示状态、进度（下载还显示已下载量、速度和剩余时间），并可以 **取消**、**重试** 和查看 **日志**。点 **全部任务** 打开完整的任务列表，可按 **全部**、**进行中**、**已结束** 筛选，**清除已结束** 清理历史。排队中的任务会说明在等什么，例如 **等待 GPU**、**等待引擎**、**等待其他合成任务**（见设置中的 **同时运行的合成任务**）、**等待其他下载**；另一个任务占用着 GPU 时可以点 **仍然运行**，在显存足够时并行运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8269":{"id":"/docs/guide-28","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"**内存中的模型**：显示已加载的模型数（**已加载 N 个**）。点开列出每个已加载的模型及其设备、权重占用的内存，以及它是 **忙碌** 还是 **空闲**；可以 **卸载** 单个模型，或点 **释放显存** 一次卸载所有空闲的模型。上一个请求失败的引擎也会列出，并附上错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8270":{"id":"/docs/guide-29","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"**帮助**：在浏览器的新标签页中打开本文档。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8271":{"id":"/docs/guide-30","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"**主题**：在浅色、深色和跟随系统之间切换。更多外观选项在 **设置 › 外观**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8272":{"id":"/docs/guide-31","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#顶栏","content":"在其他页面启动的任务完成或失败时，屏幕底部会弹出提示；失败的提示带有 **查看日志** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8273":{"id":"/docs/guide-32","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#页面底部","content":"**合成**、**工具** 等页面的主要按钮固定在页面底部，旁边是本页启动的任务卡片和错误说明。错误说明包括 **原因**、**解决办法**，以及可展开的 **详情**，可以一键 **复制**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8274":{"id":"/docs/guide-33","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#页面底部","content":"模型还没准备好时，底部的主按钮会换成它缺少的那一步：**启用**、**接受 引擎名 的许可**、安装引擎所缺内容（torch，或需要接受许可的引擎的发行包）的命令，或 **下载 模型名（大小）**，并在执行时显示进度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8275":{"id":"/docs/guide-34","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"合成\" href=\"/docs/guide-speak\" description=\"模型、音色、文本、风格、参数与预设、计划、流式播放和结果。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"8276":{"id":"/docs/guide-35","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"音色\" href=\"/docs/guide-voices\" description=\"音色库：从音频创建、设计、预置说话人、参考音频、微调权重、导出导入。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"8277":{"id":"/docs/guide-36","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"项目\" href=\"/docs/guide-projects\" description=\"长篇朗读：章节与台词、角色表、导入脚本、生成、版本与导出。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"8278":{"id":"/docs/guide-37","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"工具\" href=\"/docs/guide-tools\" description=\"音色转换（CosyVoice）与语音编辑（F5-TTS）。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"8279":{"id":"/docs/guide-38","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"模型\" href=\"/docs/guide-models\" description=\"模型目录、引擎卡片（可用状态、设备、精度、选项、许可）与共享文件。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"8280":{"id":"/docs/guide-39","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"训练\" href=\"/docs/guide-train\" description=\"数据集的建立与预处理，实验的阶段、损失曲线、试听与导出。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"8281":{"id":"/docs/guide-40","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程","content":"<Card title=\"历史\" href=\"/docs/guide-history\" description=\"所有合成结果：搜索、筛选、收藏、再运行、下载与删除。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"8282":{"id":"/docs/guide-41","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide#各页面的教程"