docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"看一眼设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"8498":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-4","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"用演示引擎合成","locale":"zh-CN"},"8499":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-5","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#换成真正的引擎","content":"换成真正的引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"8500":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-6","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#命令行中的同样操作","content":"命令行中的同样操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"8501":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-7","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#接下来","content":"接下来","locale":"zh-CN"},"8502":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-8","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start","content":"本页走最短的路线。每一步的细节见安装和首次运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8503":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-9","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#安装-mizuoto","content":"需要 Python 3.10–3.14。先安装 torch 2.8 或更新版本中适合本机硬件的构建，再从 PyPI 安装 Mizuoto：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8504":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-10","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#安装-mizuoto","content":"AMD、Intel、Apple 芯片和纯 CPU 的 torch 构建，以及从源码或用 Docker 安装，见安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8505":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-11","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#启动网页界面","content":"服务器就绪后终端会打印 `SERVER_READY url=http://127.0.0.1:7869`，浏览器随后自动打开这个地址。默认端口是 **7869**，默认只允许本机访问。按 Ctrl+C 停止服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8506":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-12","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"界面打开后直接进入 **合成** 页，试用之前不需要做任何设置。下载真正的模型之前，值得看一眼两项设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8507":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-13","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"**设置 › 下载 › 下载来源**：模型从哪里下载（**Hugging Face**、**hf-mirror.com**、**ModelScope**；在中国大陆，后两者通常更快）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8508":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-14","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"**设置 › 计算**：本机的显卡和正在使用的 torch 构建，不合适时给出安装正确构建的命令（与 `mizuoto doctor` 的检查相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8509":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-15","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"要立即下载，见下面第 5 步或首次运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8510":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-16","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"演示引擎随 Mizuoto 自带，不需要下载，也不需要 torch，它用音调代替语音，但走的是和真实引擎完全相同的流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8511":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-17","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"在左侧导航栏打开 **合成**（界面默认就在这里）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8512":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-18","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"在 **模型** 中选择 **Dummy voice**（带 **演示** 标记）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8513":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-19","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"在 **音色** 中选择 **预置说话人**，**说话人** 选 `alto`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8514":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-20","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"在 **文本** 中输入任意内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8515":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-21","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"点页面底部的 **合成**（或在文本框中按 Ctrl+Enter）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8516":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-22","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"任务卡片会出现在页面底部，完成后结果出现在 **结果** 中，点播放按钮试听。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8517":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-23","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#换成真正的引擎","content":"打开 **模型** 选择器，选一个真实模型，例如 **Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice**。还没准备好的模型带有 **未下载**、**不可用** 等标记，但仍可以选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8518":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-24","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#换成真正的引擎","content":"页面底部的 **合成** 按钮会换成模型还缺的那一步，这里是 **下载 Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice（大小）**。点它，等进度条走完。（缺少 torch 时，这里显示的是安装它的命令。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"8519":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-25","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#换成真正的引擎","content":"下载完成后 **合成** 按钮回来了。选一个 **预置说话人**，可以在 **风格** 的 **怎么说** 中写一句指令（如“开心地，稍快一些”），然后点 **合成**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8520":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-26","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#换成真正的引擎","content":"下载是任务，可以离开页面，进度在右上角的 **任务** 中查看。第一次合成会先加载模型，之后会快很多。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8521":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-27","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#接下来","content":"克隆自己的声音：音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8522":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-28","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#接下来","content":"合成页每个选项的含义：合成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8523":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-29","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#接下来","content":"朗读一整本书或一段多人对话：项目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8524":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-30","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#接下来","content":"有 NVIDIA 显卡却没被用上，或下载很慢：首次运行和常见问题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8525":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","type":"page","content":"HTTP API","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto Documentation","Advanced"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-api","locale":"en"},"8526":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-0","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api","content":"Mizuoto's REST API, access control, jobs, events, streaming synthesis and the OpenAI-compatible /v1/audio/speech, with curl and Python examples.","locale":"en"},"8527":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-1","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","ty