/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#openai-compatible-api","content":"`audio` with `wav` or `pcm` streams the audio as it is made; `sse` is not supported","locale":"en"},"8839":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-313","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#openai-compatible-api","content":"Parameters are lenient here: one the model does not take is dropped rather than refused. Errors take OpenAI's shape, `{\"error\": {\"message\", \"type\", \"param\", \"code\"}}`, with Mizuoto's error code as `code`. A successful answer carries `X-Mizuoto-Job` and `X-Mizuoto-Model` headers.","locale":"en"},"8840":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-314","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#openai-compatible-api","content":"Give the usual names aliases first:","locale":"en"},"8841":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-315","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#next","content":"Using Mizuoto from Python: call the core services without HTTP, or embed the server in your own program.","locale":"en"},"8842":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-316","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#next","content":"Command line: the same operations in a terminal.","locale":"en"},"8843":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-317","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#next","content":"Remote hosts: run engines on another machine.","locale":"en"},"8844":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","type":"page","content":"Docker","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto Documentation","Advanced"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","locale":"en"},"8845":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-0","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","content":"Build a Mizuoto image from the repository's Dockerfile: its