pe":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"VoiceDesign (voice from a description)","locale":"en"},"9399":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-150","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"4.3 GB","locale":"en"},"9400":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-151","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"4.3 GB","locale":"en"},"9401":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-152","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"yes","locale":"en"},"9402":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-153","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**Capabilities**: Base has **Clone a voice** and **Clone without a transcript**; CustomVoice has **Preset speakers** and **Instructions** (the 0.6B has no instructions: upstream drops them silently, so Mizuoto does not declare them); VoiceDesign has **Design from a description**. Every variant has **Streaming** (frame by frame, the first audio after about 0.3 s on a GPU), **Batches** (up to 8) and **Seed**.","locale":"en"},"9403":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-154","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**Preset speakers**: aiden, dylan, eric, ono_anna, ryan, serena, sohee, uncle_fu, vivian.","locale":"en"},"9404":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-155","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**Languages**: zh, en, de, it, pt, es, ja, ko, fr, ru.","locale":"en"},"9405":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-156","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**Reference clips**: 1–30 s, at least 16 kHz (3–20 s works best). With the clip's transcript it follows the voice more closely.","locale":"en"},"9406":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-157","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**Long text**: upstream does not split it, so Mizuoto does.","locale":"en"},"9407":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-158","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**Training**: **Teach it a speaker** (`speaker`, the 1.7B Base only): upstream's single-speaker fine-tune (`sft_12hz.py`), reimplemented; the Base model learns the dataset's voice and is exported as a new CustomVoice model with that voice as its preset speaker. A few minutes of one speaker; 24 GB of GPU memory or more for the 1.7B.","locale":"en"},"9408":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-159","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**Load options**: Attention follows the attention settings. `fused_projections` (off) is a fast mode: each layer's q/k/v and gate/up projections become one product each, a few percent faster on a GPU, where the audio is then no longer bit-identical to the original implementation's (outputs list `fused_projections`).","locale":"en"},"9409":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-160","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"Alibaba Tongyi's LLM + flow-matching TTS. Best for: low-latency token-level streaming, speaking text as it is written (streamed text input), converting a recording to another voice, and instructions for dialects, emotions and speed.","locale":"en"},"9410":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-161","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"Model","locale":"en"},"9411":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-162","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":