le there: on gpu-box, mizuoto doctor qwen3tts)`.","locale":"en"},"9990":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-85","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#moving-an-engine-to-a-host","content":"**Models** › **Engines**: in the engine card's **Device**, pick a device of the remote host (shown as `host · device`).","locale":"en"},"9991":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-86","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#moving-an-engine-to-a-host","content":"An engine on a remote host is marked **On gpu-box** (the host's name) on its engine card and model rows, with the hints **Its packages are gpu-box’s: mizuoto doctor qwen3tts there** for the engine and **These are the models on gpu-box: download them there with mizuoto model download** for its models.","locale":"en"},"9992":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-87","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#listing-and-removing","content":"`remote list` contacts every host again. Removing a host sets the engines that used it back to `auto`, on this machine.","locale":"en"},"9993":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-88","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#when-something-fails","content":"Situation","locale":"en"},"9994":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-89","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#when-something-fails","content":"Error","locale":"en"},"9995":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-90","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#when-something-fails","content":"Notes","locale":"en"},"9996":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-91","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#when-something-fails","content":"The agent cannot be reached","locale":"en"},"9997":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remo