 on a trusted network, through a VPN or an SSH tunnel, or give the agent a certificate (`--ssl-certfile`) and add `--tls` on the host.","locale":"en"},"10032":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-127","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#security","content":"With a self-signed agent certificate, give that certificate as `--ca-file` on the host; the host name in the certificate is then not checked. Without `--ca-file` the system's CAs are used.","locale":"en"},"10033":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-128","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#security","content":"Tokens never appear in `mizuoto config show` or the settings the API returns, only whether one is set.","locale":"en"},"10034":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-129","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#http-api","content":"Method and path","locale":"en"},"10035":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-130","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#http-api","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"10036":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-131","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#http-api","content":"`GET /api/v1/remote/hosts?refresh=true`","locale":"en"},"10037":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-132","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#http-api","content":"Each host's state (`refresh` reconnects)","locale":"en"},"10038":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-133","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#http-api","content":"`PUT /api/v1/remote/hosts/{name}`","locale":"en"},"10039":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-134","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#http-api","content":"Add or change: `{\"address\", \"to