onfig","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#where-settings-come-from","content":"the built-in defaults;","locale":"en"},"10698":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-19","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#where-settings-come-from","content":"`settings.toml` (in the data folder by default);","locale":"en"},"10699":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-20","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#where-settings-come-from","content":"environment variables `MIZUOTO_<GROUP>__<FIELD>`;","locale":"en"},"10700":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-21","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#where-settings-come-from","content":"values pinned by an application embedding Mizuoto (only then; see Using Mizuoto from Python).","locale":"en"},"10701":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-22","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#where-settings-come-from","content":"Environment variables and pinned values live in memory only: they are **never written back** to `settings.toml` and cannot be changed in the web UI or through the API. The web UI marks a setting an environment variable overrides **Set by an environment variable**, and one the embedding application pins **Set by the application Mizuoto runs in**; `mizuoto config set` on a setting an environment variable overrides says `An environment variable overrides this setting.`.","locale":"en"},"10702":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-23","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#the-data-folder-and-the-settings-file","content":"The data folder holds the settings, the database, models, voices and outputs. By default:","locale":"en"},"10703":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-24","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#the-data-folder-and-the-settings-file","content":"System","locale":"en"},"10704":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-25","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#the-data-folder-and-the-settings-file","content":"Location","locale":"en"},"10705":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-26","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#the-data-folder-and-the-settings-file","content":"Linux","locale":"en"},"10706":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-27","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#the-data-folder-and-the-settings-file","content":"`$XDG_DATA_HOME/mizuoto`, else `~/.local/share/mizuoto`","locale":"en"},"10707":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-28","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#the-data-folder-and-the-settings-file","content":"macOS","locale":"en"},"10708":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-29","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#the-data-folder-and-the-settings-file","content":"`~/Library/Application Support/mizuoto`","locale":"en"},"10709":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-30","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#the-data-folder-and-the-settings-file","content":"Windows","locale":"en"},"10710":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-31","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#the-data-folder-and-the-settings-file","content":"`%APPDATA%\\mizuoto`","locale":"en"},"10711":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-32","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#the-data-folder-and-the-settings-file","content":"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR` or `mizuoto webui --data-dir <path>` puts it elsewhere. `settings.toml` sits in the data folder unless `MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR` or `webui --config-dir` names another folder for it (the data stays in the data folder). **Settings** › **About** in the web UI shows the **Data folder** and the **Settings file**.","locale":"en"},"10712":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-33","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#the-data-folder-and-the-settings-file","content":"To have `mizuoto config`, `mizuoto speak` and the rest use the same data folder as a server, the environment variable is the easy way: `--data-dir` is an option of `webui` only.","locale":"en"},"10713":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-34","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#layout","content":"The `paths.*` settings move models, voices, outputs, datasets, experiments, projects and caches elsewhere one by one; empty means inside the data folder, and so does a relative folder (`results` is `<data folder>/results`, whatever folder Mizuoto is started from).","locale":"en"},"10714":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-35","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#viewing-and-changing-settings","content":"Keys are dotted; values are parsed as JSON (numbers, `true`/`false`, lists, objects), else taken as a string; `null` clears a setting that may be empty. The whole file is validated before it is written: a value out of range, of the wrong type, or an unknown key is an error (exit code 4) and the file stays as it was.","locale":"en"},"10715":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-36","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#viewing-and-changing-settings","content":"Dictionary settings take new keys: `engines.<engine id>.<field>`, `engines.<engine id>.load_options.<option>`, `tts.model_aliases.<alias>`. `mizuoto config set` does not check load option names and values; the web UI and the API check them against the engine's manifest.","locale":"en"},"10716":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-37","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#viewing-and-changing-settings","content":"`config show` and `config get` never show tokens, only whether `access_token_configured` and `token_configured` are set; `config set` on a token prints `(hidden)`. `config show` also lists `resolved_paths` (the folders in use where settings are empty), `env_overrides` (the environment variables in effect) and `pinned` (what the embedding application pins).","locale":"en"},"10717":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-38","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#viewing-and-changing-settings","content":"A running server reads changes to the file within about a second, and open web UIs refresh; saving in the web UI afterwards merges with the file as it is, so it keeps the command line's changes. A broken file makes the server log `Ignored a change to … settings.toml` and keep its settings. `server.host`, `server.port` and the certificates take effect the next time the server starts; changing `engines.<id>.*` unloads that engine's models, which load with the new settings when next used.","locale":"en"},"10718":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-39","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#viewing-and-changing-settings","content":"Keys Mizuoto does not know are ignored when `settings.toml` is read.","locale":"en"},"10719":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-40","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"`mizuoto env vars` lists the environment variables Mizuoto reads, and the `MIZUOTO_*` variables set now:","locale":"en"},"10720":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-41","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"Variable","locale":"en"},"10721":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-42","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"10722":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-43","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`","locale":"en"},"10723":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-44","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"The data folder","locale":"en"},"10724":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-45","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"`MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR`","locale":"en"},"10725":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-46","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"The folder for `settings.toml`, when it should not sit in the data folder","locale":"en"},"10726":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-47","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"`MIZUOTO_LOG_LEVEL`","locale":"en"},"10727":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-48","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"Log level: `DEBUG`, `INFO`, `WARNING` or `ERROR` (default `INFO`)","locale":"en"},"10728":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-49","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"`MIZUOTO_<GROUP>__<FIELD>`","locale":"en"},"10729":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-50","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"Override one setting, e.g. `MIZUOTO_SERVER__PORT=8000` or `MIZUOTO_DOWNLOADS__SOURCE=hf-mirror`","locale":"en"},"10730":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-51","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"`HF_TOKEN`","locale":"en"},"10731":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-52","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"A Hugging Face token, sent to huggingface.co only (never to a mirror) when downloading models","locale":"en"},"10732":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-53","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"How overrides work:","locale":"en"},"10733":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-54","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"The `MIZUOTO_` prefix is dropped and the rest lower-cased; `__` (two underscores) goes one level down: `MIZUOTO_COMPUTE__GPU_JOBS` is `compute.gpu_jobs`, `MIZUOTO_ENGINES__QWEN3TTS__DEVICE` is `engines.qwen3tts.device`, `MIZUOTO_REMOTE__AGENT__PORT` is `remote.agent.port`.","locale":"en"},"10734":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-55","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"A value that parses as JSON is used as JSON (numbers, `true`/`false`, lists, objects), else as a string; `null` or `none` means empty.","locale":"en"},"10735":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-56","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#environment-variables","content":"Only `MIZUOTO_*` variables whose names contain `__` are overrides.","locale":"en"},"10736":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-57","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#all-settings","content":"The \"UI\" column names the place in the web UI's **Settings**; engine settings are on the engine's card in **Models** › **Engines**.","locale":"en"},"10737":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-58","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#server","content":"Key","locale":"en"},"10738":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-59","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#server","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"10739":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-60","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/cli-config#server","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"10740":{"id":"/en/docs/cli-config-61","page_id":"/en/docs/cli-config","tags":[],"ty