ERT, VITS, plus the s3tokenizer (q and k each scaled by d^-¼), MelStyle and G2PW's BERT. They stay hand-written, since no fused kernel computes them. `Site(swappable=False)` keeps a site on its reference whatever the policy; `approx_ok=False` refuses every backend that is not exact.","locale":"en"},"11306":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-87","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"11307":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-88","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"Values","locale":"en"},"11308":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-89","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"11309":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-90","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"`compute.attention`","locale":"en"},"11310":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-91","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"`auto`, `fast`, `sdpa`, `math`, `sdpa_flash`, `sdpa_efficient`, `sdpa_cudnn`, `flash`, `xformers`, `sage`, `sage3`","locale":"en"},"11311":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-92","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"`auto`","locale":"en"},"11312":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-93","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"`engines.<id>.attention`","locale":"en"},"11313":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-94","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tag