ow **Set by the application Mizuoto runs in**. The settings file and the environment variables are described in full in Configuration and environment variables.","locale":"en"},"16277":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-12","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"16278":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-13","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"What it does","locale":"en"},"16279":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-14","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"**Language**","locale":"en"},"16280":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-15","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"The UI's language; **Auto** follows the browser","locale":"en"},"16281":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-16","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"**Open the browser when the server starts**","locale":"en"},"16282":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-17","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Whether `mizuoto webui` opens a browser","locale":"en"},"16283":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-18","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"**Server address**, **Port**","locale":"en"},"16284":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-19","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"The address to listen on (`127.0.0.1` by default: this machine only) and the port (7869 by default). **Takes effect the next time the server starts.**","locale":"en"},"16285":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-20","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"**Access token**","locale":"en"},"16286":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-21","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Shows **An access token is set** or **No access token**. Type one and click **Set token**; **Clear token** removes it. With a token set, every API request must carry it, and the browser asks for it","locale":"en"},"16287":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-22","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Set an access token before letting other machines connect; see Remote access and security.","locale":"en"},"16288":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-23","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"16289":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-24","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"16290":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-25","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"What it does","locale":"en"},"16291":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-26","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"**Default device**","locale":"en"},"16292":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-27","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"**Automatic**","locale":"en"},"16293":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-28","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"The device used by engines whose device is automatic; any device found on this machine","locale":"en"},"16294":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-29","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"**Unload models after idle minutes (0: never)**","locale":"en"},"16295":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-30","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"20","locale":"en"},"16296":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-31","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"A model unused this long is unloaded","locale":"en"},"16297":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-32","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"**Models kept in memory**","locale":"en"},"16298":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-33","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"3","locale":"en"},"16299":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-34","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"Models kept loaded at once, across all engines; beyond it the least recently used idle one is unloaded first","locale":"en"},"16300":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-35","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"**GPU jobs at once**","locale":"en"},"16301":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-36","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"1","locale":"en"},"16302":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-37","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"GPU jobs that may run at once on one device","locale":"en"},"16303":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-38","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"**Synthesis jobs at once**","locale":"en"},"16304":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-39","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"1","locale":"en"},"16305":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-40","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"Synthesis jobs (speak, voice conversion, speech editing) that run at once, across every engine and device; more wait in the queue in order, showing **Waiting for other synthesis jobs**. Requests run together as one batch (**Run waiting requests together**) count as one job","locale":"en"},"16306":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-41","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"**Compile models (torch.compile)**","locale":"en"},"16307":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-42","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"off","locale":"en"},"16308":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-43","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"Faster synthesis on F5-TTS, CosyVoice, GPT-SoVITS v4/v5, IndexTTS and Fish Speech S2 Pro; the first synthesis of each new length is slower while it compiles. Needs a C++ compiler, else the engines run as before (with one warning). Applies to models loaded afterwards","locale":"en"},"16309":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-44","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#compute","content":"Below them are this machine's devices, with each GPU's used and total memory, and the torch in use with its build. When torch is missing or its build does not suit this machine, the problem is shown with the command that installs the right build. Each engine's own device and precision are set under **Models › Engines**; the models loaded now are in the top bar's **Models in memory**.","locale":"en"},"16310":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-45","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#remote-hosts","content":"Engines can run on other machines: run `mizuoto agent` there (it has its own engines and models), add it here, then choose it as an engine's device under **Models › Engines**. Training stays on this machine.","locale":"en"},"16311":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-46","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#remote-hosts","content":"Each host shows its state (**Online**, **Offline**, **Refused**), **Devices**, **Installed engines** and **Used by**, and can be changed or removed. **Check again** refreshes every host.","locale":"en"},"16312":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-47","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#remote-hosts","content":"**Add a host**: a **Name** (engines name it in their device: `name/cuda:0`), the **Address** (such as `192.168.1.20:7870`), the **Token** (the agent prints it when it makes one), **TLS** and a **CA file on this machine** when needed; then **Add**.","locale":"en"},"16313":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-48","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#remote-hosts","content":"When a host is removed, the engines that ran there run on this machine again.","locale":"en"},"16314":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-49","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#remote-hosts","content":"More in Remote hosts.","locale":"en"},"16315":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-50","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#speech","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"16316":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-51","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#speech","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"16317":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-52","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#speech","content":