*, **High**","locale":"en"},"16392":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-127","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#appearance","content":"**Motion**","locale":"en"},"16393":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-128","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#appearance","content":"**As the system** or **Reduced**; **Preview** plays an animation","locale":"en"},"16394":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-129","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#about","content":"Shows Mizuoto's version, the **Data folder**, the **Settings file**, the compute backend, and the licence note: Mizuoto is GPL-3.0, each engine under its own licence (see **Models › Engines**).","locale":"en"},"16395":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"page","content":"Speak","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto Documentation","Guides"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak","locale":"en"},"16396":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-0","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak","content":"The Speak screen: choose a model and a voice, type the text, set the style and parameters, look at the plan, speak or stream, and use the results.","locale":"en"},"16397":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-1","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#model","content":"Model","locale":"en"},"16398":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-2","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"When the model is not ready","locale":"en"},"16399":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-3","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"Voice","locale":"en"},"16400":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-4","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#library-voice","content":"Library voice","locale":"en"},"16401":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-5","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#a-clip","content":"A clip","locale":"en"},"16402":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-6","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#transcripts-and-speech-recognition","content":"Transcripts and speech recognition","locale":"en"},"16403":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-7","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#text","content":"Text","locale":"en"},"16404":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-8","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"Style","locale":"en"},"16405":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-9","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#parameters","content":"Parameters","locale":"en"},"16406":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-10","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#presets","content":"Presets","locale":"en"},"16407":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-11","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#plan-speak-and-stream","content":"Plan, Speak and Stream","locale":"en"},"16408":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-12","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Results","locale":"en"},"16409":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-13","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#command-line","content":"Command line","locale":"en"},"16410":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-14","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak","content":"**Speak** turns text into speech. From top to bottom the screen has **Model**, **Voice**, **Text**, **Style** (when the model has it), **Parameters** and **Results**; the **Speak** button stays at the bottom of the page. Each part shows only what the chosen model supports, so the screen changes with the model. What you set is kept when you choose another model, and comes back when you choose the first one again, but a model is only sent what it shows: an emotion set for IndexTTS-2, say, is not sent to Qwen3-TTS. Parameters are the exception: each model starts from its own defaults (or its default preset).","locale":"en"},"16411":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-15","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#model","content":"Click **Model** to open the picker; it can be searched. It lists every model of every speech engine (installed or not), each with its engine, variant, size and GPU memory, and badges for what is missing: **demo** (the dummy engine), **Not available** (the engine needs something installed), **Licence** (a licence to accept), the model's state (such as **Not downloaded**) and **recommended**.","locale":"en"},"16412":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-16","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#model","content":"Badges under the model list its capabilities, such as **Clone a voice**, **Preset speakers**, **Instructions**, **Streaming** and **Long text**.","locale":"en"},"16413":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-17","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#model","content":"The first time, the screen picks **Settings › Speech › Default model**, or else the first model that is ready. Then it remembers your last choice.","locale":"en"},"16414":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-18","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"A model that is not ready can still be chosen. The **Speak** button at the bottom is then replaced by the **first** thing it needs; click it to start, with its progress:","locale":"en"},"16415":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-19","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"Button","locale":"en"},"16416":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-20","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"Why","locale":"en"},"16417":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-21","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"**Enable**","locale":"en"},"16418":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-22","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"The engine is disabled under **Models › Engines**","locale":"en"},"16419":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-23","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"**Accept the** *engine* **licence**","locale":"en"},"16420":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-24","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"A licence-gated engine (Fish Speech, IndexTTS): opens the licence dialog","locale":"en"},"16421":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-25","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"*engine* **needs** *torch*… with the install command","locale":"en"},"16422":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-26","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"The engine is not available: torch, or a licence-gated engine's package, is not installed. Install it into Mizuoto's Python, then restart Mizuoto","locale":"en"},"16423":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-27","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"**Download** *model* *(size)*","locale":"en"},"16424":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-28","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"The model is not downloaded","locale":"en"},"16425":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-29","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"When all is done the **Speak** button is back.","locale":"en"},"16426":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-30","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"Models get their voice in different ways; **Voice** offers the ones the model supports:","locale":"en"},"16427":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-31","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"Way","locale":"en"},"16428":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-32","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"Use","locale":"en"},"16429":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-33","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"**Library voice**","locale":"en"},"16430":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-34","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"A voice from the voice library","locale":"en"},"16431":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-35","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"**A clip**","locale":"en"},"16432":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-36","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"Upload or record a reference clip and clone its voice","locale":"en"},"16433":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-37","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"**Preset speaker**","locale":"en"},"16434":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-38","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"One of the model's own speakers (Qwen3-TTS CustomVoice, CosyVoice 300M SFT…)","locale":"en"},"16435":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-39","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"**Describe**","locale":"en"},"16436":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-40","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"A description in words (Qwen3-TTS VoiceDesign, VoxCPM2), or choices from fixed attributes (OmniVoice)","locale":"en"},"16437":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-41","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"**Its own voice**","locale":"en"},"16438":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-42","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"No voice given: the model speaks in its own voice","locale":"en"},"16439":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-43","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"After a model change the screen picks a suitable way: the library voice you had chosen when it suits the new model, else a preset speaker, a description or a clip, in that order.","locale":"en"},"16440":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-44","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#library-voice","content":"Every voice in the picker carries badges saying how **this model** can use it: **Clone**, **Clone (no transcript)**, **Preset speaker**, **Designed** and so on; and when more is needed, **transcribed first** (the clip has no transcript, so it is transcribed before speaking) or **trimmed to fit** (the clip is too long and will be cut). Voices the model cannot use are greyed, with the reason. With an empty library, **New voice** is offered.","locale":"en"},"16441":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-45","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#a-clip","content":"Drop audio on **Drop audio files here**, or click it to choose a file (WAV, FLAC, MP3, M4A, OGG…). Or:","locale":"en"},"16442":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-46","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#a-clip","content":"**Record** with the microphone. While recording it shows the **Input level** and **A voice reference works best between 3 and 30 seconds of clear speech.**; then **Stop and add** or **Discard**. Browsers allow the microphone only over HTTPS or on this computer (localhost).","locale":"en"},"16443":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-47","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#a-clip","content":"**Server files** picks a file on the server (only in a browser on the server machine).","locale":"en"},"16444":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-48","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#a-clip","content":"**Earlier results** picks a synthesized result.","locale":"en"},"16445":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-49","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#a-clip","content":"Type the clip's text under **What is said in the clip**. **Transcribe** has speech recognition fill it in now, for you to correct.","locale":"en"},"16446":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-50","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#transcripts-and-speech-recognition","content":"Most models need the reference clip's text to clone it. When you leave it empty:","locale":"en"},"16447":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-51","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#transcripts-and-speech-recognition","content":"With **Settings › Speech › Transcribe reference clips without a transcript** on and speech recognition installed, Mizuoto looks in its transcript cache, else transcribes the clip first in the speak job (the plan says **transcribed first**). A library voice keeps the transcript it gets.","locale":"en"},"16448":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-52","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#transcripts-and-speech-recognition","content":"Without speech recognition, a model that clones without a transcript does so (**Clone (no transcript)**); otherwise you get an error saying how to install speech recognition.","locale":"en"},"16449":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-53","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#transcripts-and-speech-recognition","content":"A clip longer than the model allows follows **Settings › Speech › A reference clip too long for a model**: by default **Cut it to fit** (at the quietest point before the limit; its transcript is then dropped), or **Refuse it**.","locale":"en"},"16450":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-54","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#text","content":"The **Text** box takes up to 20,000 characters. Ctrl+Enter in it speaks.","locale":"en"},"16451":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-55","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#text","content":"**Language**: **Detect**, or one of the model's languages.","locale":"en"},"16452":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-56","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#text","content":"**One result per line**: only for models that take batches (Qwen3-TTS, GPT-SoVITS, OmniVoice); each line becomes its own result.","locale":"en"},"16453":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-57","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#text","content":"A moment after you stop typing, the box shows how Mizuoto will cut long text (**N segments**, one chip each), or **The engine splits long text itself** when the model handles long text. The parameter **Pause between segments (ms)** sets the silence between segments.","locale":"en"},"16454":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-58","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"Shown only when the model takes instructions or emotions.","locale":"en"},"16455":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-59","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"**How to say it**: a style instruction such as \"Cheerfully, a little faster\" (Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice, CosyVoice 2 and 3, CosyVoice 300M Instruct). Some models follow it only with one kind of voice (CosyVoice 2 and 3 with a reference clip, CosyVoice 300M Instruct with a preset speaker); with another, the field is greyed out and says which.","locale":"en"},"16456":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-60","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"Emotion (IndexTTS-2 and 2.5) comes three ways, as the model supports:","locale":"en"},"16457":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-61","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"**Emotion weights**: a 0–1 slider per emotion (**Happy**, **Angry**, **Sad**, **Afraid**, **Disgusted**, **Melancholic**, **Surprised**, **Calm**).","locale":"en"},"16458":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-62","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"**From a clip**: an **Emotion clip**; only the clip's emotion is borrowed, not its voice; **Strength** 0–2.","locale":"en"},"16459":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-63","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"**Described**: write it under **The emotion, described**.","locale":"en"},"16460":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-64","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#parameters","content":"**Parameters** lists only what this model takes; a value you leave alone is not sent, so the engine uses its own default. The engine's own options are under **Engine options**.","locale":"en"},"16461":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-65","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#parameters","content":"**Seed**: empty means **A new seed each time**; a number means **Keep this seed**, so the same input gives the same result. The dice button is **Roll a seed**; the unlock button goes back to a new seed each time.","locale":"en"},"16462":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-66","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#parameters","content":"**Output**: **Format** (WAV, FLAC, MP3, OGG, M4A), **Sample rate** (**The model’s own**, or 16–48 kHz) and **Levelling** (**Peak**, **Loudness**, **None**). The defaults come from **Settings › Speech**.","locale":"en"},"16463":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-67","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#presets","content":"**Presets** opens a menu:","locale":"en"},"16464":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-68","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#presets","content":"Click a preset to apply it (marked **default** or **every model**).","locale":"en"},"16465":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-69","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#presets","content":"**Save as a preset…**: a **Preset name**; with **Only for** *model* checked it keeps every parameter, otherwise only the common parameters, for every model (a preset holding engine options is for the current model only). **Apply it whenever this model is picked** makes it the model's default.","locale":"en"},"16466":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-70","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#presets","content":"**Manage presets…**: **Make it the default**, **Stop it being the default**, delete.","locale":"en"},"16467":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-71","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#presets","content":"When a model is picked, its default preset is applied; the chosen voice's own default preset comes first.","locale":"en"},"16468":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-72","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#plan-speak-and-stream","content":"**Plan** shows **What will happen** without speaking: the model, the voice mode, language, device, the number of segments, the parameters sent, each reference clip (and whether it is **transcribed first**) and **Notes**. Unsuitable settings fail here already.","locale":"en"},"16469":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-73","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#plan-speak-and-stream","content":"**Speak** submits a speak job. Its card shows at the bottom of the page; when it is done the result appears under **Results**. Several jobs fold into one line, **… jobs**, saying how many run and how many wait (**… running · … waiting**), with their progress together and a button that cancels them all; open it to see each job's card in a list that scrolls. Synthesis jobs run one at a time by default, across all engines and devices; the others wait in order, showing **Waiting for other synthesis jobs** (**Settings › Compute › Synthesis jobs at once**).","locale":"en"},"16470":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-74","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#plan-speak-and-stream","content":"**Stream**: with this switch (beside **Plan** and **Speak**) on, **Speak** plays the audio as it is made. Hover over it to see how this model streams: CosyVoice starts within moments of the first words; the other engines play each sentence as soon as it is ready; or Mizuoto splits the text and plays each part as soon as it is ready. The player bar shows **… played · … ready ahead** and offers **Stop**. When the model falls behind, playback pauses and waits rather than dropping speech; the whole result is still kept under **Results**.","locale":"en"},"16471":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-75","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Results** lists what you spoke on this screen. Each shows its text, duration, waveform (click or drag to seek), model, time taken, real-time factor (RTF) and seed, with any warnings and licence notices. Its menu:","locale":"en"},"16472":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-76","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Action","locale":"en"},"16473":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-77","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"What it does","locale":"en"},"16474":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-78","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Favourite** / **Not a favourite**","locale":"en"},"16475":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-79","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"History can show favourites only","locale":"en"},"16476":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-80","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Download**","locale":"en"},"16477":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-81","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Download the file","locale":"en"},"16478":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-82","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Show in folder**","locale":"en"},"16479":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-83","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Only in a browser on the server machine","locale":"en"},"16480":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-84","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Analyse**","locale":"en"},"16481":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-85","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Its spectrogram (a voice's high-frequency cut-off, noise, clicks) and pitch curve (octave jumps, monotone stretches), with its format, median pitch and how much of it is voiced; computed on the server once, then cached","locale":"en"},"16482":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-86","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Use as a reference clip**","locale":"en"},"16483":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-87","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Use this result as **A clip**, with its text as the transcript","locale":"en"},"16484":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-88","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Keep as a voice**","locale":"en"},"16485":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-89","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Type the **Name of the new voice** to put it in the library","locale":"en"},"16486":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-90","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Run again with these settings**","locale":"en"},"16487":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-91","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Load the model, voice, text and parameters that made it back into Speak","locale":"en"},"16488":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-92","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Delete**","locale":"en"},"16489":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-93","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Delete the result","locale":"en"},"16490":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-94","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"With more than one result, **Download all** downloads them together.","locale":"en"},"16491":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-95","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#command-line","content":"`mizuoto speak --help` lists every option (`--describe`, `--attr`, `--emotion-audio`, `--batch`, `--use-preset` and more); see the command reference.","locale":"en"},"16492":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","type":"page","content":"Tools","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto Documentation","Guides"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-tools","locale":"en"},"16493":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-0","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools","content":"The Tools screen: say a recording in another voice with CosyVoice, and replace words in a recording with F5-TTS.","locale":"en"},"16494":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-1","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"Convert voice","locale":"en"},"16495":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-2","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"Edit speech","locale":"en"},"16496":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-3","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools","content":"**Tools** has two tabs: **Convert voice** and **Edit speech**. Both start from an existing recording; their results appear under **Results** at the bottom of the page (and in History), with the same menu as in Speak.","locale":"en"},"16497":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-4","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"**Say what a recording says in another voice, keeping its words and timing.** It needs a model with voice conversion: CosyVoice (300M, 300M SFT, 2, 3).","locale":"en"},"16498":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-5","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"Choose a CosyVoice model under **Model**. The picker lists only models that convert voices; when the model is not ready, the button at the bottom offers the step it still needs first, such as the download (see Speak).","locale":"en"},"16499":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-6","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"Add the audio to convert under **Recording**: drop or choose a file, **Record**, **Server files** or **Earlier results**.","locale":"en"},"16500":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-7","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"Under **Target voice**, choose:","locale":"en"},"16501":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-8","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"**Library voice**: a voice from the library; its reference clip is the target voice;","locale":"en"},"16502":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-9","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"**A clip**: a clip of the target voice, given directly.","locale":"en"},"16503":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-10","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"Click **Convert** at the bottom.","locale":"en"},"16504":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-11","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"The command line:","locale":"en"},"16505":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-12","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"**Replace parts of a recording with new words in the same voice.** It needs a model with speech editing: F5-TTS (v1 Base, Base, E2-TTS).","locale":"en"},"16506":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-13","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"Choose an F5-TTS model under **Model**.","locale":"en"},"16507":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-14","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"Add the audio to edit under **Recording**.","locale":"en"},"16508":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-15","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"Under **Changes**, fill in **The whole text after the edit**: everything the recording should say once edited. The easy way: click **Transcribe** to transcribe the recording, then change the words you replace. The model reads this text.","locale":"en"},"16509":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-16","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"Mark each part to replace:","locale":"en"},"16510":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-17","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"**From (s)** and **To (s)**: where the replaced speech is in the recording;","locale":"en"},"16511":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-18","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"**New words**: what this part says now (for the record; the model goes by the whole text above);","locale":"en"},"16512":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-19","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"**Length (s)**: how long the new speech lasts; empty (**Automatic**) keeps the span's length.","locale":"en"},"16513":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-20","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"**Add a change** adds a row; the button at the end of a row removes it. Only rows with a start and an end, the end after the start, are sent.","locale":"en"},"16514":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-21","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"Click **Edit** at the bottom.","locale":"en"},"16515":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-22","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"When something is missing the footer says so: **Add the recording**, **Give the text after the edit**, or **Mark what to replace: from and to, in seconds**.","locale":"en"},"16516":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-23","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"The command line (`--span` is repeatable, `START:END[:SECONDS]` in seconds):","locale":"en"},"16517":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","type":"page","content":"Train","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto Documentation","Guides"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-train","locale":"en"},"16518":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-0","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train","content":"The Train screen: build and prepare datasets, then run each engine's own fine-tuning recipe stage by stage in experiments, with losses and previews, exported as a voice's weights or a new model.","locale":"en"},"16519":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-1","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-train#what-can-be-trained","content":"What can be trained","locale":"en"},"16520":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-2","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-train#datasets","content":"Datasets","locale":"en"},"1