"content":"Training needs nothing beyond Mizuoto and torch: every method runs in Mizuoto's own Python, each stage in a process of its own. Some methods need shared files used only for training, such as GPT-SoVITS's pretrained discriminators (`mizuoto asset download gptsovits/s2d-v2pro`). When something is missing, the new-experiment dialog marks the method **not available** and gives the command to run.","locale":"en"},"16571":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-53","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#what-can-be-trained","content":"Training always runs on this machine, never on a remote host; when an engine's device is on a remote host, its methods are not available. A fine-tune takes its device for itself while it runs. Choose the device under **Settings › Training › Training device**; by default it is **The engine’s device**.","locale":"en"},"16572":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-54","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#a-new-dataset","content":"On the **Datasets** tab, click **New dataset**.","locale":"en"},"16573":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-55","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#a-new-dataset","content":"Type the **Dataset name**, choose the **Language**, and optionally a **Description**.","locale":"en"},"16574":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-56","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#a-new-dataset","content":"Click **Create**; the dataset's page opens.","locale":"en"},"16575":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-57","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#a-new-dataset","content":"A dataset is saved in `datasets/<name>/` in the data folder: `dataset.json`, `manifest.jsonl` with one row per clip, and FLAC clips in `audio/`.","locale":"en"},"16576":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-58","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#adding-clips","content":"The **Add clips** part of a dataset's page offers several sources:","locale":"en"},"16577":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-59","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#adding-clips","content":"**Audio files or recordings**: drop or choose files, **Record**, or **Server files**. Optionally say who speaks in them under **Speaker**, then click **Add (N)**.","locale":"en"},"16578":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-60","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#adding-clips","content":"**A voice’s clips**: choose a library voice and click **Add** to add its reference clips and their text.","locale":"en"},"16579":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-61","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#adding-clips","content":"**Earlier results**: pick synthesized results. They come with their licence tags; results whose licence forbids training other engines (Fish Speech's, for example) are refused when training.","locale":"en"},"16580":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-62","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#adding-clips","content":"**Add a server folder** (only in a browser on the server machine): choose the **Folder layout**, then the folder:","locale":"en"},"16581":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-63","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#adding-clips","content":"Folder layout","locale":"en"},"16582":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-64","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#adding-clips","content":"Contents","locale":"en"},"16583":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-65","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#adding-clips","content":"**Find out**","locale":"en"},"16584":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-66","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en