ompute.compile` wraps the flow estimator. On the CPU it gains nothing (the U-Net's convolutions and products are already library kernels); the mel stays within 5.7e-6 of eager, which HiFT's F0-driven source amplifies to about 1e-2 in the audio (47 dB), as eager with another thread count also does."],[15479,"`compute.compile` wraps v4/v5's CFM estimator (each SoVITS loaded, a voice's own too): 7 % faster warm on the CPU, within 3.1e-5 of eager (87 dB)."],[6684,"`compute.compile` 包装 flow 估计器。在 CPU 上没有收益（U-Net 的卷积和矩阵乘法已经是库内核）；mel 与 eager 相差不超过 5.7e-6，HiFT 由 F0 驱动的源把它放大到音频中约 1e-2（47 dB），换一个线程数的 eager 运行也会如此。"],[6955,"`compute.compile` 包装 v4/v5 的 CFM 估计器（每个加载的 SoVITS，包括音色自己的）：在 CPU 上预热后快 7 %，与即时执行相差不超过 3.1e-5（87 dB）。"],[6749,"`compute.compile` 用 `torch.compile(dynamic=True)` 包装 DiT 或 UNetT。在 CPU 上以 fp32、8 线程运行时，transformer 预热后的耗时下降 23 %（一个请求从 60 秒降到 45 秒）；第一个请求要付出约 30 秒的编译时间；音频与 eager 的差异在 9.2e-5 以内（89 dB）。`compute.cpu_allocator` 和 `compute.cpu_threads` 的 CPU 分配器与线程绑定，能让 F5-TTS 在 Linux 上快 10–20 %，且不改变任何结果。"],[13917,"`compute.compile`, fp32, 8 threads; time of the compiled module, warm:"],[5393,"`compute.compile`，fp32，8 线程；被编译模块预热后的耗时："],[15313,"`compute.compile`: the decoding step's pieces under `torch.compile` (`Fused`)"],[6789,"`compute.compile`：用 `torch.compile` 编译的解码步骤各部分（`Fused`）"],[2735,"`compute.compile`（关）"],[4443,"`compute.compile`（可选，不精确；加速）在同样的 CUDA 图里把这些小内核融合起来。显卡和条件相同："],[1318,"`compute.compile`（默认关，界面为 **设置** › **计算** › **编译模型（torch.compile）**）用 `torch.compile` 编译部分引擎最耗时的模块："],[1373,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[2354,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[2983,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[9897,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[10878,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[11507,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[12777,"`compute.cpu_allocator` and `compute.cpu_threads` (Acceleration)"],[4253,"`compute.cpu_allocator` 和 `compute.cpu_threads`（加速）"],[11244,"`compute.cpu_allocator`, `compute.cpu_threads` (`auto`)"],[2720,"`compute.cpu_allocator`、`compute.cpu_threads`（`auto`）"],[1376,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[2358,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[2986,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[9900,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[10882,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[11510,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[1307,"`compute.cuda_allocator`"],[2350,"`compute.cuda_allocator`"],[9831,"`compute.cuda_allocator`"],[10874,"`compute.cuda_allocator`"],[12635,"`compute.cuda_allocator` (`native`, `async`: cudaMallocAsync, `expandable`: expandable segments; `auto` is `native`) is set by the host in `PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF` before CUDA is first used, never by engine code, and handed to training stages in their environment (`allocator_env`), whether or not the host has loaded a model. A value the environment already sets wins; a change applies at the next start. Under `async` no CUDA graphs are captured (`graphs.usable`): the stream-ordered allocator frees a capture's warm-up temporaries in a way that made replays fault with an illegal memory access."],[4111,"`compute.cuda_allocator`（`native`；`async`：cudaMallocAsync；`expandable`：可扩展段；`auto` 即 `native`）由主机在第一次使用 CUDA 之前写入 `PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF`，从不由引擎代码设置，并通过环境传给训练阶段（`allocator_env`），无论主机是否已加载模型。环境中已设置的值优先；修改在下次启动时生效。在 `async` 下不捕获 CUDA Graph（`graphs.usable`）：这种按流排序的分配器释放捕获预热时的临时张量的方式，曾使重放因非法内存访问而出错。"],[1295,"`compute.cuda_graphs`"],[2346,"`compute.cuda_graphs`"],[9819,"`compute.cuda_graphs`"],[10870,"`compute.cuda_graphs`"],[11238,"`compute.cuda_graphs` (on)"],[2714,"`compute.cuda_graphs`（开）"],[1219,"`compute.default_device`"],[2294,"`compute.default_device`"],[9743,"`compute.default_device`"],[10818,"`compute.default_device`"],[1222,"`compute.devices`"],[2290,"`compute.devices`"],[9746,"`compute.devices`"],[10814,"`compute.devices`"],[2386,"`compute.fast`"],[2703,"`compute.fast`"],[2767,"`compute.fast`"],[10910,"`compute.fast`"],[11227,"`compute.fast`"],[11291,"`compute.fast`"],[9883,"`compute.fast` (**Settings** › **Compute** › **Acceleration**) turns on GPU speed switches for the whole process, after ComfyUI's `--fast`: `tf32`, `fp16_accumulation`, `cudnn_benchmark` 