uoto/core/compute/torch_index.py`), each engine available or missing (and what is missing), optional extras that do not import (`Engine.EXTRAS`) and a trainer's missing requirements. The same is `GET /api/v1/runtime/doctor` and `GET /api/v1/engines/{id}/doctor`."],[5798,"`mizuoto doctor [ENGINE]` 就是 `RuntimeService.doctor`：已安装的 torch 构建与本机硬件（CUDA、ROCm、XPU、MPS、CPU）是否匹配，并给出安装正确构建的命令（`mizuoto/core/compute/torch_index.py`）；每个引擎可用还是缺失（以及缺什么）；导入不了的可选附加依赖（`Engine.EXTRAS`）；以及训练器缺的依赖。对应 `GET /api/v1/runtime/doctor` 和 `GET /api/v1/engines/{id}/doctor`。"],[3744,"`mizuoto doctor [引擎]` 一处检查 torch 构建与硬件、各引擎缺什么、附加依赖、0.1 的旧环境"],[12633,"`mizuoto doctor` has a `memory` finding with the policy in effect (mode, reserve, limit, RAM reserve, host copies, pinned budget, streams, retry and fallbacks), and per engine with installed models a `fits` finding: on each GPU, which of them load whole and which only partly (the rest streaming from RAM), from each model's catalogue `vram_mb` against the GPU's memory less `compute.vram_reserve_mb`, within `vram_limit_mb`, half under `low` (`gpu_budget_mb`; fields in `data`). The catalogue's `vram_mb` is measured: the GPU memory a process takes for the model's short and long parity cases with the defaults on an RTX 3060 (G13, performance), the most of the two, rounded up."],[16961,"`mizuoto doctor` lists the GPUs it finds (with `nvidia-smi`, `rocm-smi` or `amd-smi`, or by asking torch; see Performance), reports the torch build against them (with the exact install command when they do not match), whether each engine is available or what it still needs (torch, or a licence-gated engine's distribution), and the optional extras that are missing. In the web UI, **Settings › Compute** shows the torch check, and **Check this machine** on each engine card under **Models › Engines** shows that engine's."],[9837,"`mizuoto doctor` prints the memory settings in effect."],[14112,"`mizuoto doctor` reports an installed gated engine that does not go with this Mizuoto (its range excludes it, or its `OPTION_SCHEMA` and the manifest disagree) as an error with `pip install --upgrade mizuoto mizuoto-<id>`, and `mizuoto version` lists each distribution's version."],[8438,"`mizuoto doctor` 会列出找到的 GPU（通过 `nvidia-smi`、`rocm-smi` 或 `amd-smi`，或询问 torch；见 性能），对照它们检查 torch 的构建（不匹配时给出准确的安装命令），报告每个引擎是否可用、还缺什么（torch，或需要接受许可的引擎的发行包），以及缺少的可选扩展。在网页界面中，**设置 › 计算** 显示 torch 的检查结果，**模型 › 引擎** 中每个引擎卡片的 **检查本机** 显示该引擎的检查结果。"],[1313,"`mizuoto doctor` 打印当前生效的内存设置。"],[4109,"`mizuoto doctor` 有一项 `memory` 检查结果，列出当前生效的策略（模式、保留量、上限、内存保留量、主机副本、锁页预算、复制流、重试与回退）；每个装有模型的引擎还有一项 `fits`：在每块 GPU 上，哪些模型能整个加载，哪些只能部分加载（其余从内存流式读取），依据是模型目录中的 `vram_mb` 与 GPU 显存减去 `compute.vram_reserve_mb`、不超过 `vram_limit_mb`、`low` 下取一半（`gpu_budget_mb`；字段在 `data` 中）。目录中的 `vram_mb` 是实测值：在 RTX 3060 上使用默认设置，进程为该模型的短、长一致性用例所占的显存，取两者较大值并向上取整（G13，见性能）。"],[10719,"`mizuoto env vars` lists the environment variables Mizuoto reads, and the `MIZUOTO_*` variables set now:"],[2195,"`mizuoto env vars` 列出 Mizuoto 读取的环境变量，以及当前已设置的 `MIZUOTO_*` 变量："],[9671,"`mizuoto job cancel` reaches only its own process's jobs; for a job the server runs it answers \"is not running\". Cancel the server's jobs in the web UI or with `POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/cancel`."],[1147,"`mizuoto job cancel` 只能取消本进程的任务，对服务器正在运行的任务会报 \"is not running\"。取消服务器的任务请用 Web UI，或 `POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/cancel`。"],[11207,"`mizuoto job retry` runs a failed, cancelled or interrupted job again in the foreground (its stored request is planned again)."],[2683,"`mizuoto job retry` 在前台重新运行一个失败、已取消或已中断的任务（它保存的请求会重新规划）。"],[12440,"`mizuoto model download <id>/<name>`, then the contract suite on the real models; record the port and its parity on the engine's page (`engines-<id>`, both languages), add it to the sidebars (`meta.json`, `meta.en.json`) and to the engine reference table, and add rules to `AGENTS.md` if there are any."],[3916,"`mizuoto model download <id>/<名字>`，然后在真实模型上跑契约套件；把移植情况和对照结果记进该引擎的页面（`engines-<id>`，中英文都要），把它加进侧边栏（`meta.json`、`meta.en.json`）和引擎参考的表格；如有新的规则，再记进 `AGENTS.md`。"],[12348,"`mizuoto model import` identifies the engine and variant from file contents alone: `mizuoto/core/models/detect.py` reads configuration files (OmniVoice: `model_type == \"omnivoice\"` in `config.json`), and the engine's `detect_variant` must agree."],[3824,"`mizuoto model import` 只凭文件内容判断引擎和变体：`mizuoto/core/models/detect.py` 读取配置文件（OmniVoice：`config.json` 里 `model_type == \"omnivoice\"`），引擎的 `detect_variant` 必须与它一致。"],[16247,"`mizuoto project cast <project> <speaker-id> [--name] [-m] [-v] [--preset] [-l] [--instruct] [-p name=value] [-O name=value] [--remove]`"],[7723,"`mizuoto project cast <项目> <角色id> [--name] [-m] [-v] [--preset] [-l] [--instruct] [-p 参数=值] [-O 选项=值] [--remove]`"],[16261,"`mizuoto project delete <project>`"],[7737,"`mizuoto project delete <项目>`"],[16253,"`mizuoto project export <project> [-o file] [-c chapter-id] [-f format] [--srt file] [--allow-missing]`"],[7729,"`mizuoto project export <项目> [-o 文件] [-c 章节id] [-f 格式] [--srt 字幕文件] [--allow-missing]`"],[16245,"`mizuoto project import <project> <script> [--split …] [--replace] [--chapter chapter-id]`"],[7721,"`mizuoto project import <项目> <脚本> [--split …] [--replace] [--chapter 章节id]`"],[7735,"`mizuoto project list`"],[16259,"`mizuoto project list`"],[16243,"`mizuoto project new <name> [-m model] [--voice voice \\| --preset speaker] [-l lang] [--script file] [--split line\\|sentence]`"],[7719,"`mizuoto project new <名称> [-m 模型] [--voice 音色 \\| --preset 说话人] [-l 语言] [--script 文件] [--split line\\|sentence]`"],[16251,"`mizuoto project render <project> [-c chapter-id] [--line line-id] [--force]`"],[7727,"`mizuoto project render <项目> [-c 章节id] [--line 句子id] [--force]`"],[16257,"`mizuoto project script <project>`"],[7733,"`mizuoto project script <项目>`"],[16249,"`mizuoto project set <project> [--name] [-m] [-l] [--line-pause] [--paragraph-pause] [--chapter-pause] [-f] [--sample-rate] [--normalize]`"],[7725,"`mizuoto project set <项目> [--name] [-m] [-l] [--line-pause] [--paragraph-pause] [--chapter-pause] [-f] [--sample-rate] [--normalize]`"],[16255,"`mizuoto project show <project>`"],[7731,"`mizuoto project show <项目>`"],[12270,"`mizuoto runtime` asks the running server (`server.json`) first, and reports its own process only when there is none"],[14321,"`mizuoto runtime` asks the running server (found through `server.json` in the data folder), since its process holds the models; without a server it reports the command's own process. The same is `GET /api/v1/runtime` and `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`, and the web UI's **Models in memory** sheet (`LoadedModelsSheet`)."],[9780,"`mizuoto runtime` lists the loaded models of the running server (device, memory, how much of it is on the device, last use, busy or idle); `mizuoto runtime --unload [MODEL]` unloads one, or every model not in use. In the web UI the **Models in memory** panel does the same, with a bar for how much of each model is on its GPU, and **Free GPU memory** releases the memory idle models hold. The API is `GET /api/v1/runtime` and `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`."],[3746,"`mizuoto runtime` 先问正在运行的服务器（`server.json`），没有才报告本进程"],[1256,"`mizuoto runtime` 列出正在运行的服务器已加载的模型（设备、内存、有多少在设备上、上次使用、忙碌或空闲）；`mizuoto runtime --unload [MODEL]` 卸载一个模型，或所有未在使用的模型。网页界面的 **内存中的模型** 面板做同样的事，并用进度条显示每个模型有多少在 GPU 上，其中的 **释放显存** 释放空闲模型占用的显存。对应接口为 `GET /api/v1/runtime` 和 `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`。"],[5797,"`mizuoto runtime` 询问正在运行的服务器（通过数据目录里的 `server.json` 找到它），因为模型在服务器进程里；没有服务器时报告命令自身进程的情况。对应 `GET /api/v1/runtime` 和 `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`，以及 Web UI 的**内存中的模型**面板（`LoadedModelsSheet`）。"],[16491,"`mizuoto speak --help` lists every option (`--describe`, `--attr`, `--emotion-audio`, `--batch`, `--use-preset` and more); see the command reference."],[7967,"`mizuoto speak --help` 列出所有选项（`--describe`、`--attr`、`--emotion-audio`、`--batch`、`--use-preset` 等），完整参考见命令参考。"],[14119,"`mizuoto version`, `mizuoto env vars` and `mizuoto doctor`: every engine must be available;"],[5595,"`mizuoto version`、`mizuoto env vars` 和 `mizuoto doctor`：每个引擎都必须可用；"],[2231,"`mizuoto webui` 启动后打开浏览器"],[7758,"`mizuoto webui` 启动后是否自动打开浏览器"],[20,"`mizuoto webui` 启动的服务器同时提供网页界面和 HTTP 接口。网页界面能做的事都通过这套接口完成，所以脚本和其他程序也能做同样的事。"],[2204,"`MIZUOTO_<GROUP>__<FIELD>`"],[10728,"`MIZUOTO_<GROUP>__<FIELD>`"],[2200,"`MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR`"],[10724,"`MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR`"],[9121,"`MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR`, or the data folder"],[597,"`MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR`，或数据文件夹"],[369,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`"],[2198,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`"],[8893,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`"],[10722,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`"],[10711,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR` or `mizuoto webui --data-dir <path>` puts it elsewhere. `settings.toml` sits in the data folder unless `MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR` or `webui --config-dir` names another folder for it (the data stays in the data folder). **Settings** › **About** in the web UI shows the **Data folder** and the **Settings file**."],[10664,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR` or the platform's default"],[2140,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR` 或系统默认位置"],[9118,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`, or the platform's default"],[9189,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`, or the platform's default"],[594,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`，或系统默认位置"],[665,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`，或系统默认位置"],[2202,"`MIZUOTO_LOG_LEVEL`"],[10726,"`MIZUOTO_LOG_LEVEL`"],[9718,"`MIZUOTO_LOG_LEVEL` sets the level (`DEBUG`, `INFO`, `WARNING`, `ERROR`; default `INFO`), and every command takes `--debug`."],[11200,"`MIZUOTO_LOG_LEVEL` sets the log level as well (`DEBUG`, `INFO`, `WARNING`, `ERROR`; default `INFO`). Each job's full log is `jobs/<job id>.log` in the data folder (`mizuoto job log <job id>`); a training stage's output goes into its job's log too."],[372,"`MIZUOTO_SERVER__OPEN_BROWSER`"],[8896,"`MIZUOTO_SERVER__OPEN_BROWSER`"],[8707,"`mizuoto_token=<token>`"],[183,"`mizuoto_token=<令牌>`"],[14104,"`mizuoto-fishspeech-v<version>`"],[5580,"`mizuoto-fishspeech-v<版本>`"],[5579,"`mizuoto-fishspeech`"],[6501,"`mizuoto-fishspeech`"],[14103,"`mizuoto-fishspeech`"],[15025,"`mizuoto-fishspeech`"],[9680,"`mizuoto-fishspeech` or `mizuoto-indextts`: install it into Mizuoto's Python, such as `pip install mizuoto-indextts`."],[1156,"`mizuoto-fishspeech` 或 `mizuoto-indextts`：把它装到 Mizuoto 所用的 Python 中，例如 `pip install mizuoto-indextts`。"],[14107,"`mizuoto-indextts-v<version>`"],[5583,"`mizuoto-indextts-v<版本>`"],[5523,"`mizuoto-indextts[ja]`"],[5827,"`mizuoto-indextts[ja]`"],[14047,"`mizuoto-indextts[ja]`"],[14351,"`mizuoto-indextts[ja]`"],[9355,"`mizuoto-indextts[ja]` (IndexTTS-2.5's Japanese: fugashi, unidic-lite)"],[831,"`mizuoto-indextts[ja]`（IndexTTS-2.5 的日语：fugashi、unidic-lite）"],[5582,"`mizuoto-indextts`"],[6504,"`mizuoto-indextts`"],[14106,"`mizuoto-indextts`"],[15028,"`mizuoto-indextts`"],[477,"`mizuoto-model`"],[2412,"`mizuoto-model`"],[9001,"`mizuoto-model`"],[10936,"`mizuoto-model`"],[10937,"`mizuoto-model`: Mizuoto's mirror first, and what it lacks from the official repositories; `official`: each model's own repositories"],[9002,"`mizuoto-model`: the mirror first; `official`: each model's own repositories"],[2413,"`mizuoto-model`：优先使用 Mizuoto 的镜像仓库，镜像中没有的文件从官方仓库下载；`official`：各模型自己的仓库"],[478,"`mizuoto-model`：先试镜像；`official`：各模型自己的仓库"],[11689,"`mizuoto.api`, `mizuoto.core`, `mizuoto.version`, `mizuoto.logger`, `mizuoto.webui`"],[3165,"`mizuoto.api`、`mizuoto.core`、`mizuoto.version`、`mizuoto.logger`、`mizuoto.webui`"],[11692,"`mizuoto.cli`, `mizuoto.core`, `mizuoto.api`, `mizuoto.version`, `mizuoto.logger`"],[3168,"`mizuoto.cli`、`mizuoto.core`、`mizuoto.api`、`mizuoto.version`、`mizuoto.logger`"],[11686,"`mizuoto.core`, `mizuoto.version`, `mizuoto.logger`; `mizuoto.runtime`, `mizuoto.nn`, `mizuoto.engines`, `mizuoto.training` **inside functions only**"],[3162,"`mizuoto.core`、`mizuoto.version`、`mizuoto.logger`；`mizuoto.runtime`、`mizuoto.nn`、`mizuoto.engines`、`mizuoto.training` **只能在函数内**"],[8471,"`mizuoto.db`"],[16994,"`mizuoto.db`"],[11738,"`mizuoto.db` (SQLite, numbered migrations)"],[3214,"`mizuoto.db`（SQLite，带编号的迁移）"],[14063,"`mizuoto.nn.dsp`, bit-exact with those libraries; soxr"],[5539,"`mizuoto.nn.dsp`，与这些库逐比特一致；soxr"],[11698,"`mizuoto.nn`, `mizuoto.runtime`"],[3174,"`mizuoto.nn`、`mizuoto.runtime`"],[11426,"`mizuoto.runtime.compile.Compiled` wraps one hot module in `torch.compile(dynamic=True)`: no shape buckets, so a new length does not recompile. Engines call `compiled or module`, so with the setting off the code path is the eager one. The setting is read at each load (`RuntimeOptions.compile`) and reaches models loaded after a change."],[2902,"`mizuoto.runtime.compile.Compiled` 把一个热点模块包进 `torch.compile(dynamic=True)`：不按形状分桶，新的长度不会触发重新编译。引擎调用 `compiled or module`，所以设置关闭时走的就是即时执行路径。该设置在每次加载时读取（`RuntimeOptions.compile`），对修改之后加载的模型生效。"],[11695,"`mizuoto.runtime`, `mizuoto.core.codes`, `mizuoto.core.inference.tasks`"],[11704,"`mizuoto.runtime`, `mizuoto.nn`, `mizuoto.text`, `mizuoto.engines`, `mizuoto.training`, `mizuoto.core.codes`, `mizuoto.core.inference.tasks`"],[3171,"`mizuoto.runtime`、`mizuoto.core.codes`、`mizuoto.core.inference.tasks`"],[3180,"`mizuoto.runtime`、`mizuoto.nn`、`mizuoto.text`、`mizuoto.engines`、`mizuoto.training`、`mizuoto.core.codes`、`mizuoto.core.inference.tasks`"],[3177,"`mizuoto.text`"],[11701,"`mizuoto.text`"],[14497,"`mizuoto.text`'s BPE against transformers' tokenizer on the corpus (run in an environment that has transformers)"],[5517,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`"],[5821,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`"],[14041,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`"],[14345,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`"],[9347,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]` (Japanese: pyopenjtalk 0.4.1, built from source with CMake and a C++ compiler), `mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]` (Korean: python-mecab-ko, jamo; on Python 3.13 and 3.14 python-mecab-ko is built from source against mecab-ko)"],[823,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`（日语：pyopenjtalk 0.4.1，需用 CMake 和 C++ 编译器从源码构建）、`mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`（韩语：python-mecab-ko、jamo；在 Python 3.13 和 3.14 上 python-mecab-ko 要基于 mecab-ko 从源码构建）"],[5520,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`"],[5824,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`"],[14044,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`"],[14348,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`"],[6499,"`mizuoto/`"],[15023,"`mizuoto/`"],[6209,"`mizuoto/`、`tests/`、`scripts/` 下的其他内容、`pyproject.toml`，或新路径"],[3009,"`mizuoto/api/app.py` 的 `create_app(services, bound_host, bound_port, extra_hosts, serve_ui, api_prefix)` 构建整个应用。服务由调用者拥有（`mizuoto webui` 用 `build_services(start_background=True)` 构建、`mizuoto.embed.MizuotoServer` 在宿主应用里构建），应用只把它挂在 `app.state.services` 上。"],[3164,"`mizuoto/api`"],[11688,"`mizuoto/api`"],[11641,"`mizuoto/cli/` uses Typer:"],[3117,"`mizuoto/cli/` 用 Typer。结构："],[3604,"`mizuoto/cli/app.py` 的 `get_app()` 在一个函数里注册所有命令和命令组，名字和帮助文字写在注册处；这个文件就是整个命令行的目录。命令函数（`cli/commands/*.py`）是不带装饰器的普通函数。"],[3167,"`mizuoto/cli`"],[11691,"`mizuoto/cli`"],[11503,"`mizuoto/core/compute/cpu.py` (standard library only) is applied by the host before torch is imported (`cpu.apply`, when the runtime is built) and handed to the processes it starts (`child_env`: training stages, job workers). Neither changes a result. Variables the environment sets itself win; off glibc and off Linux nothing changes."],[2979,"`mizuoto/core/compute/cpu.py`（只用标准库）由主机在导入 torch 之前应用（建立运行时时调用 `cpu.apply`），并传给它启动的进程（`child_env`：训练阶段、任务进程）。两者都不改变结果。环境中已设置的变量优先；非 glibc 或非 Linux 系统上不起作用。"],[3202,"`mizuoto/core/context.py` 的 `build_services()` 按依赖顺序构建全部服务，返回 `Services` 数据类："],[12314,"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/*.toml` ships in the `mizuoto` package; `EngineRegistry` loads every file in the folder and validates it as `EngineManifest` (`mizuoto/core/engines/models.py`). The manifest of a licence-gated engine ships in `mizuoto` too, so the catalogue and the licence text are there before its distribution is installed. The top level:"],[3790,"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/*.toml` 随 `mizuoto` 包发布；`EngineRegistry` 读取目录下的每个文件，按 `EngineManifest`（`mizuoto/core/engines/models.py`）校验。需要接受许可的引擎，其清单也在 `mizuoto` 里，所以在它的发行包装上之前，模型目录和许可全文就已经在了。顶层字段："],[12305,"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/<id>.toml`, files manifests in `manifests/files/`"],[3781,"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/<id>.toml`，模型文件清单在 `manifests/files/`"],[12436,"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/<id>.toml`; run `dev.py model-manifests <id>`; the licence text in `manifests/licences/` when gated."],[3912,"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/<id>.toml`；运行 `dev.py model-manifests <id>`；需要接受许可时，把许可全文放进 `manifests/licences/`。"],[11889,"`mizuoto/core/errors.py` holds every error type. Each class carries `code`, `http_status` and `exit_code`, and both front ends translate mechanically: the API turns any `MizuotoError` into `{\"code\", \"message\", \"detail\"}` (`mizuoto/api/errors.py`); the CLI turns it into its exit code and logs `detail[\"hint\"]` as a second line (`cli/factory.report_error`). The code strings are in `mizuoto/core/codes.py` (standard library only), so engines and training stages raise `EngineError(message, detail, code=codes.…)` without pydantic, and the core rebuilds the class with `error_from_code()`."],[3365,"`mizuoto/core/errors.py` 包含全部错误类型。每个类都带 `code`、`http_status` 和 `exit_code`，两个前端机械地转换：API 把任何 `MizuotoError` 变成 `{\"code\", \"message\", \"detail\"}`（`mizuoto/api/errors.py`）；CLI 把它变成退出码，并把 `detail[\"hint\"]` 作为第二行打出（`cli/factory.report_error`）。错误码字符串在 `mizuoto/core/codes.py`（只用标准库），所以引擎和训练阶段不需要 pydantic，抛出 `EngineError(message, detail, code=codes.…)` 即可，核心再用 `error_from_code()` 还原成对应的类。"],[3337,"`mizuoto/core/events/models.py` 里的每个事件都是带 `__event_name__` 的 `Record`：`job_updated`、`job_log`、`jobs_cleared`、`outputs_added` / `outputs_removed`、`voices_changed`、`models_changed`、`presets_changed`、`engines_changed`、`runtime_changed`（已加载的模型和各引擎的状态，即 `RuntimeStatus`）、`compute_changed`、`settings_changed`、`datasets_changed`、`projects_changed`、`experiments_changed`、`train_metrics`。`EventBase.get_events()` 收集所有子类；`mizuoto/api/openapi.py` 把它们写进 OpenAPI 模式，界面据此为 socket 生成类型。"],[5677,"`mizuoto/core/inference/engine.py`"],[14201,"`mizuoto/core/inference/engine.py`"],[5671,"`mizuoto/core/inference/local.py`"],[14195,"`mizuoto/core/inference/local.py`"],[5668,"`mizuoto/core/inference/runtime.py`"],[14192,"`mizuoto/core/inference/runtime.py`"],[5665