st[\"trainer\"])` 加载训练器并调用 `run_stage(stage, ctx)`；结果必须能序列化为 JSON，以 `ResultEvent` 送回。"],[6262,"`stages`"],[14786,"`stages`"],[2530,"`standard`"],[4797,"`standard`"],[5175,"`standard`"],[11054,"`standard`"],[13321,"`standard`"],[13699,"`standard`"],[12644,"`standard` (default)"],[4120,"`standard`（默认）"],[604,"`start_background`"],[649,"`start_background`"],[9128,"`start_background`"],[9173,"`start_background`"],[10220,"`START:END[:SECONDS]` of a part to replace, in seconds (repeatable, required); `SECONDS` is the new part's length"],[14287,"`start()` finds the implementation with `get_engine(id)` (imports its module, not torch)."],[5763,"`start()` 用 `get_engine(id)` 找到实现（导入它的模块，不导入 torch）。"],[702,"`start(timeout=30)`"],[9226,"`start(timeout=30)`"],[8731,"`state` goes through `queued`, `waiting` (for a GPU, the engine or another resource; `waiting_for` says which) and `running`, and ends `completed`, `failed`, `cancelled` or `interrupted` (the server stopped while it ran). A finished job has its `result`; a failed one has an `error` with `code`, `message` and `detail`."],[207,"`state` 依次经过 `queued`、`waiting`（等待 GPU、引擎或其他资源，`waiting_for` 说明在等什么）、`running`，最后是 `completed`、`failed`、`cancelled` 或 `interrupted`（服务器在任务运行中退出）。完成后 `result` 中有结果，失败时 `error` 有 `code`、`message`、`detail`。"],[3021,"`static.py` 的 `SPAStaticFiles`，最后注册，只接收前面都没匹配的路径"],[10868,"`static`: preallocated key/value caches for Qwen3-TTS and CosyVoice 2/3"],[9818,"`static`: Qwen3-TTS's and CosyVoice's language models write their caches into preallocated buffers (less copying and fragmentation). Identical on a CPU; opt-in because on a GPU it may change results in the last bits"],[2344,"`static`：Qwen3-TTS 与 CosyVoice 2/3 使用预先分配的键值缓存"],[1294,"`static`：Qwen3-TTS 与 CosyVoice 的语言模型把缓存写入预先分配的缓冲区（复制和碎片更少）。在 CPU 上结果相同；在 GPU 上结果的最后几位可能不同，因此需主动开启"],[706,"`stop(timeout=10)`"],[9230,"`stop(timeout=10)`"],[313,"`stream_format`"],[8837,"`stream_format`"],[290,"`stream_format=pcm`"],[8814,"`stream_format=pcm`"],[8812,"`stream_format=wav` (default)"],[288,"`stream_format=wav`（默认）"],[3948,"`Streamer`"],[12472,"`Streamer`"],[678,"`strict_port`"],[9202,"`strict_port`"],[246,"`strict`"],[8770,"`strict`"],[236,"`style`"],[8760,"`style`"],[14220,"`supports(device, dtype)` and `pick_dtype(device, requested, supported, cpu)`: the dtype a component runs in, from the user's `engines.<id>.dtype` and the engine's preference order (fp32 on the CPU unless asked; GTX 16xx cards are kept off fp16)."],[5696,"`supports(device, dtype)` 和 `pick_dtype(device, requested, supported, cpu)`：组件用哪种精度运行，依据用户的 `engines.<id>.dtype` 和引擎给出的偏好顺序（CPU 上除非指定都用 fp32；GTX 16xx 显卡不用 fp16）。"],[3868,"`SynthesisTask`"],[12392,"`SynthesisTask`"],[14205,"`SynthesisTask`, `VoiceSpec`, `Reference`, `LoadSpec`, `AudioChunk`, `Description`… (standard library dataclasses)"],[5681,"`SynthesisTask`、`VoiceSpec`、`Reference`、`LoadSpec`、`AudioChunk`、`Description` 等（标准库数据类）"],[3851,"`synthesize(task, ctx)`"],[12375,"`synthesize(task, ctx)`"],[14293,"`synthesize`, `convert` and `edit` return generators of `AudioChunk`. `LocalEngine.stream` drives the engine's own generator lazily: the engine runs only while the caller asks for the next chunk, and only then is it bound to the thread and in inference mode. Each chunk is checked (it must be an `AudioChunk`), turned into float32 mono numpy samples and handed on; the first one sets `timings[\"first_chunk\"]`. The caller closes the stream (`contextlib.closing`) to stop early, which closes the engine's generator too. `TtsService` drains it chunk by chunk and forwards chunks to a `StreamSink` when the client streams."],[5769,"`synthesize`、`convert` 和 `edit` 返回产出 `AudioChunk` 的生成器。`LocalEngine.stream` 惰性地驱动引擎自己的生成器：只有调用方索取下一块时引擎才运行，也只有这时它才绑定到线程、处在推理模式里。每一块都会被检查（必须是 `AudioChunk`），转成 float32 单声道 numpy 采样再交出去；第一块设定 `timings[\"first_chunk\"]`。调用方关闭流（`contextlib.closing`）就能提前停止，引擎的生成器也随之关闭。`TtsService` 逐块取出，客户端流式接收时再把每块转给 `StreamSink`。"],[15452,"`SynthesizerTrn` decoding for v2/v2Pro/v2ProPlus (the posterior encoder `enc_q` is not built)"],[15454,"`SynthesizerTrnV3`, `CFM`/`CFMV5`, GPT-SoVITS's DiT variant, the vocoder paths, LoRA merging"],[15428,"`SynthesizerTrnV3`, a CFM with a DiT, a 48 kHz HiFi-GAN vocoder"],[6930,"`SynthesizerTrnV3`、`CFM`/`CFMV5`、GPT-SoVITS 的 DiT 变体、声码器路径、LoRA 合并"],[6904,"`SynthesizerTrnV3`、带 DiT 的 CFM、48 kHz HiFi-GAN 声码器"],[6925,"`t2s.py`"],[15449,"`t2s.py`"],[7163,"`talker.py`"],[15687,"`talker.py`"],[3286,"`tasks.py`"],[11810,"`tasks.py`"],[5942,"`test_another_engine_in_between_changes_nothing`"],[14466,"`test_another_engine_in_between_changes_nothing`"],[11715,"`test_attention_goes_through_the_accel_entry_point`: outside `runtime/accel`, the runtime, `nn`, the engines, the trainers and the gated packages never call SDPA or its aten kernels directly; every attention computation goes through `accel.attention`, so `compute.attention` can switch it (see Attention acceleration)."],[3191,"`test_attention_goes_through_the_accel_entry_point`：`runtime/accel` 之外，运行时、`nn`、引擎、训练器和需要接受许可的包都不直接调用 SDPA 或它的 aten 内核；每次注意力计算都经过 `accel.attention`，`compute.attention` 才能切换它（见注意力加速）。"],[5944,"`test_cancel_stops_the_engine`"],[14468,"`test_cancel_stops_the_engine`"],[11713,"`test_engines_import_no_other_engine`: `mizuoto/engines/<a>` never imports `mizuoto/engines/<b>`; what two engines share belongs in `nn` or `runtime`."],[3189,"`test_engines_import_no_other_engine`：`mizuoto/engines/<a>` 永远不导入 `mizuoto/engines/<b>`；两个引擎共用的东西应放进 `nn` 或 `runtime`。"],[5932,"`test_every_voice_mode_speaks_the_text`"],[14456,"`test_every_voice_mode_speaks_the_text`"],[11716,"`test_host_never_imports_model_code`: nothing in `core`, `api` or `cli` imports torch, torchaudio, transformers, onnxruntime, `mizuoto_fishspeech` or `mizuoto_indextts`, even inside a function."],[3192,"`test_host_never_imports_model_code`：`core`、`api`、`cli` 里没有任何地方导入 torch、torchaudio、transformers、onnxruntime、`mizuoto_fishspeech` 或 `mizuoto_indextts`，函数内也不行。"],[5930,"`test_load_and_describe`"],[14454,"`test_load_and_describe`"],[11714,"`test_native_code_leaves_global_state_alone`: no call that changes process-wide state in `runtime`, `nn`, `text`, the engines and the gated packages (see Runtime)."],[3190,"`test_native_code_leaves_global_state_alone`：`runtime`、`nn`、`text`、各引擎和需要接受许可的包里，不允许出现改动进程级状态的调用（见运行时）。"],[5946,"`test_no_residue`"],[14470,"`test_no_residue`"],[11718,"`test_one_distribution`: `pyproject.toml` depends on torch and on no other `mizuoto-*` distribution, and `packages/` holds no worker package and no engine packages besides `packages/native`."],[3194,"`test_one_distribution`：`pyproject.toml` 依赖 torch，不依赖任何其他 `mizuoto-*` 发行包，且 `packages/` 下除 `packages/native` 外没有 worker 包和引擎包。"],[11710,"`test_only_core_inference_reaches_model_code`: no module of `mizuoto/core` outside `core/inference` imports the runtime, `nn`, the engines or the trainers."],[3186,"`test_only_core_inference_reaches_model_code`：`mizuoto/core` 里除 `core/inference` 之外，没有模块导入运行时、`nn`、引擎或训练器。"],[5934,"`test_seed_repeats_and_segments`"],[14458,"`test_seed_repeats_and_segments`"],[11711,"`test_shared_modules_are_standard_library_only`: `core/codes.py`, `core/jobs/events.py`, `core/jobs/jsonl.py`, `core/remote/frames.py` and `core/inference/tasks.py` import only the standard library (and each other). The runtime, the engines and the training stages share them."],[3187,"`test_shared_modules_are_standard_library_only`：`core/codes.py`、`core/jobs/events.py`、`core/jobs/jsonl.py`、`core/remote/frames.py` 和 `core/inference/tasks.py` 只导入标准库（以及彼此）。运行时、引擎和训练阶段都要用它们。"],[5938,"`test_streamed_audio_starts_early`"],[14462,"`test_streamed_audio_starts_early`"],[5936,"`test_streaming_sends_the_audio_as_it_is_made`"],[14460,"`test_streaming_sends_the_audio_as_it_is_made`"],[5940,"`test_unloading_frees_the_device`"],[14464,"`test_unloading_frees_the_device`"],[14371,"`test-engines [engine…] [-- pytest options]`"],[5847,"`test-engines [引擎…] [-- pytest 选项]`"],[14451,"`test-engines` sets `MIZUOTO_CONTRACT=1` and `MIZUOTO_TEST_ENGINES` (the engines named) and runs `tests/engines` with `-m engine -v`. The suite uses the models of `MIZUOTO_TEST_DATA_DIR` (default: the normal data folder), but runs in a temporary data folder and writes nothing to the real one, on `MIZUOTO_TEST_DEVICE` (default `auto`). `MIZUOTO_TEST_SETTINGS` adds settings as JSON: `{\"compute\": {\"vram_limit_mb\": 4096}}` runs every model partly loaded on a 4 GB GPU played by a bigger one."],[5927,"`test-engines` 设置 `MIZUOTO_CONTRACT=1` 和 `MIZUOTO_TEST_ENGINES`（指定的引擎），以 `-m engine -v` 运行 `tests/engines`。套件使用 `MIZUOTO_TEST_DATA_DIR`（默认是平常的数据目录）里的模型，但在临时数据目录里运行，不往真实目录写任何东西，设备是 `MIZUOTO_TEST_DEVICE`（默认 `auto`）。`MIZUOTO_TEST_SETTINGS` 以 JSON 追加设置：`{\"compute\": {\"vram_limit_mb\": 4096}}` 让每个模型部分加载，在大卡上模拟一块 4 GB 的 GPU。"],[14369,"`test-py [pytest options…]`"],[5845,"`test-py [pytest 选项…]`"],[5859,"`test-web`"],[14383,"`test-web`"],[14435,"`tests/conftest.py`:"],[5911,"`tests/conftest.py`："],[14441,"`tests/engines_native/` builds, for each engine, a model of the engine's own architecture with a few small layers and random weights, writes it to a temporary folder as the engine expects to find it (configs, a byte-level vocabulary, safetensors), and drives the real code: `Engine.load` with a `Runtime(DeviceService(), ModelManager(...))`, a `RequestContext`, voice prompts, decoding, batches, seeds that repeat, cancellation. `test_<id>_train_tiny.py` runs every stage of the engine's trainer on a few clips. They need no download, so CI runs them on every push with CPU torch. The gated engines' tests are in their packages, `packages/native/<pkg>/tests/`; `testpaths` in `pyproject.toml` lists those folders, so `python -m pytest` runs them with the rest, and they skip unless their packages are installed. They use `tests/engines_native`'s helpers (`streaming.py`, `accel_checks.py`), so run them from the repository root, or from the package folder with the root's `pyproject.toml` (its `pythonpath` puts the root on `sys.path`)."],[5917,"`tests/engines_native/` 为每个引擎搭一个与引擎结构相同、只有几个小层、权重随机的模型，按引擎期望的样子写进临时目录（配置、字节级词表、safetensors），然后驱动真实的代码：用 `Runtime(DeviceService(), ModelManager(...))` 调 `Engine.load`，配一个 `RequestContext`，测音色提示、解码、批处理、可重复的种子和取消。`test_<id>_train_tiny.py` 用几段音频跑完引擎训练器的每个阶段。它们不需要下载，所以 CI 每次推送都用 CPU 版 torch 运行。需要接受许可的引擎的测试放在各自的包里，即 `packages/native/<pkg>/tests/`；`pyproject.toml` 的 `testpaths` 列出了这些目录，所以 `python -m pytest` 会连同其余测试一起运行它们，没装对应的包时跳过。它们用到 `tests/engines_native` 的辅助模块（`streaming.py`、`accel_checks.py`），所以要在仓库根目录运行；在包目录里运行也可以，根目录 `pyproject.toml` 的 `pythonpath` 会把根目录加进 `sys.path`。"],[12639,"`tests/engines_native/streaming.py` runs each tiny engine so, with every unit streamed (mode `none`), with half the room between its minimum and its size, and whole, and compares each output with the plain CPU run: identical. The parity harness does the same on real models (`--setting compute.simulate_vram_mb=…`). See Testing."],[4115,"`tests/engines_native/streaming.py` 这样运行每个小型引擎：所有单元都流式加载（`none` 模式）、取最小工作集与整个大小之间一半的空间、整体加载，并把每次的输出与普通 CPU 运行比较：完全相同。一致性验证工具在真实模型上也这样做（`--setting compute.simulate_vram_mb=…`）。见测试。"],[12409,"`tests/engines_native/test_<id>_tiny.py` builds a tiny model of the engine's own architecture with random weights in a temporary folder (config files, a byte-level vocabulary, safetensors written by the test) and drives the real code path on the CPU: loading, voice prompts and their cache, decoding, batches, seeds that repeat, cancellation. No weights are downloaded, so CI runs it on every push (CPU torch). `test_omnivoice_tiny.py` is a complete example; trainers have `test_<id>_train_tiny.py`."],[3885,"`tests/engines_native/test_<id>_tiny.py` 在临时目录里搭一个与引擎结构相同、权重随机的小模型（配置文件、字节级词表、测试自己写出的 safetensors），在 CPU 上走真实的代码路径：加载、音色提示及其缓存、解码、批处理、可重复的种子、取消。不下载任何权重，所以 CI 每次推送都跑（CPU 版 torch）。`test_omnivoice_tiny.py` 是一个完整的例子；训练器有 `test_<id>_train_tiny.py`。"],[12311,"`tests/engines_native/test_<id>_tiny.py`, the contract suite, `scripts/parity/`"],[3787,"`tests/engines_native/test_<id>_tiny.py`、契约套件、`scripts/parity/`"],[12410,"`tests/engines/test_contract.py` (markers `engine` and `weights`, deselected by default) drives the whole stack (plan → job → runtime → engine) for every installed catalogue model of the available engines: `describe` agrees with the manifest; every declared voice mode is audible, at the right rate, about as long as the text needs, and says the text (word error rate below 0.35 when ASR is installed); a seed repeats; two segments split; cancelling mid-generation stops the engine; and no process-wide state is left behind. A new engine id goes into the suite's `engines` settings override. See Testing."],[14450,"`tests/engines/test_contract.py` goes through the whole stack (plan → job → runtime → engine) for every installed catalogue model of every available engine:"],[5926,"`tests/engines/test_contract.py` 对每个可用引擎的每个已安装目录模型，走完整的链路（规划 → 任务 → 运行时 → 引擎）："],[3886,"`tests/engines/test_contract.py`（标记 `engine` 和 `weights`，默认排除）对可用引擎的每个已安装目录模型，走完整的链路（规划 → 任务 → 运行时 → 引擎）：`describe` 与清单一致；声明的每种音色模式都能发声、采样率正确、时长与文本相称、说的是那段文本（装了 ASR 时，词错误率低于 0.35）；种子可复现；两段能正确切分；中途取消能让引擎停下；不留下任何进程级状态。新引擎的 id 要加进套件里 `engines` 设置覆盖的列表。见测试。"],[12008,"`tests/test_architecture.py` checks every module's imports with `ast`; the tables are in Architecture. In short:"],[11681,"`tests/test_architecture.py` walks every module's absolute imports with `ast` and checks them against these tables; the standard library is always allowed."],[3484,"`tests/test_architecture.py` 用 `ast` 检查每个模块的导入，规则表见整体架构。要点："],[3157,"`tests/test_architecture.py` 用 `ast` 遍历每个模块的绝对导入，对照下表检查；标准库总是允许的。"],[15182,"`text_normalize` with wetext, cleaning and splitting"],[5746,"`text_pieces()`"],[14270,"`text_pieces()`"],[6559,"`text.py`"],[6733,"`text.py`"],[7015,"`text.py`"],[7092,"`text.py`"],[7246,"`text.py`"],[15083,"`text.py`"],[15257,"`text.py`"],[15539,"`text.py`"],[15616,"`text.py`"],[15770,"`text.py`"],[6933,"`text/`"],[15457,"`text/`"],[15945,"`text/tokenize/`, `text/normalize/`"],[7421,"`text/t