s skipped with the reason."],[9044,"Files downloaded at once"],[10933,"Files downloaded at once (1–8)"],[8985,"Files several models of an engine share (GPT-SoVITS's encoders and text front-end data; IndexTTS-2/2.5's w2v-BERT, semantic codec, CAM++ and BigVGAN; CosyVoice's text normalisation grammars) are shared files, kept in `<models folder>/_assets/<engine>/<name>/` with an `asset.json`."],[15983,"Files several models of an engine share (GPT-SoVITS's encoders, for example) are downloaded with the first model that needs them; the **Shared files** tab lists them."],[9011,"Files the mirror lacks (models it does not hold; archive-type shared files in a mirror made with `build`) come from each model's official repositories, so a partial mirror works."],[16332,"Fill a missing transcript with speech recognition (when installed)"],[8805,"Finally `{\"type\": \"end\", \"job_id\": …, \"output_ids\": […], \"output_id\": …}` or `{\"type\": \"error\", \"code\", \"message\", \"detail\"}`."],[15999,"Finding results"],[13320,"Fine-tune"],[13698,"Fine-tune"],[16657,"Fine-tune"],[8019,"Fine-tune a voice"],[16543,"Fine-tune a voice"],[16563,"Fine-tune the language model, Fine-tune the LLM and the flow"],[8039,"Fine-tune the language model、Fine-tune the LLM and the flow"],[8023,"Fine-tune the model"],[16547,"Fine-tune the model"],[16555,"Fine-tune the model, Fine-tune with LoRA"],[16559,"Fine-tune the model, Fine-tune with LoRA"],[8031,"Fine-tune the model、Fine-tune with LoRA"],[8035,"Fine-tune the model、Fine-tune with LoRA"],[8043,"Fine-tune with LoRA"],[16567,"Fine-tune with LoRA"],[16707,"Fine-tuned weights"],[15562,"First audio"],[12681,"First audio and memory against 0.1 (G8)"],[13499,"First audio is never later than 0.1's; where 0.1 returned whole clips (Qwen3-TTS) it comes 12–18× sooner. Peak memory of one model per run (one case per stack), 0.1 → native → native with `compute.host_copies = off`:"],[13468,"First audio, 0.1 → native"],[10747,"First port to try (1–65535)"],[10654,"First port to try, `[0, 65535]`; `0` picks any"],[13059,"First request s (load)"],[13422,"First request, 0.1 → native"],[9647,"First run"],[15952,"First run"],[11683,"First-party modules it may import"],[9320,"Fish Audio Research License; Drama 3: Fish Audio Community License (gated)"],[16886,"Fish Audio Research License; Drama 3: Fish Audio Community License (licence-gated)"],[796,"Fish Audio Research License；Drama 3：Fish Audio Community License（需接受）"],[8363,"Fish Audio Research License；Drama 3：Fish Audio Community License（需接受许可）"],[15300,"Fish Audio S2 Pro and Drama 3 (fishaudio/fish-speech). S2 Pro and its port are under the Fish Audio Research License; Drama 3 and its port (`mizuoto_fishspeech/drama3`, ported from fish-speech 0f8a12e8) under the Fish Audio Community License 1.0 (see Drama 3). The ports are under these licences, so they ship as a distribution of its own, `mizuoto-fishspeech` (`packages/native/fishspeech`, package `mizuoto_fishspeech`, with `LICENSE.md` and `drama3/LICENSE.md`), registered under the entry-point group `mizuoto.engines` (`fishspeech = mizuoto_fishspeech:FishSpeechEngine`). Downloading the model and speaking need the licence accepted. On the CPU in fp32 with the same seed its codes and audio are identical to upstream's seeded `generate_long` as Mizuoto 0.1 ran it, and its trainer gives 0.1's exported model bit for bit. User-facing details: Engines in depth."],[6776,"Fish Audio S2 Pro 与 Drama 3（fishaudio/fish-speech）。S2 Pro 及其移植版采用 Fish Audio Research License；Drama 3 及其移植版（`mizuoto_fishspeech/drama3`，移植自 fish-speech 0f8a12e8）采用 Fish Audio Community License 1.0（见 Drama 3）。移植版受这些许可约束，所以作为单独的发行包发布：`mizuoto-fishspeech`（`packages/native/fishspeech`，包名 `mizuoto_fishspeech`，附 `LICENSE.md` 与 `drama3/LICENSE.md`），注册在入口点组 `mizuoto.engines` 下（`fishspeech = mizuoto_fishspeech:FishSpeechEngine`）。下载模型和合成都需要先接受许可。在 CPU 上以 fp32、相同种子运行时，它的编码和音频与 Mizuoto 0.1 所运行的上游带种子 `generate_long` 完全相同，训练器导出的模型与 0.1 逐位相同。面向用户的说明见 引擎详解。"],[9567,"Fish Audio S2 Pro, 