ge model 0.65, vae 0.02"],[4634,"language model 0.65、vae 0.02"],[4564,"language model 0.81"],[13088,"language model 0.81"],[13095,"language model 0.91, flow 0.47"],[4571,"language model 0.91、flow 0.47"],[13151,"language model 1.21, vae 0.02"],[4627,"language model 1.21、vae 0.02"],[12755,"language model 107.3, codec 3.3"],[4231,"language model 107.3，codec 3.3"],[12739,"language model 12.1, flow 6.5"],[4215,"language model 12.1，flow 6.5"],[12771,"language model 20.7, vae 1.1"],[4247,"language model 20.7，vae 1.1"],[13130,"language model 3.01, codec 0.04"],[4606,"language model 3.01、codec 0.04"],[4211,"language model 32.3"],[12735,"language model 32.3"],[12767,"language model 75.6, vae 1.3"],[4243,"language model 75.6，vae 1.3"],[12627,"Language models' caches are sized by the text: Qwen3-TTS 16 frames a text token, IndexTTS 24 codes, GPT-SoVITS 16 a phone, CosyVoice upstream's 20 a token, each within `max_new_tokens`; Fish Speech's batches by their true bound; in the dtype and KV width the model computes in."],[15621,"Language names to OmniVoice's ids"],[10284,"Language of the sample text"],[16788,"Language, server, compute devices, download sources, storage, appearance and more"],[9268,"Languages"],[11682,"Layer"],[14174,"Layers, attention, loading"],[10682,"Layout"],[11663,"Layout"],[14402,"Layout"],[10160,"Let Mizuoto split long text, not the engine"],[14300,"Level"],[10961,"Levelling: `none`, `peak` or `loudness`"],[16400,"Library voice"],[9271,"Licence"],[9360,"Licence"],[16040,"Licence"],[16851,"Licence"],[8853,"Licence-gated engines"],[15822,"Licence-gated engines"],[15958,"Licence-gated engines"],[16091,"Licence-gated engines (Fish Speech, IndexTTS) have an **Accept the licence** button that opens the full licence; once accepted the card shows **Licence accepted**. See First run."],[14397,"Licence-gated engines (Fish Speech, IndexTTS) need their package installed and `mizuoto engine accept-licence <id>` before their models download."],[9963,"Licence-gated engines (Fish Speech, IndexTTS): install their package (`mizuoto-fishspeech`, `mizuoto-indextts`) on the agent and accept the licence there before downloading models (`mizuoto engine accept-licence <id>`), and accept it on the host before synthesizing."],[9252,"Licences"],[9650,"Licences"],[14074,"Lightning, torchmetrics, datasets, webdataset, wandb, tensorboard, pyarrow, pyworld, deepspeed"],[5550,"Lightning、torchmetrics、datasets、webdataset、wandb、tensorboard、pyarrow、pyworld、deepspeed"],[15484,"Lightning's resumable checkpoint (930 MB) is not written. Compare runs with the same thread count: CPU kernels split their sums by it."],[15064,"Limitations"],[15134,"Limitations"],[15236,"Limitations"],[15292,"Limitations"],[15407,"Limitations"],[15499,"Limitations"],[15598,"Limitations"],[15659,"Limitations"],[15735,"Limitations"],[15823,"Limitations"],[16103,"Line states"],[12061,"Lineage"],[16102,"Lines"],[16139,"Lines before the first `#` go into one chapter: titled after the project when the project has no chapters yet, else untitled."],[1139,"Linux"],[2181,"Linux"],[5562,"Linux"],[8464,"Linux"],[9663,"Linux"],[10705,"Linux"],[14086,"Linux"],[16987,"Linux"],[2981,"Linux 上 `auto` 即"],[14084,"Linux, Windows"],[14088,"Linux, Windows"],[16912,"Linux, Windows, macOS"],[5560,"Linux、Windows"],[5564,"Linux、Windows"],[8389,"Linux、Windows、macOS"],[11148,"List and info commands print tables; with `--json` they print JSON in the shape of the matching API record, for scripts:"],[10503,"List datasets"],[10543,"List experiments"],[10586,"List jobs, newest first"],[10571,"List outputs, newest first"],[14995,"List pages get one instance per route; the detail pages of voices, datasets, experiments and projects one per path. The shell's scroller is shared, so each page's scroll offset is kept in `offsets` and put back inside the view transition's update. A kept-alive page is not unmounted: whatever must be saved on leaving hooks both `onDeactivated` and `onBeforeUnmount` (as `ProjectView.vue`'s