he GitHub release (its upload finds the files already on PyPI). Bumping several version files in one push releases them together, Mizuoto first."],[14903,"Socket events"],[11631,"Socket events are not HTTP routes, so FastAPI would leave them out of the schema. `MizuotoAPI` in `openapi.py` overrides `openapi()`: it walks `EventBase.get_events()` (every subclass in `mizuoto/core/events/models.py` with an `__event_name__`), adds each model to `components.schemas`, and adds a `ServerEvents` object mapping event names to models:"],[6379,"Socket 事件"],[3107,"socket 事件不是 HTTP 路由，FastAPI 本不会把它们写进模式。`openapi.py` 的 `MizuotoAPI` 覆盖 `openapi()`：遍历 `EventBase.get_events()`（`mizuoto/core/events/models.py` 中每个带 `__event_name__` 的子类），把各自的模型加入 `components.schemas`，再加一个 `ServerEvents` 对象，事件名 → 模型："],[3109,"socket 只推送变化。客户端收到事件后修补或作废对应的查询，重连后重新拉取屏幕上的内容；任何状态都必须能通过 REST 读到。"],[8710,"socket.io connection"],[186,"socket.io 连接"],[9877,"Some attention keeps its own computation whatever the setting, because no fused kernel computes it: relative positions inside the scores (wenet's, w2v-BERT's, GPT-SoVITS's VITS) and a few hand-written encoders."],[14341,"Some front ends need packages that are not in the default install. Without them those languages fail with `capability_not_supported` and the install command in the hint, and `mizuoto doctor` lists them as warnings:"],[15977,"Some languages need an optional extra (GPT-SoVITS's Japanese and Korean, IndexTTS-2.5's Japanese); `mizuoto doctor` lists the missing ones with their install command, see Optional extras."],[16948,"Some languages need packages that are not installed by default. Without them, text in those languages fails with the install command in the error's hint; `mizuoto doctor` lists the missing ones."],[8988,"Some shared files are archives (GPT-SoVITS's G2PW, NLTK data and Open JTalk dictionary): verified, unpacked into the folder, then deleted; verification and new downloads work on the unpacked files. Archive members cannot land outside the target folder."],[11326,"Source"],[8921,"Sources"],[12751,"sovits (CFM + vocoder) 29.6, gpt 1.8"],[13116,"sovits 0.73, gpt 0.38"],[4592,"sovits 0.73、gpt 0.38"],[15416,"SoVITS: a VITS decoder (coupling flow, HiFi-GAN)"],[6892,"SoVITS：VITS 解码器（耦合流、HiFi-GAN）"],[4227,"sovits（CFM + 声码器）29.6，gpt 1.8"],[4599,"sovits+t2s 0.83"],[13123,"sovits+t2s 0.83"],[14078,"sox, the ffmpeg program, soundfile"],[5554,"sox、ffmpeg 程序、soundfile"],[16395,"Speak"],[16820,"Speak"],[16822,"Speak"],[8821,"Speak `input` and answer with the audio"],[14977,"Speak and a project's cast show only what the chosen model takes, and keep what was set for another model so that choosing it again brings it back. The server refuses what a model does not take (an explicit request is never trimmed), so a hidden value that was sent would fail the synthesis. Hence one rule: **a value the form does not show is never sent.**"],[8536,"Speak and download"],[10114,"Speak text with a model and a voice. The result is kept in the outputs folder; `-o` also copies it."],[10172,"Speak with a voice made from a description; `--save-as` keeps the voice in the library."],[17021,"Speak with the dummy engine"],[14542,"Speaker similarity"],[14663,"Speaker similarity"],[9100,"Speaking"],[10058,"Speech"],[16269,"Speech"],[15871,"Speech recognition"],[15956,"Speech recognition"],[9328,"Speech recognition (`asr`)"],[9261,"Speech recognition (asr)"],[15055,"Speech recognition (Whisper, Paraformer)"],[12194,"Speech recognition is a native Whisper large-v3-turbo reproducing 0.1's pipeline (overlapping 30 s windows, 5-beam search, the seek loop inside each window, the merge)"],[15122,"Speech recognition is used inside Mizuoto, not offered as a synthesis model or through `GET /v1/models`."],[9163,"Speech recognition: `transcribe`"],[15656,"Speed"],[11219,"Speed without changing results: the attention dispatcher (sites, references, policies, backends, structured masks, probes), compute.fast, compute.compile, CUDA graphs for decoding steps, sync-free sampling, and the CPU's allocator and thread placement; which opt-in features are not bit-identical."],[12693,"Speed work on the inference and training code follows one rule: **the results do not change**. Every optimisation recorded here gives the same audio sample for sample, and the same losses and saved weights bit for bit, as the code before it on the CPU, where the engines' parity with upstream is established. On a GPU, \"the same\" means identical to the code before on the same GPU, driver, torch and settings. Faster paths that change the arithmetic are opt-in features, described in Acceleration; the user-facing settings are in Performance."],[12790,"Speed-up"],[12833,"Speed-up"],[12949,"Speed-up"],[13017,"Speed-up"],[3554,"Stable Diffusion 模型管理器"],[8857,"Stage"],[14148,"Stage"],[8846,"Stages"],[14806,"Stages"],[16528,"Stages"],[14881,"Stages must be re-runnable: each clears its own output folder first."],[14855,"Stages run in their own process, not in the server's: a run gives all its memory back when it ends, a crash in a stage cannot take the server down, and a stage may seed the process-wide generators (dropout masks and data shuffling draw from them in the upstream recipes) without touching anyone else's randomness."],[16658,"Standard"],[9716,"standard error (the terminal that started `mizuoto webui`)"],[5503,"Starlette 0.40 起 `FileResponse` 支持 Range，播放器可以拖动；uvicorn 要有 websockets 才能处理 WebSocket；typer 锁上限，因为命令行用到它的私有模块"],[14027,"Starlette 0.40's `FileResponse` honours Range, so the player seeks; uvicorn speaks WebSocket only with websockets installed; typer has an upper bound because the command line uses its private modules"],[9227,"Start on a background thread; return the web UI's address once listening"],[9129,"Start the job scheduler and the unloading of idle models"],[14265,"Start the request's streams again (an engine that reseeds per segment, as GPT-SoVITS's upstream did)"],[10646,"Start the server and open the web UI."],[17019