er."],[10680,"Where settings come from"],[16905,"Where the data lives"],[11015,"Where the engine runs: `auto`, `cpu`, `cuda:1`…; `<host>/<device>` (such as `gpu-box/cuda:0`) runs it on a remote host"],[9742,"where the engine runs: `auto`, `cpu`, `cuda:N` (NVIDIA, or AMD under ROCm), `xpu:N` (Intel), `mps` (Apple silicon); `<host>/<device>` runs it on a remote host (see Remote hosts). UI: **Device** on the engine's card"],[16001,"Where the files are"],[12665,"Where the time goes on the CPU"],[8874,"Where torch comes from, hence its build: another CUDA (`cu126` … `cu132`), ROCm (`rocm6.4` … `rocm7.2`) or `cpu` index of download.pytorch.org"],[14141,"Where torch comes from: a CUDA (`cu126` … `cu132`), ROCm (`rocm6.4` … `rocm7.2`) or `cpu` index"],[15954,"Where you start"],[15953,"Where you start, checking torch and the engines, downloading models, licence-gated engines, and the first real synthesis."],[16282,"Whether `mizuoto webui` opens a browser"],[11007,"Whether the engine is enabled"],[9727,"Which GPUs Mizuoto finds"],[16708,"Which models can use it"],[12468,"Which parts of a module may stay off the device and which are fixed"],[14144,"Which torch"],[14911,"While developing, `python scripts/dev.py dev` runs the API server and Vite together (`http://localhost:5173`); Vite proxies `/api` and `/ws` to `MIZUOTO_BACKEND` (default `http://127.0.0.1:7869`). When the API server restarts, the proxy's connection errors become one short line (`vite.config.ts`, tested in `devProxy.test.ts`). Setting up is in Development setup."],[7810,"Whisper large-v3-turbo"],[16334,"Whisper large-v3-turbo"],[9329,"Whisper large-v3-turbo; Paraformer-large (Chinese)"],[805,"Whisper large-v3-turbo；Paraformer-large（中文）"],[15581,"Whisper transcribes every one of them as the text (2.5 at 50 codes: one homophone). At an RTF over 1 the audio comes slower than it plays, so on that card IndexTTS 2 would pause between chunks; 100 codes (about 1.6 s of speech) is upstream's default and the better trade